}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/5403c4456e70af47be139d62ad2f78957794ce89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T06:22:29Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T06:22:29Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"message":"Add public storefront micro-frontend with product catalog\n\nNew lightweight Angular app (apps/storefront) serving as a public-facing\nproduct catalog. Businesses can enable a shareable link (/shop/{slug})\nwhere customers browse products without auth.\n\n- Scaffold storefront Angular 21 app (247KB initial, no PouchDB/ngrx)\n- Add public API endpoints (/api/v1/storefront/) with rate limiting\n- StorefrontService reads products from CouchDB via nano\n- Add slug + storefront_enabled columns to Business entity\n- Add storefront settings tab (slug, enable toggle) to Settings page\n- Update nginx config with /shop/* routing block\n- Add IStorefrontProduct/Business/Category shared types\n- Update CLAUDE.md with storefront architecture docs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d29b1ef1f5f3cf0818a828f21651a242b2f8563d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/d29b1ef1f5f3cf0818a828f21651a242b2f8563d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/5403c4456e70af47be139d62ad2f78957794ce89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/5403c4456e70af47be139d62ad2f78957794ce89","node_id":"C_kwDOSF4mKNoAKDU0MDNjNDQ1NmU3MGFmNDdiZTEzOWQ2MmFkMmY3ODk1Nzc5NGNlODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc","sha":"cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc"}],"sha":"5403c4456e70af47be139d62ad2f78957794ce89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/5403c4456e70af47be139d62ad2f78957794ce89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T05:03:16Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T05:03:16Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"message":"Add per-branch stock tracking with stock_by_branch map on products\n\n- New BranchStore with centralized branch CRUD and active branch selection\n- stock_by_branch: Record<string, number> on IProduct for per-location inventory\n- CatalogStore.updateBranchStock() helper for branch-aware stock mutations\n- TransactionStore passes branch_uuid through stock updates\n- StockTransferStore uses branch-specific stock for dispatch/receive/cancel\n- Branch selector in navbar (visible when branches exist)\n- Transaction form and POS show branch-specific stock availability\n- Products page shows stock breakdown per branch\n- Product form allows stock allocation per branch on creation\n- Branches component refactored to use BranchStore\n- Auto-migration for existing products without stock_by_branch\n- Demo seed allocates stock across 3 branches\n- Full i18n support (English + Bangla)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee655f0a5c69bb7d225bead18cf2d0f0c1758e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/ee655f0a5c69bb7d225bead18cf2d0f0c1758e71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/cb6f9bfd30112a13589e557ebb24c089e1891cdc","node_id":"C_kwDOSF4mKNoAKGNiNmY5YmZkMzAxMTJhMTM1ODllNTU3ZWJiMjRjMDg5ZTE4OTFjZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https:/