nk_account_uuid and mobile_tx_id fields to IExpense and ITransaction models\n- Add updateUser and updateBusiness methods to AuthStore\n- Add missing i18n keys for finance section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c9622075df4cebac3399449c7093402f1f1101a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/4c9622075df4cebac3399449c7093402f1f1101a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/a17046cf6f092f3d3acc76cbce1a3f5cfcdf9a61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/a17046cf6f092f3d3acc76cbce1a3f5cfcdf9a61","node_id":"C_kwDOSF4mKNoAKGExNzA0NmNmNmYwOTJmM2QzYWNjNzZjYmNlMWEzZjVjZmNkZjlhNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86","sha":"ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86"}],"sha":"a17046cf6f092f3d3acc76cbce1a3f5cfcdf9a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/a17046cf6f092f3d3acc76cbce1a3f5cfcdf9a61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T05:26:32Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T05:26:32Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"message":"Add Due List, Cash Adjustment, and Bank Transactions features\n\nDue List (/due-list):\n- Shows all parties with outstanding balances\n- Filter by receivable/payable, search by name/phone\n- Summary cards for total receivable, payable, and party count\n- Shows last transaction date per party\n\nCash Adjustment (/cash-adjustment):\n- Record manual cash in/out adjustments\n- Predefined reasons (cash short, excess, owner withdrawal, etc.)\n- Summary cards for total in, out, and net adjustment\n- Full CRUD with date validation\n\nBank Transactions (/bank):\n- Multiple bank account management with CRUD\n- Deposit, withdrawal, and transfer transactions\n- Auto-updates account balance on transaction add/delete\n- Insufficient balance check on withdrawals\n- Duplicate account number validation\n- Click account card to view its transactions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7137c1bddfcfa5222d5839807f929c763357a73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/d7137c1bddfcfa5222d5839807f929c763357a73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86","node_id":"C_kwDOSF4mKNoAKGFlMWYzMzZkMjk5MGFmYTVkNWRhZmVjZjRmMWI2MDMwODM3ZTFiODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/c61fc146250766fc53d060c49e340c003e6a31bc","sha":"c61fc146250766fc53d060c49e340c003e6a31bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/c61fc146250766fc53d060c49e340c003e6a31bc"}],"sha":"ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/ae1f336d2990afa5d5dafecf4f1b6030837e1b86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commits/c61fc146250766fc53d060c49e340c003e6a31bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T05:20:43Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T05:20:43Z","email":"155361435+omer-arafat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"omer-arafat"},"message":"Add proper form validation across all components\n\nLogin/Register:\n- Bangladesh phone format validation (01XXXXXXXXX)\n- OTP must be exactly 6 digits\n- Inline field-level error messages\n- Name minimum 2 characters (register)\n\nCreate Business:\n- Phone format validation\n- Name minimum length check\n\nUsers:\n- Phone format validation\n- Duplicate phone number check\n\nProducts:\n- Prices cannot be negative\n- Tax must be 0-100%\n- Stock cannot be negative\n- Expiry date must be after manufacturing date\n\nTransactions:\n- Date is required and cannot be future\n- Product selection required before adding line\n- Quantity must be > 0, price cannot be negative\n- Paid amount cannot be negative\n- Discount cannot exceed subtotal\n- Cheque ref required for cheque payments\n\nExpenses:\n- Date required and cannot be future\n- Category required\n- Item rate and quantity must be > 0\n- Cheque ref required for cheque payments\n- Duplicate category name check\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2756e9b8408370b9c978a7bfa742757d405bf3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/a2756e9b8408370b9c978a7bfa742757d405bf3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/c61fc146250766fc53d060c49e340c003e6a31bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a