, amount/paid/due totals\n- Purchase Report: date range + supplier filter, amount/paid/due totals\n- Day Book: all transactions chronologically with inflow/outflow\n- Party Statement: per-party ledger with running balance (debit/credit)\n- Stock Summary: product list with quantities, cost/sale valuation\n\nReports landing page redesigned with clickable navigation cards.\nRoutes use lazy-loaded children under /reports/*.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e730c3a0cbd6da46d7f875c8b6e970652f59c5a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/trees/e730c3a0cbd6da46d7f875c8b6e970652f59c5a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/git/commits/3d229138d3831e47cb09f5202f54861a652989ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155361435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/omer-arafat","id":155361435,"login":"omer-arafat","node_id":"U_kgDOCUKgmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omer-arafat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/arafatomer66/Gonok-Accounting/commit/3d229138d3831e47cb09f5202f54861a652989ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSF4mKNoAKDN