b.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/adab93adff470667f3c8e0eeef2ec714a39786f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:51:18Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:51:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Epic Q — supple composition: one answer, asked everywhere (#169)\n\nAn audit of how keel new, keel add, the presets and keel ui exercise\nthe composition model, and its remediation as roadmap epic Q (Q0.1–Q2.8)\nplus a cross-cutting review pass.\n\n- Phase 0: 500s carry their sentence; file conflicts, hidden\n  prerequisites and bad answers are coded refusals; page state no longer\n  poisons later picks; a preset switch keeps the dials; refusals stop\n  naming tags; the composition grid lands as a shrink-only ratchet.\n- Phase 1: Adapter.promotes / Vertical.reads and a pure planner read by\n  every menu, card and front door; prerequisites included automatically;\n  extras order-insensitive; keel add a b and --refresh; \"already there\"\n  is a note; one refusal vocabulary; readiness before the click; answers\n  scoped to their adapters; choices declare where they apply; composite\n  products point into their services.\n- Phase 2: preview reads answers as install does; a preset switch keeps\n  extras and answers; --no-agent-harness reaches the page; README.md and\n  .gitignore adopted on every stack; per-service extras for products;\n  the verticals matrix generated from the grid; one keel ui page for\n  both phases; nearest-id suggestions.\n\nRe-running the original audit: throwing cells 62 → 0, refusals naming a\nraw tag 262 → 0, extras offered then refused 19 → 0, keel add cards\nrefused on click 149 → 0. No manifest schema change; kernel untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015zHMPjpyjNqK3yu3zPQa5o","tree":{"sha":"ef577afcb891ab36cfdb8a86af211ebb6dd4fb81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/ef577afcb891ab36cfdb8a86af211ebb6dd4fb81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/adab93adff470667f3c8e0eeef2ec714a39786f0","verification":{"payload":"tree ef577afcb891ab36cfdb8a86af211ebb6dd4fb81\nparent c950bf94e54af1c72ecd997b989335fbac9ece75\nauthor Romain Goussu <rgoussu@gmail.com> 1790286678 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790286678 +0200\n\nEpic Q — supple composition: one answer, asked everywhere (#169)\n\nAn audit of how keel new, keel add, the presets and keel ui exercise\nthe composition model, and its remediation as roadmap epic Q (Q0.1–Q2.8)\nplus a cross-cutting review pass.\n\n- Phase 0: 500s carry their sentence; file conflicts, hidden\n  prerequisites and bad answers are coded refusals; page state no longer\n  poisons later picks; a preset switch keeps the dials; refusals stop\n  naming tags; the composition grid lands as a shrink-only ratchet.\n- Phase 1: Adapter.promotes / Vertical.reads and a pure planner read by\n  every menu, card and front door; prerequisites included automatically;\n  extras order-insensitive; keel add a b and --refresh; \"already there\"\