il":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"docs: the entrypoint pairing ships under both module layouts\n\nThe stack catalog, the JVM and TypeScript stack pages and the\nwalking-skeleton vertical all carried a \"ships under `basic` only for\nnow; composing under `modulith` is on the roadmap\" note. It no longer\nholds, and what replaces it is the fact a reader needs: under the\nmodulith an entrypoint brings a driving adapter into the bounded\ncontext as well as its own assembly.\n\n`docs/cli.md`''s `--with-peer-context` row stops enumerating the\nstacks that offer `--module-layout=modulith` — that is now every\nsingle-service stack — and says the peer is wired into both\nassemblies on a composed one. The roadmap records the item as\nshipped, with the three things the modulith needed that the basic\nlayout did not.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"3493916bd497203599cce99dcd6c13aa8d3b6372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/3493916bd497203599cce99dcd6c13aa8d3b6372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/dc70775c973dd87445af760ef0e6b0523d76fdce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/dc70775c973dd87445af760ef0e6b0523d76fdce","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKGRjNzA3NzVjOTczZGQ4NzQ0NWFmNzYwZWYwZTZiMDUyM2Q3NmZkY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e","sha":"4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e"}],"sha":"dc70775c973dd87445af760ef0e6b0523d76fdce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/dc70775c973dd87445af760ef0e6b0523d76fdce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:59:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"fix(claude-kit): the TypeScript runbook and product README name dev:rest\n\nThe composable-entrypoint work renamed the TypeScript root scripts per\nentrypoint — `start:cli`, `start:rest`, `dev:rest` — because `start`\nand `dev` were one name for two assemblies. Two emitted documents\nkept naming the old ones: the claude-kit runbook''s \"Run (dev)\" step\nand the fullstack product README''s `ts-http` run hint. Both print a\ncommand the emitted `package.json` no longer defines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"c7797fc9a318af48b184bc71ce6b8689444d884b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/c7797fc9a318af48b184bc71ce6b8689444d884b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDRkNWIyZjRlMzc5YTBkODJjYWE1NDZkMTVmMzRiOWY0YjljNDcyNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186","sha":"3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186"}],"sha":"4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/4d5b2f4e379a0d82caa546d15f34b9f4b9c4724e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:58:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"fix(walking-skeleton): one project identity across composed bootstraps\n\nA tag set carrying both `arch.cli` and `arch.server-http` resolves two\nentrypoint bootstraps, and they declare the same sticky questions —\n`basePackage`/`projectName` on the JVM, `npmScope`/`projectName` in\nTypeScript. Sticky memory is keyed per adapter, so the engine asked\nfor the project''s identity twice and nothing reconciled two different\nanswers.\n\nThe consequences are not cosmetic. On the JVM every module''s\n`<parent>` then names an artifactId the reactor root does not have and\nMaven refuses to read the project at all; Gradle keeps whichever\nbootstrap seeded the root first and silently drops the other answer.\nIn a TypeScript workspace the assembly depends on a scope the context\ndoes not publish, and the install the scaffold runs cannot resolve it.\n\n`Adapter.sharesAnswersWith` names the sibling whose recorded answers\ncount as this adapter''s sticky memory. The engine merges them under\nthe adapter''s own — own wins, so a reapply keeps what it had — which\nmeans the second bootstrap is neither asked again nor free to\ndisagree. Recording matters as much as borrowing: `foldAnswers`\nwrites the resolved value under this adapter''s id too, and the\nmanifest is what every downstream adapter reads. Without that half,\nthe bootstrap renders the right package while `observability` and\nfriends emit theirs under the untouched default — a project that\ncompiles and then fails to start its context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"07d40a4975f7ba242387b56c2a185e314d24a02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/07d40a4975f7ba242387b56c2a185e314d24a02c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDMyNzgxNDVkN2NkNzRjNjQzOTRlMDI5N2ExYmMxMTVjYzQ5MWExODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91","sha":"ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91"}],"sha":"3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/3278145d7cd74c64394e0297a1bc115cc491a186"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:56:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"fix(walking-skeleton): wire an added context into every assembly\n\n`jvm-peer-context` and `jvm-context` resolved the assembly they patch\nwith `tags.includes(''arch.cli'') ? cliRuntime : restRuntime`. That has\na wrong answer on a project carrying both entrypoints: it wires the\nCLI assembly and leaves the HTTP one with no binding for the new\ncontext''s handler. The result compiles, packages and starts — it\nsimply does not do half of what was asked for, which is the failure\nmode this adapter family exists to prevent.\n\n`jvmAssemblies` is the JVM sibling of `tsAssemblies` and of Go''s and\nRust''s `assembliesOf`: it answers \"which assemblies does this project\nhave\" from the arch tags, and both adapters now iterate it — the\nwiring class and its test render once per assembly, and the\ndependency patch, the seam-doc correction and each framework''s\nbinding follow. Empty is an error rather than a silent no-op, since a\nmodulith with no assembly is a tag set that cannot have got here.\n\nReachable because the combo stacks now offer the modulith layout, so\n`--with-peer-context` and `keel add module` meet a two-assembly\nproject for the first time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"7df8d20090dd0e3e9454b985cbe9a11cf4fbd59d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/7df8d20090dd0e3e9454b985cbe9a11cf4fbd59d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKGVlNWE0MDQ5YzBkMmIzZGQ4ODk4YmNkMzljZmI3Y2RkNDVjMWNkOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664","sha":"9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664"}],"sha":"ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/ee5a4049c0d2b3dd8898bcd39cfb7cdd45c1cd91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:51:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(stacks): scaffold the combo stacks on either module layout\n\nThe six JVM `*-cli-rest*` presets and `ts-cli-http` shipped without a\n`moduleLayouts` entry, so `--module-layout` was rejected on them and\n`layout.modulith` was unreachable through any named stack. Composing\ntwo entrypoints under the modulith is what made that a real choice\nrather than a rejected flag, so they now carry\n`moduleLayouts: MODULE_LAYOUTS` like `go-cli-http` and\n`rust-cli-http` already did.\n\nThat empties the exemption list `new-project.test.ts` guarded: every\nsingle-service stack now offers the dial. The branch that rejects it\nstays — a future stack shipping one layout must still say so rather\nthan silently accept a layout it cannot honour — and the test now\npins the invariant as \"every service stack offers the dial\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"986f70e52cb92728e9c723bb47a0c31bd9d8f045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/986f70e52cb92728e9c723bb47a0c31bd9d8f045"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDlkMTgwNjE3MTdkZjliMzI3YjExZGVmYzJmZGZkNWVmNDcyMGY2NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7","sha":"fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7"}],"sha":"9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/9d18061717df9b327b11defc2fdfd5ef4720f664"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:50:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(walking-skeleton): compose cli + rest entrypoints under the modulith\n\nA tag set carrying both `arch.cli` and `arch.server-http` already\nresolved both entrypoint bootstraps under `basic`; under the modulith\neach still rendered its own whole-file copy of the root files, so the\nsecond to resolve threw `ContributionConflictError` on a path the\nfirst had created. The two entrypoints are now composable under\neither layout, on the JVM and in TypeScript.\n\nThe modulith is not a mechanical port of the basic-layout work, and\nthree things are why:\n\n- **The seed is a bounded context, not a layer cake.** `basic` seeds\n  the domain trisection and each entrypoint appends its\n  `application/…` modules. Here the seed is `platform/kernel` plus\n  the context''s own hexagon — including the `user-side/service` seam\n  — and an entrypoint appends *two* things: a driving adapter inside\n  the context (`user-side/cli`, `user-side/api/{contract,adapters}`)\n  and an assembly under `application/`. The module list is\n  per-context, so it grows sideways as contexts are added rather than\n  downwards as layers are.\n- **The archive rename is unconditional.** Under `basic` it is a\n  Spring/Micronaut concern Quarkus''s packaging dodges. Under the\n  modulith leaf names repeat by construction — `contract` under both\n  `domain/` and `user-side/api/`, `cli` under both `application/` and\n  `user-side/` — and on Quarkus a colliding archive name puts an\n  assembly''s own jar among its dependencies.\n- **Micronaut''s reactor root needs its platform BOM imported**, where\n  `basic` needs none: the assembly parents `micronaut-parent`, every\n  other module parents the root, and Maven allows one parent.\n\n`jvm-shared-root-modulith.ts` holds that shape and shares the seed\nbuilders with `basic`, which is where the layouts genuinely agree.\nTypeScript needed no second module: its layouts differ by a `lint`\nscript, the dependency-cruiser devDependency behind it, and a README\ndescribing a context instead of a trisection — a branch, not a file.\nIts root scripts become `start:cli` / `start:rest` / `dev:rest` under\nthe modulith too, since `start` was one name for two assemblies.\n\nThe four per-arch `jvm-domain-modulith` trees collapse to two\nper-language ones on the richer REST shape, the same unification\n`basic` did: a CLI-only handler that never refuses and a REST handler\nthat does cannot both write one path.\n\nThe version-pin registry follows the content it guards — every pin\nwhose only home was a deleted template now points at the generator\nthat emits it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"6f86db1ed04a4796a08f250d7d37d743287aac44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/6f86db1ed04a4796a08f250d7d37d743287aac44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKGZlYTk0NmY3NmMzOWVmZDI1ZWUxYjgyNDY2NDc0ZGI5OGQzYjRkYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/542c3d6521aeb1d8caa27f6ad61043c7989b8e5b","sha":"542c3d6521aeb1d8caa27f6ad61043c7989b8e5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/542c3d6521aeb1d8caa27f6ad61043c7989b8e5b"}],"sha":"fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/fea946f76c39efd25ee1b82466474db98d3b4da7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/542c3d6521aeb1d8caa27f6ad61043c7989b8e5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:47:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T03:33:58Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"refactor(walking-skeleton): export the JVM root-file seed builders\n\nThe basic layout''s root files are generated rather than templated, so\ntwo entrypoints can upsert onto one path instead of each writing a\nwhole-file copy. The modulith needs the same trick over a different\ntree, and the two layouts emit the *same files*: a settings script\nwith a project name and a module list, one build script configuring\nevery subproject, a reactor pom with pinned plugins.\n\nSo the seed builders become the shared half — `gradleSettingsSeed`,\n`gradleBuildSeed`, `gradlePropertiesSeed`, `mavenPomSeed` and the\nidempotent text helpers — parameterised by what actually moves\nbetween layouts: the seeded module list, the comment explaining why\nthe Gradle group is path-derived, and whether the archive rename is\nneeded at all. Everything a layout does not share stays private to\nits own module.\n\nNo behaviour change: the emitted seeds and patch results are\nbyte-identical across all 24 (framework, arch, language, build\nsystem) combinations, checked by diffing the rendered patches against\nthe previous implementation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016wA9KZLpxeQ1QqghKKr8DE","tree":{"sha":"dc3927e7e14fe1b1dfc92c58cabc73d325539848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/dc3927e7e14fe1b1dfc92c58cabc73d325539848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/542c3d6521aeb1d8caa27f6ad61043c7989b8e5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub