il":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(version-currency): catch \"latest stable\" drift in emitted templates (#83)\n\nCloses #75. The binding spec says \"always latest stable\", but emitted\ntemplates pin framework and tool versions that rot silently. Two\npieces keep that honest: a per-family pin registry\n(assets/composition/version-pins.json) recording every pin, where it\nlives (glob + regex over the template trees and adapter sources) and\nthe upstream feed that knows the latest stable, guarded offline in\nverify by tests/version-pins.test.ts — which fails when the registry\nand templates disagree or when a sweep finds a pin-shaped string no\nentry claims — and an opt-in drift report (tests/currency/,\nKEEL_RUN_CURRENCY=1) run weekly by the version-currency workflow,\nnever on PRs, since an upstream release must not turn unrelated PRs\nred. Bumps stay human-reviewed and proved by the e2e grid. Rebasing\nover the landed ts-cli and persistence-dial work exercised the guard\nfor real: moved pins re-pointed and the new MariaDB driver/image,\nLiquibase image and ts-cli engines-floor pins claimed. Docs,\nCHANGELOG, and roadmap updated.","tree":{"sha":"9d8a85a7bffc3a9837db206ab165f45f01f5f7f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/9d8a85a7bffc3a9837db206ab165f45f01f5f7f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/854657e5938d790a17c378f76a26840465d99228","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d8a85a7bffc3a9837db206ab165f45f01f5f7f8\nparent 4d103ce76dc5064570a8e7026704f77dc8603308\nauthor Romain Goussu <rgoussu@gmail.com> 1787067512 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787067512 +0200\n\ntest(version-currency): catch \"latest stable\" drift in emitted templates (#83)\n\nCloses #75. The binding spec says \"always latest stable\", but emitted\ntemplates pin framework and tool versions that rot silently. Two\npieces keep that honest: a per-family pin registry\n(assets/composition/version-pins.json) recording every pin, where it\nlives (glob + regex over the template trees and adapter sources) and\nthe upstream feed that knows the latest stable, guarded offline in\nverify by tests/version-pins.test.ts — which fails when the registry\nand templates disagree or when a sweep finds a pin-shaped string no\nentry claims — and an opt-in drift report (tests/currency/,\nKEEL_RUN_CURRENCY=1) run weekly by the version-currency workflow,\nnever on PRs, since an upstream release must not turn unrelated PRs\nred. Bumps stay human-reviewed and proved by the e2e grid. Rebasing\nover the landed ts-cli and persistence-dial work exercised the guard\nfor real: moved pins re-pointed and the new MariaDB driver/image,\nLiquibase image and ts-cli engines-floor pins claimed. Docs,\nCHANGELOG, and roadmap updated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhHx4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZ3wQAG3mU9FEYbi3S51H62LUJJbr\nySV8crh+EhwL4l2Mgpl346zMa+gA4h8Wsi6VVfQoE+KUs/0TT35LqxANc7YY4BwC\n9Bx2TER6jZEJhzLsUL6cn4HWsqlVryjbqZAzwXKJPMZHDMCeqPd1WvgZGSrMmKq+\nlXsCEfjPrBs082zqlmf9TXfa8HkFqE5Mp4kfvI5cqcJ6zTg9xyPyYCLiUsT8d4Qf\n7w0IzAWX0PdGLydIwAT4kv0ebw1csu4m7HlmdnDawuONSgw8TXdl72ghk4aqwYHf\nT8Ms1FWD3Mw7zm8/Vgi1sAG1IWqWKbsXM+uG4VQFYpzK9fr3GpgLXiKLXkFW5gAl\nN8vCUvnH7735jIwR+mprSfIWsRTkSrBpAB42f4N5yvLzXIStqpFoZOIkLU2X+dhN\nYswXadiBT1tPWQTleBXBNdE+nBJOx7YkV6Vnut8ZywyQgSg+YdXpp5/T1/jlpS1n\n/47LcuZQG44CPCwS2f3pPGyN5cYZp51dsSiESNqzWm2btlzAgjjHD1sXzlnxzrfR\nG4F9ZjWc3r/KIP81pT0B3UfMSERpUjRwiKF3Z8gbXi/S81P+Do9pEJakEhHe6sO3\nVi1MyZqw//K46s98JgnMMOg7VqH2u3YhQQkwGQZUH5FIhquXnRGkT5VMjuAXYbfY\nwPjxYNyxmfwo3KcOJ9T9\n=RJiV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T15:38:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user