service build systems in composite stacks (#82)\n\nCloses #73. Composite stacks now ask the build-system question per\nservice instead of scaffolding each on its default: pin\nnon-interactively with `--build-system backend=maven,frontend=pnpm`\n(path=id pairs, comma-separated; unnamed services are prompted when\ninteractive and take their stack''s default otherwise). The choice is\nrecorded on the product manifest''s service refs, and the compose\nDockerfiles + product README follow it; the ci and distribution\nverticals follow via the service manifest''s pkg.* tag. Docs,\nCHANGELOG, and roadmap updated.","tree":{"sha":"6516cc3ced43678d2c2baee8d545f724ec8f41d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/6516cc3ced43678d2c2baee8d545f724ec8f41d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/a2fc1e0006847c7e13fb08510de0cbc753a1444f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6516cc3ced43678d2c2baee8d545f724ec8f41d9\nparent 2be1fe1381f393e7ad0136fc803959f08178bf3e\nauthor Romain Goussu <rgoussu@gmail.com> 1787066043 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787066043 +0200\n\nfeat(fullstack): per-service build systems in composite stacks (#82)\n\nCloses #73. Composite stacks now ask the build-system question per\nservice instead of scaffolding each on its default: pin\nnon-interactively with `--build-system backend=maven,frontend=pnpm`\n(path=id pairs, comma-separated; unnamed services are prompted when\ninteractive and take their stack''s default otherwise). The choice is\nrecorded on the product manifest''s service refs, and the compose\nDockerfiles + product README follow it; the ci and distribution\nverticals follow via the service manifest''s pkg.* tag. Docs,\nCHANGELOG, and roadmap updated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhHa8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyfgQAFJTfxvG11V3mQHNKRF5Dkvm\nOB9jKIphHdqANo87iK1NTpUs70XGJw4FdSrcFEyLKacA9dwMcQbWjGEcel/gTYRd\nTnWvn9lofF/lowLEB/CPvJzCt0OC0oK5iJEYC9hAjyoSP+8W