deployment descriptors'' environment; the\nmigrations-tool dial swaps the isolated migrations unit whole. New\ne2e coverage: the mariadb and liquibase persistence cells with their\nown shard entries in the matrix. Docs, CHANGELOG, and roadmap\nupdated.","tree":{"sha":"2b6661b7200d082cc937fb2d9ff463dc71525180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/2b6661b7200d082cc937fb2d9ff463dc71525180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/2be1fe1381f393e7ad0136fc803959f08178bf3e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b6661b7200d082cc937fb2d9ff463dc71525180\nparent d8ef3f58da10febba4d7651fe3d5b4b625e2243f\nauthor Romain Goussu <rgoussu@gmail.com> 1787065316 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787065316 +0200\n\nfeat(persistence): the engine and migrations-tool dials — MariaDB on the JVM, Liquibase on Go/Rust/TS (#85)\n\nCloses #72. The persistence vertical gains two sticky dials: the SQL\nengine (PostgreSQL default, MariaDB on the JVM) and the migrations\ntool (Flyway default, Liquibase on Go/Rust/TS), each recorded as a\nmanifest tag so later verticals read the choice instead of re-asking.\nThe engine dial swaps the driver, the dev-env service image, the JDBC\nURL shape and the deployment descriptors'' environment; the\nmigrations-tool dial swaps the isolated migrations unit whole. New\ne2e coverage: the mariadb and liquibase persistence cells with their\nown shard entries in the matrix. Docs, CHANGELOG, and roadmap\nupdated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhHPkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4CsQAI68ny/tjxMlssWvBX8P9fTP\n/dhjFvw99x8iMF387wsHtwfnFZWlbOc9ETQdS8n+71hcvNb6RN3z2QGmC8U2i2FK\nP1dCzhxdhjJRWNMt1bUKcDSNpqrVEvdHW0kvwjeWPL3/Imb7wEZRUAASSSNsdOJA\n4VwoMbWJlkK73kj/0TUDEkhoYf5pmlkXBy9cV8NJELHsj4KECqc5S+sSEi9TX577\neSmz6WmEdFLZ9e6dXDXxiIvQBrQiQZQfTO4gdDMjl+5SYAWEntLrGLX51utbOQ49\nlvUyL1HJpsEHl5GIo3ZRkQoiNq7CZ8soU8vKznqn+AjT8CiAhHyrNvSVB3aKzfJW\nIJs6gLYQey9y6h16gwgto/ssQNfugftpvM7SZaNXS9BrsC