1691e9ad58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/2a2c86462c2497f81d794071e974a91691e9ad58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b62bb4069aa044726571db254f07b777399a0528/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:16:59Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:16:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(iac): OpenTofu deploy target for the recorded deployment flavor (#79)\n\nRoadmap item M (closes #69). New `iac` vertical with one adapter\n`iac/deploy-target`, keyed on the `dist.container-image` tag the\ndistribution container family promotes. The deployment flavor is read\nfrom the recorded `deploy` answer, never re-asked: `compose` provisions\na Docker VM (engine via cloud-init, firewall, deploy loop over\n`DOCKER_HOST=ssh://…`), `helm` a managed Kubernetes cluster on the\nlatest stable version by data source. The cloud is a sticky dial —\nDigitalOcean (default) or Scaleway — promoted as a `cloud.*` tag beside\n`iac.opentofu`; hyperscalers deferred, Hetzner declined, on record in\nthe roadmap. Emitted tree follows binding spec §5: root `iac/`, remote\nstate by default with a one-shot bootstrap.sh, one state per\nenvironment via workspaces, no credential in any file. Docs, CHANGELOG,\nand roadmap updated.","tree":{"sha":"205a36f3b6d558d7a4a24e85d21232e2742ef06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/205a36f3b6d558d7a4a24e85d21232e2742ef06d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/b62bb4069aa044726571db254f07b777399a0528","verification":{"payload":"tree 205a36f3b6d558d7a4a24e85d21232e2742ef06d\nparent e25830d6f7a239da1300dd8e6418086404c0e3f9\nauthor Romain Goussu <rgoussu@gmail.com> 1787059019 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787059019 +0200\n\nfeat(iac): OpenTofu deploy target for the recorded deployment flavor (#79)\n\nRoadmap item M (closes #69). New `iac` vertical with one adapter\n`iac/deploy-target`, keyed on the `dist.container-image` tag the\ndistribution container family promotes. The deployment flavor is read\nfrom the recorded `deploy` answer, never re-asked: `compose` provisions\na Docker VM (engine via cloud-init, firewall, deploy loop over\n`DOCKER_HOST=ssh://…`), `helm` a managed Kubernetes cluster on the\nlatest stable version by data source. The cloud is a sticky dial —\nDigitalOcean (default) or Scaleway — promoted as a `cloud.*` tag beside\n`iac.opentofu`; hyperscalers deferred, Hetzner declined, on record in\nthe roadmap. Emitted tree follows binding spec §5: root `iac/`, remote\nstate by default with a one-shot bootstrap.sh, one state per\nenvironment via workspaces, no credential in any file. Docs, CHANGELOG,\nand roadmap updated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhFtLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnAcQADZ9Vyz76LZ3OVrmjU2oFshq\nT4MFgHkqWNW1wXVZ8+/+QSXRpdQgo5x6u3LIJ/7Z+HD2EdAHJQzlCHqyTZZ+j9FL\nJcjg