tion.md gains the SPA assets-image section; the verticals\ncatalog, compatibility matrix, prerequisites, fullstack page and\nREADME follow. CHANGELOG: Added for the distribution family and the\nSPA runtime config, Changed for the SPA image reshape (breaking, on\nan unreleased artifact shape). Roadmap E ticked with every deviation\nrecorded: the family sweep instead of Quarkus-first, the provider\nreuse, the flavor dials, the read-not-asked JVM flavor, the SPA\nenv.js mechanism, and Docker Swarm declined with reasons.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Qx8PSNjoJimKPLoCw2dJb","tree":{"sha":"43942182c1e039ff4023d3f987603c8b18dd6869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/43942182c1e039ff4023d3f987603c8b18dd6869"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/1fc0f8984689e437bf04f8290fdaa28243cdce95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/1fc0f8984689e437bf04f8290fdaa28243cdce95","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDFmYzBmODk4NDY4OWU0MzdiZjA0ZjgyOTBmZGFhMjgyNDNjZGNlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b","sha":"5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b"}],"sha":"1fc0f8984689e437bf04f8290fdaa28243cdce95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/1fc0f8984689e437bf04f8290fdaa28243cdce95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:00:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:23:38Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(distribution): container distribution for the server-shaped families\n\nkeel add distribution used to hard-fail on anything but a Gradle\nQuarkus CLI. Five adapters now cover build + release-channel for the\nserver shapes, one per stack family: jvm-container (all twelve JVM\nstacks; build system read from the manifest, jvm-vs-native read from\nthe dial containerization recorded rather than re-asked),\ngo-container, rust-container, ts-container (no host build — the image\ninstalls the sources) and wc-container (the SPA''s assets image).\nquarkus-cli-native is untouched for CLIs.\n\nThe release pipeline triggers on v* tags and builds the Dockerfile\nthe containerization vertical emitted — one image definition, no\nsecond build system — and refuses with the fix in the message when\nthat Dockerfile is missing. The provider is ci''s sticky dial, reused:\nGHCR under github-actions, the GitLab Container Registry under\ngitlab-ci (release jobs appended to .gitlab-ci.yml via the seeded\nupsert, so they join ci''s pipeline when it exists); a recorded ci.*\ntag wins over the question, so the two verticals can never emit for\ndifferent hosts.\n\nThe deployment flavor is a second sticky dial — compose (default)\nemits a production deploy/compose.yaml, helm a minimal deploy/chart/\n— each one template subtree, like the ci provider. Descriptors carry\nconfig exclusively via environment, exposing only variables the\nscaffolded service actually reads (DB_URL and the JVM''s split login\nunder persistence, OTEL_* under observability); the SPA deploys as a\nreal init container over a shared volume behind stock nginx, its API\nbase URL injected at deploy time. Docker Swarm is deliberately not a\nflavor — the roadmap records why. Every adapter promotes\ndist.container-image.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Qx8PSNjoJimKPLoCw2dJb","tree":{"sha":"8af4ff77a06059400f65b8861ea5643a14bff524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/8af4ff77a06059400f65b8861ea5643a14bff524"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDViMDk1OTFiNWMyNzhkZmQ0ZTRjNDA4NGU2OGQ1YjExMTRhY2Q3NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a","sha":"7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a"}],"sha":"5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/5b09591b5c278dfd4e4c4084e68d5b1114acd74b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:00:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:23:38Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(fullstack): serve the product SPA from an init-populated volume\n\nproduct-compose migrates to the assets-image shape the\ncontainerization vertical just established: the frontend image builds\nthe bundle and becomes an init container populating a named volume\n(clear-then-copy + env.js from the environment), and an unmodified\nofficial nginx serves the volume. The /api proxy target is no longer\na hostname baked into a custom image — the SPA config mounts as an\nenvsubst template into the stock image, and compose passes\nBACKEND_URL (defaulting to the sibling service), so the backend is an\nattached resource picked at deploy time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Qx8PSNjoJimKPLoCw2dJb","tree":{"sha":"a733815783b61a47ec7f2b165d113a1653e154e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/a733815783b61a47ec7f2b165d113a1653e154e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKDdkOTFkMjE5MjZiYWYwNTdhM2NmMmEzYTdkNTFkNGEyY2JlZGM3M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103","sha":"b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103"}],"sha":"7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/7d91d21926baf057a3cf2a3a7d51d4a2cbedc73a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:00:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:23:38Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(gateway): deploy-time runtime config for the SPA\n\nA static bundle cannot read env at runtime, so the API base URL used\nto be baked at build time (VITE_API_BASE_URL) — a rebuild per\nenvironment, which 12-factor forbids. The gateway now emits\npublic/env.js publishing window.__ENV__ (dev default /api), patches\nindex.html to load /env.js before the module bundle, and the\nassembly reads it ahead of the Vite-baked fallback. At deploy time\nthe assets image''s entrypoint rewrites env.js in the served volume\nfrom the environment: one bundle, every environment, no rebuild.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Qx8PSNjoJimKPLoCw2dJb","tree":{"sha":"6093709e8bca7eb4883573a1849e7e21e0b37f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/trees/6093709e8bca7eb4883573a1849e7e21e0b37f96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/git/commits/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14975619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev","id":14975619,"login":"rgoussu-dev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTc1NjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rgoussu-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103","node_id":"C_kwDOSGEt5toAKGI2Zjc1OTE3NmYxZDk4MzViOThiMmE4ZThjMjNmNTY0OGYyYmUxMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commit/b4f7184f2e2dd8d0dc4a53b74647ce4f8317ea7c","sha":"b4f7184f2e2dd8d0dc4a53b74647ce4f8317ea7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b4f7184f2e2dd8d0dc4a53b74647ce4f8317ea7c"}],"sha":"b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b6f759176f1d9835b98b2a8e8c23f5648f2be103"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rgoussu-dev/Keel/commits/b4f7184f2e2dd8d0dc4a53b74647ce4f8317ea7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:00:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T03:23:38Z","email":"rgoussu@gmail.com","name":"Romain Goussu"},"message":"feat(containerization)!: the SPA image becomes an init-container assets image\n\nwc-spa-image used to bake the Vite bundle onto nginx. The image now\ncarries only the bundle; its entrypoint clears a mounted volume\n(stale files from the previous release must not survive), copies the\nbundle in, templates env.js from the environment, and exits. Serving\nis deploy-time wiring, emitted as compose.yaml: the assets image runs\nas an init container (restart ''no'', nginx gated on\nservice_completed_successfully) and an unmodified official nginx\nserves the named volume with the history-API-fallback config mounted\nread-only.\n\nThe bundle''s lifecycle decouples from the server''s — a frontend\nrelease replaces the assets image and re-runs it; nginx never\nrebuilds — and the deploy-time env.js is what lets one bundle serve\nevery environment.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the emitted artifact shape (unreleased) — the SPA\nDockerfile no longer produces a serving image.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Qx8PSNjoJimKPLoCw2dJb","tree