tps://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kr1sal","id":68711982,"login":"kr1sal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzExOTgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kr1sal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kr1sal/sashecka/commits/f0059d880b64f2b03fa98095557c6f90bcb25931/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T20:46:26Z","email":"kirillivanov523@gmail.com","name":"kr1sal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T20:46:26Z","email":"kirillivanov523@gmail.com","name":"kr1sal"},"message":"fix(ai-generated): resolve security, data-integrity and UX bugs\n\n- delete_user now cascades deletion of owned groups and their accesses (FK safety in PostgreSQL)\n- JWT auth lookup restricted to email only, removing username ambiguity\n- grants values validated against allowed set (read/write/delete) in create/update group\n- duplicate user_id=null accesses in group payload now return 422 instead of silent discard\n- update_group and delete_group use selectinload to avoid lazy N+1 queries\n- fix Mapped[str | None] type annotation on Group.description\n- fix common_access type annotation (UserGroupAccess instead of schema types)\n- env vars now take priority over .env file (standard convention)\n- remove password.trim() in api-client login (passwords must not be trimmed)\n- GroupPage: useRef guard prevents form reset on background refetch\n- GroupPage: stable React key for access rows (no index)\n- GroupPage: confirm dialog before group deletion\n