eDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/ccdf01900d7bfa08f53aaac701dba8cb11344479/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T01:06:53Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T01:06:53Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"Bring DASHBOARD + CLI-DASHBOARD docs in sync with shipped substrate\n\n- design/DASHBOARD.md: note the pre-Stage-1 additions (vocabulary,\n  OCC, dry-run binding validation, layout override on resolve); update\n  the `/ui/resolve` body spec to include `layout`; expand the\n  client-parity paragraph to list all shipped fixtures + CLI commands.\n- testing/CLI-DASHBOARD.md: four Studio routes including\n  /pages/:id/edit; dry_run now validates bindings and $page keys;\n  envelope caveat (flow-engine msg shape) for table columns;\n  --expected-generation + `generation_mismatch` in editing recipes\n  and failure table; `[object Object]` → `.payload` troubleshooting\n  row.\n- sessions/DASHBOARD-BUILDER.md: top of handoff notes now points the\n  next session at the three updated docs in the right reading order.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cbc081a8a9ae4ece9a39ca8128c27fa51907839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/trees/8cbc081a8a9ae4ece9a39ca8128c27fa51907839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/commits/ccdf01900d7bfa08f53aaac701dba8cb11344479","verificatio