 page button creates a ui.page at root, seeds a minimal layout,\n  jumps straight to the builder\n- Count badge in header + hint explaining the kind-based filter when\n  the list looks empty unexpectedly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f5e20f3d64ce01da164295bb12cce3425186646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/trees/0f5e20f3d64ce01da164295bb12cce3425186646"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/commits/c56e1a2c04a198104c532fac34056b57dd90b3a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/us/commit/c56e1a2c04a198104c532fac34056b57dd90b3a5","node_id":"C_kwDOSGa8rdoAKGM1NmUxYTJjMDRhMTk4MTA0YzUzMmZhYzM0MDU2YjU3ZGQ5MGIzYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/us/commit/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4","sha":"5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4"}],"sha":"c56e1a2c04a198104c532fac34056b57dd90b3a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/c56e1a2c04a198104c532fac34056b57dd90b3a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:49:39Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:49:39Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"Wire OCC-guarded autosave + server dry-run into page builder\n\nSubstrate: /ui/resolve accepts an optional `layout` override on\ndry-run so the validator can evaluate the in-flight editor buffer\nrather than the persisted slot.\n\nFrontend: validator merges local parse + server dry-run issues;\nautosave debounces (800ms) through writeSlot with expectedGeneration;\n409 flips the store into a conflict state; non-dismissable banner\nforces reload or export.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb1a74838e973c80d641c36e837a94b209721af2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/trees/fb1a74838e973c80d641c36e837a94b209721af2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/commits/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/us/commit/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4","node_id":"C_kwDOSGa8rdoAKDU1NTFhZWZiNzhlZGRkYTNiZmRhZGU1MTBmNmNhMWZlOWRjNjZlZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev/us/commit/4a7e6a3c0a8954d61e3e1035a8bcafa41e8ec24c","sha":"4a7e6a3c0a8954d61e3e1035a8bcafa41e8ec24c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/4a7e6a3c0a8954d61e3e1035a8bcafa41e8ec24c"}],"sha":"5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/5551aefb78eddda3bfdade510f6ca1fe9dc66ed4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18637436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NubeDev","id":18637436,"login":"NubeDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjM3NDM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NubeDev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/commits/4a7e6a3c0a8954d61e3e1035a8bcafa41e8ec24c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:43:47Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:43:47Z","email":"aidan@enviroservices.com.au","name":"NubeDev"},"message":"Wire Monaco editor + local validation in page builder\n\nJSON editor drives the store on every change; debounced validator in\npersistence/ parses the buffer, reports issues (line-pinned for JSON\nerrors, structural for shape), and Monaco projects those issues as\nmodel markers. Validation list strip under the split shows the same\nissues in readable form.\n\nServer-side binding validation (/ui/resolve --dry-run against the\ncandidate buffer) lands with save support in the next pass — it needs\nan inline-layout override on the resolve endpoint to evaluate the\ndraft rather than the persisted slot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"918328007aadfa983065ff109a886a2d9f7dc2e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/trees/918328007aadfa983065ff109a886a2d9f7dc2e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NubeDev/us/git/commi