mmits/77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003"}],"sha":"153c499442d82b4c77b11d7fc6ed4703be11597d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/153c499442d82b4c77b11d7fc6ed4703be11597d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12147465?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahesh-sangawar","id":12147465,"login":"mahesh-sangawar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTQ3NDY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:56:27Z","email":"mayu.b14@gmail.com","name":"Mahesh Sangawar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T01:56:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(mark8ly): fail when the two marketplace-api charts drift apart (#1323)\n\nThe admin and storefront deployments run the SAME binary and read the same\nconfig struct. They differ only in which routes they serve and four\ndeliberately app-specific settings. Every other environment variable has to\nbe in both.\n\nThat has failed three times, each time disabling a feature that looked\ncorrect in review and in the code:\n\n  - MARKETPLACE_GCS_SIGNER_SA_EMAIL, admin only (#1293) — buyer artwork\n    uploads could not be signed\n  - MARKETPLACE_PRIVATE_GCS_BUCKET, likewise\n  - MARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL, likewise (#1322) — the 2D mockup\n    composite silently rendered for no buyer, for days\n\nNone of them crash. The mockup mapper correctly drops the mockup when the\nbase URL is empty, because a relative path would 404 against the\nstorefront''s own origin — so a misconfigured deployment and a product with\nno mockup configured are indistinguishable from outside. Helm renders,\nArgo syncs, pods are Ready, and the feature is gone.\n\nSo this asserts the property that actually broke: a variable added to one\nchart was added to the other. The four real differences are listed in\nINTENTIONAL with the reason each is app-specific, rather than inferred from\nwhatever the charts happen to say today.\n\nTwo tests, both watched failing before being trusted:\n\n  - reintroducing the #1322 omission reports MARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL\n    as \"in admin, MISSING from storefront\"\n  - adding an allowlisted variable to both charts reports the entry as stale,\n    so the exception list cannot quietly grow into permission for the next\n    omission\n\nThe first test also asserts it found more than five variables per chart. A\nregex that silently matched nothing would otherwise pass forever while\nchecking nothing, which is the same class of failure as the drift itself.","tree":{"sha":"d052f3ebdb9553d661e36fb190f93bb552d0486c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/trees/d052f3ebdb9553d661e36fb190f93bb552d0486c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/commits/77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003","verification":{"payload":"tree d052f3ebdb9553d661e36fb190f93bb552d0486c\nparent 82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118\nauthor Mahesh Sangawar <mayu.b14@gmail.com> 1791338187 +1100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791338187 +1100\n\ntest(mark8ly): fail when the two marketplace-api charts drift apart (#1323)\n\nThe admin and storefront deployments run the SAME binary and read the same\nconfig struct. They differ only in which routes they serve and four\ndeliberately app-specific settings. Every other environment variable has to\nbe in both.\n\nThat has failed three times, each time disabling a feature that looked\ncorrect in review and in the code:\n\n  - MARKETPLACE_GCS_SIGNER_SA_EMAIL, admin only (#1293) — buyer artwork\n    uploads could not be signed\n  - MARKETPLACE_PRIVATE_GCS_BUCKET, likewise\n  - MARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL, likewise (#1322) — the 2D mockup\n    composite silently rendered for no buyer, for days\n\nNone of them crash. The mockup mapper correctly drops the mockup when the\nbase URL is empty, because a relative path would 404 against the\nstorefront''s own origin — so a misconfigured deployment and a product with\nno mockup configured are indistinguishable from outside. Helm renders,\nArgo syncs, pods are Ready, and the feature is gone.\n\nSo this asserts the property that actually broke: a variable added to one\nchart was added to the other. The four real differences are listed in\nINTENTIONAL with the reason each is app-specific, rather than inferred from\nwhatever the charts happen to say today.\n\nTwo tests, both watched failing before being trusted:\n\n  - reintroducing the #1322 omission reports MARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL\n    as \"in admin, MISSING from storefront\"\n  - adding an allowlisted variable to both charts reports the entry as stale,\n    so the exception list cannot quietly grow into permission for the next\n    omission\n\nThe first test also asserts it found more than five variables per chart. A\nregex that silently matched nothing would otherwise pass forever while\nchecking nothing, which is the same class of failure as the drift itself.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxabLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAn4gQAIwdM9MEpc5m7a3jtW9zACYi\nN60MDF6ONYvW1KSmuAD/EXz3IBxoM2JuwXP5Ko8kXdgbLOVSBm/RWfvwoXfIm3DJ\nPYqwQsTbzuW/3po3EEYXJlleh9r2TSJpgWys16GvbjkPEkRYHUFqQTYMY1OuRS8C\njsZ3GYSVWUCztyhwJkekbxRgKsMsPvn0lYUo/iBatkCn1WTGFbsiOVFYUWXxuljR\nNt2v1kjQ8yPCeH87H7paRzZa7qg60DqbeuMZlUSdPETxEC1UnxdvjUJE7EUXSIyQ\n4W+ZFnv53ciMN6OrP34IRdOMONaTbEwQ5K9oK/MARmkfw62IZEzbYMrLh0UYXMnv\nJP5dA3y3+GnK6H0dztXU+eLBCC+8fX+nIkMwNiZv6gqkewNAiZPruxmFzpZl6MPM\n3JiLJ3yOPTlmHxS8p73D0Y3Yhj+b/dSht3EmWKMLr1CTinjRWeQIdw3FVJGG2OT5\nnLOIxhEJS4C3Tcx7Wsr5Nq4NFQTbTTBAjCI+sJtY57aajUS83GxnwALJlC66MTN4\nLJFEYs9d1GzeLp3jo4oeD8myUBl/67lwOHuwze6LLg0QNWveVs+DoYxlOzhdqbpD\nmOWXXLdz9bKHZF8wxtc+Bt4Qbjxk2b0VNVuDmLrrK1LPm/qyaXF8eGm6RU9DA2YO\nYsWnw944loCV+5SoB1MF\n=FzZ4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T01:56:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commit/77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003","node_id":"C_kwDOSGd6e9oAKDc3YTQzNTFiMWIyN2QxMjAyMGM3Yjk1MWNiOGM2MzhjYzZkZjYwMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commit/82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118","sha":"82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118"}],"sha":"77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/77a4351b1b27d12020c7b951cb8c638cc6df6003"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12147465?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mahesh-sangawar","id":12147465,"login":"mahesh-sangawar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTQ3NDY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:00:34Z","email":"mayu.b14@gmail.com","name":"Mahesh Sangawar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T15:00:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mark8ly): give the storefront the media base URL it needs for mockups (#1322)\n\nThe 2D composite (mark8ly#966) renders a merchant''s mockup photograph\nwith the buyer''s artwork inside it. The storefront turns the field''s\nmockup_storage_key into a fetchable URL using\nMARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL — and the storefront pod never had it.\nOnly the admin chart did.\n\nSo the mapper dropped the mockup, which is the correct behaviour (a\nrelative path would 404 against the storefront''s own origin) and is\nindistinguishable from \"no mockup configured\". The merchant sets one,\nsaves it, and the buyer sees nothing.\n\nThird time this shape has bitten in this feature: the storefront chart\nalso lacked MARKETPLACE_GCS_SIGNER_SA_EMAIL (#1293) and the private\nbucket name. The two marketplace-api charts are near-identical\ndeployments of the same binary and drift silently, because a missing\noptional env var degrades quietly by design.\n\nSame value the admin chart carries.","tree":{"sha":"374b4009370337aca3ff7d45b4e07d8dd2c38653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/trees/374b4009370337aca3ff7d45b4e07d8dd2c38653"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/commits/82a66776cebcdb8f45c6da6c211006ffdb429118","verification":{"payload":"tree 374b4009370337aca3ff7d45b4e07d8dd2c38653\nparent 95f58739fee19283dc60fa5cec51b217cb9dd6ed\nauthor Mahesh Sangawar <mayu.b14@gmail.com> 1791212434 +1100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791212434 +1100\n\nfix(mark8ly): give the storefront the media base URL it needs for mockups (#1322)\n\nThe 2D composite (mark8ly#966) renders a merchant''s mockup photograph\nwith the buyer''s artwork inside it. The storefront turns the field''s\nmockup_storage_key into a fetchable URL using\nMARKETPLACE_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL — and the storefront pod never had it.\nOnly the admin chart did.\n\nSo the mapper dropped the mockup, which is the correct behaviour (a\nrelative path would 404 against the storefront''s own origin) and is\nindistinguishable from \"no mockup configured\". The merchant sets one,\nsaves it, and the buyer sees nothing.\n\nThird time this shape has bitten in this feature: the storefront chart\nalso lacked MARKETPLACE_GCS_SIGNER_SA_EMAIL (#1293) and the private\nbucket name. The two marketplace-api charts are near-identical\ndeployments of the same binary and drift silently, because a missing\noptional env var degrades quietly by design.\n\nSame value the admin chart carries.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw7uSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwzUQAGbkJ5FAlWGWTkitMqXMGuYO\n52/FvfckFEV6g+kX6umtjpC3hmAkhLuZBrxXkDED/bXP5CSu6HgyPAEK1QnREeEJ\nj9g+cRiGSVhuuA318MGLiOUQW0m8ApqRyW6ScZKQUeHiccd0rKdzl0Qqmb2eZGEh\n7x3Iq+bT3xtXZIGxiMnKnKk7Rutb1XscDI8FAFcalzMoMhvVYa1VyT7BxJ5IenQZ\nSoSvwQeiC5jNfpq184AeOrFq60VnAJVWiufjcgmaHd3gcs9WocHh7ENpICUerjYM\nvWKEOL5Oieq8fmi9r2RbkCSajmOKuS2rlv/B3xXQiSGWON/ENpvIsX9trfgiruKI\nAAuP7NmQEOArjxGwLNmKfbnDguGEbe352vVDXKxHnd48BO+RF7kEPQR3t2nRy2gE\nmxCoy/T3NdRwgys6GzfWgBxhMYqgoMoXZuiBd231Un3hJAFv9WxkZ1ecYK457U+4\n05QpJBSz3HTejA5iEyR6HWb5XCfTGtLeKyYVoGKtmDfOwob4yKtoF4cDOwHV7HN7\nMDtbiQGzChJw3jMrgpBka9ofwEMQrniZSCc1lawCipbQs0Os+VRxZqnX5b39MQGu\nCOGtY7zVkTWhvNjzpZvO05hhsGgEVyM7KhExCY1+BjDj3Vz2yXwANTm6R0yF1qPW\nmFi/NVSjQQNYSS4FjGo3\n=J357\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T15:00:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl