angawar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mahesh-sangawar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/commits/865815362e09b23f82bcf5cd116b8a0a73c3474a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:48:04Z","email":"mayu.b14@gmail.com","name":"Mahesh Sangawar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:48:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(postiz): temp-unlock registration for team member onboarding (#1258)\n\nPostiz has no per-address allowlist, so onboarding a new member means opening signup, having them sign in, and re-locking immediately after. Same unlock/re-lock pair as 99871604 -> 75544a27. Email is disabled on this deployment, so there is no invitation mail. Revert as soon as the account exists.","tree":{"sha":"792680ea52900ca0e2ef2b41050db4c8d0cbcf39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/trees/792680ea52900ca0e2ef2b41050db4c8d0cbcf39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tesserix/tesserix-k8s/git/commits/865815362e09b23f82bcf5cd116b8a0a73c3474a","verification":{"payload":"tree 792680ea52900ca0e2ef2b41050db4c8d0cbcf39\nparent 3f61c948fd9ee762161c2c84e5826e8f8a934a53\nauthor Mahesh Sangawar <mayu.b14@gmail.com> 1790747284 +1000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790747284 +1000\n\nchore(postiz): temp-unlock registration for team member onboarding (#1258)\n\nPostiz has no per-address allowlist, so onboarding a new member means opening signup, having them sign in, and re-locking immediately after. Same unlock/re-lock pair as 99871604 -> 75544a27. Email is disabled on this deployment, so there is no invitation mail. Revert as soon as the account exists.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvKKUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANn4QADnkfoSX+V1Ji1h6jeR3f1/6\n7bay+l343iiKFXzdxPwccrBJ7Y6ZHyWzlvTs