//github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/a8cd0e8e963ff8dda6f3e2fc596d30783a08835a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:39:15Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:39:15Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"message":"Add the provider setup runbook and record current release state\n\nContinues ADMIN2_GROWTH_HANDOFF_2026-08-14.md with every remaining step\nwritten as a runnable command, secrets left as placeholders.\n\nRecords what changed since the handoff was written:\n- PR #54 conflict resolved; Admin deployed to production from the root\n  config, which clears the errored deployment that was blocking domain\n  assignment; admin.detourtrips.com attached and awaiting one A record.\n- The publishing-loop sender is implemented, so step 7 is now configuration\n  rather than development.\n- The served Admin bundle was scanned directly (not local dist) and carries\n  no privileged credential.\n\nTwo findings worth acting on:\n- detourtrips.com serves an older build than this branch: /privacy and\n  /terms 404 in production but are built here (sitemap 9 vs 11 entries).\n  Nothing links to them, so no broken links, but the live site collects\n  lead PII with no reachable privacy policy.\n- Admin is publicly reachable with ADMIN_REQUIRE_MFA=false and no Vercel\n  Deployment Protection, so a password is the only control on an\n  owner-role console. Documented with two ways to close it.\n\nAlso documents that supabase config push must not be used for the hosted\nAuth URLs, since config.toml intentionally holds the local values.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-flow <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"4635713d63c47ec856da502e6ce41c9ab0116099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/trees/4635713d63c47ec856da502e6ce41c9ab0116099"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/commits/a8cd0e8e963ff8dda6f3e2fc596d30783a08835a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/a8cd0e8e963ff8dda6f3e2fc596d30783a08835a","node_id":"C_kwDOSGlBkNoAKGE4Y2QwZThlOTYzZmY4ZGRhNmYzZTJmYzU5NmQzMDc4M2EwODgzNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981","sha":"7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981"}],"sha":"a8cd0e8e963ff8dda6f3e2fc596d30783a08835a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/a8cd0e8e963ff8dda6f3e2fc596d30783a08835a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:24:20Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:24:20Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"message":"Close the publishing loop with a Vercel deployment webhook\n\n`content-deployment-webhook` relayed a Sanity publish to the Vercel deploy\nhook and recorded `building`, but nothing ever reported whether the build\nlanded. The status-callback receiver existed and was tested; the sender\ndescribed in apps/studio/docs/publishing.md was never written, so every\npublish stopped at `building` and \"one publish leads to one tracked\nsuccessful deployment\" was unreachable.\n\nAdds `vercel-deployment-webhook`, which Vercel calls directly:\n\n- Verifies Vercel''s raw-body hex HMAC-SHA1 `x-vercel-signature`\n  (`verifyVercelSignature`). SHA-1 is Vercel''s scheme; the digest is only\n  compared against a locally computed one.\n- Maps deployment.succeeded/ready/promoted → ready, .error → failed,\n  .canceled → cancelled, .created → building. Untracked event types are\n  acknowledged as a no-op so enabling extra triggers cannot corrupt state,\n  and so Vercel does not retry something we will never accept.\n- Scopes to VERCEL_MARKETING_PROJECT_ID and the production target.\n- Writes through the existing upsert_content_deployment_event_tx, so\n  transition rules, idempotency and the event log are unchanged.\n\nCorrelation needed a resolver: the deploy-hook response returns a *job* id\nwhile the webhook reports a *deployment* id, so the id we stored is never\nthe one that comes back. `resolve_content_deployment_for_vercel` claims the\noldest publish still pending within a bounded window (FOR UPDATE SKIP\nLOCKED) and stamps the deployment id onto it; later events for that build\nmatch directly. Deploys with no pending publish — a git push, a manual\nredeploy — resolve to nothing and are ignored.\n\nVerified against a live Postgres: requested → claimed → ready with\ncompleted_at set, duplicate delivery idempotent, second event correlating\nto the same row, unrelated deploy id resolving to not-found.\n\n14 new Deno tests (edge suite 76 → 90). The x-detour-signature /\nCONTENT_STATUS_SECRET path stays supported for manual replay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-flow <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"c31b864dc29adaa81b4338e145e5e46916f5973c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/trees/c31b864dc29adaa81b4338e145e5e46916f5973c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/commits/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981","node_id":"C_kwDOSGlBkNoAKDcyODA3MjVmMmRjYmFlNDdiZTg3YjYyNWY4NzEyNmJmY2QzOGQ5ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/75639d020b8f9011df7983316e1a4205a9faa5bd","sha":"75639d020b8f9011df7983316e1a4205a9faa5bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/75639d020b8f9011df7983316e1a4205a9faa5bd"}],"sha":"7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/7280725f2dcbae47be87b625f87126bfcd38d981"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/75639d020b8f9011df7983316e1a4205a9faa5bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:09:42Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T19:09:54Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"message":"Merge origin/main into codex/admin-2-growth-platform\n\nResolves the dependency-manifest conflicts introduced by the Dependabot\ngroup bump on main (#53). All conflicts were confined to package.json,\napps/admin/package.json and package-lock.json.\n\nResolution:\n- apps/admin: keep react-router-dom ^7.18.2 (satisfies main''s ^7.0.0\n  requirement); take main''s postcss ^8.5.25 devDependency floor.\n- root: keep this branch''s workspaces list, scripts, engines and\n  postcss 8.5.26 override (newer than main''s 8.5.10); restore main''s\n  `tar: 6.2.1` override, which the branch had dropped. tar already\n  resolved to 6.2.1 either way, so the lockfile is unchanged by it.\n- package-lock.json: taken from this branch and edited only to track\n  the admin postcss range. Verified in sync with `npm ci`. main''s other\n  bumps (brace-expansion 1.1.18, fast-uri 3.1.5, undici 6.28.0) were\n  already present at equal or newer versions.\n\nValidated on the merge result: npm ci, type-check, lint, build, test,\ntest:edge (76 passed), studio:test, security:admin-bundle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-flow <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"9192c8a324f7457edba40158f0f474a28c6da79b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/trees/9192c8a324f7457edba40158f0f474a28c6da79b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/commits/75639d020b8f9011df7983316e1a4205a9faa5bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u