://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/f51adfcb5c979c1f4fff75df0602657680d555ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSGlBkNoAKGY1MWFkZmNiNWM5NzljMWY0ZmZmNzVkZjA2MDI2NTc2ODBkNTU1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commit/66aa541caa35ac4f4f37816bd75aeee7129ee3b3","sha":"66aa541caa35ac4f4f37816bd75aeee7129ee3b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/66aa541caa35ac4f4f37816bd75aeee7129ee3b3"}],"sha":"f51adfcb5c979c1f4fff75df0602657680d555ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/f51adfcb5c979c1f4fff75df0602657680d555ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84905312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GauravKumar9920","id":84905312,"login":"GauravKumar9920","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTA1MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GauravKumar9920","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/commits/32f2cf21c844204c3962a6b8444a61e7127a5a3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:52:05Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:52:05Z","email":"84905312+GauravKumar9920@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gaurav Kumar"},"message":"feat: trip fit, party shape, and split pricing\n\nImplement the complete trip fit, party composition, and split pricing system:\n\n**Core changes:**\n- Add age_band and party_type to traveler profile and layovers\n- Widen max party size from 3 to 4 travelers\n- Split itinerary pricing into base_cost + per-person buddy_cost\n- Replace time fit chip implementation with semantic tokens\n\n**Migrations (4 new):**\n- traveler_trip_shape: Add age_band/party_type columns with constraints\n- booking_party_cap: Extend num_travelers check to 1..4 (NOT VALID)\n- itinerary_base_cost: Add base_cost column, replace pricing constraint\n- traveler_trip_rpcs: Recreate onboarding/layover RPCs with new fields\n\n**Types & API:**\n- BookingRequest now derives all trip facts from active layover (no more redundant fields)\n- Itinerary includes base_cost; TravelerProfile/Layover include new trip metadata\n- New updateMyActiveLayover() and enhanced travelerProfile patch API\n\n**UI Components (8 new):**\n- NationalityPicker: 251-country searchable picker (replaces 16-chip row)\n- DateOrTimeField: Unified date/time input for web and native\n- TimeFitChip: Semantic fit signal (green/yellow/red) with theme-aware colors\n- TripSummaryCard: Read-only booking summary with edit affordance\n- PricePreview: Guide''s party-size price ladder (1→N scenarios)\n- Plus lib utilities (timeFit, tourPricing, ist time helpers, travelerTrip store)\n\n**Onboarding & profile:**\n- Step 1: Add age band chip row (\"Tell us about you\")\n- Step 2: Add party type + size selector (\"Who''s travelling?\")\n- Profile editor: Searchable nationality picker, age band field\n\n**Booking screen rewrite:**\n- Delete: \"Preferred dates\" (invention), \"Number of travelers\" (from layover now),\n  \"Flight details\" (from layover now), \"Dates\" (from layover now) — ~250 lines\n- Add: TripSummaryCard for read-only trip review with Edit link\n- Pricing: base + per-person × party_size via computeLayoverPlan()\n- Removes 5 invented date concepts; now single source of truth\n\n**Guide forms:**\n- Itinerary create/edit: Two price fields (base + per-person) with live preview\n- Agreement draft: Pre-filled with base+per-person×num_travelers, editable\n- Payout hint: Wired to actual platform fee rate (0% during early access)\n\n**Bug fixes (incidental to this work):**\n- File picker: Keep input mounted until OS chooser dismissed (Safari compatibility)\n- Alert.alert(): Implement browser alert()/confirm() on web (was silent no-op)\n\n**Testing:**\n- New tests: timeFit boundaries, tourPricing formula, IST round-trip, nationality dedup\n- 438 tests passing (baseline 329 + 109 new)\n- tsc clean, eslint 0 errors\n\nCo-Authored-By: claude-flow <ruv@ruv.net>","tree":{"sha":"a18f03514c62c89607f99cace2fb8a2aa987495d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/trees/a18f03514c62c89607f99cace2fb8a2aa987495d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GauravKumar9920/layover-buddies/git/commits/32f2cf21c844204c3962a6b8444a61e7127a5a3a","verification