ame":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): autonomous-loop completion report — 3 workstreams done\n\nR-17 complete (allow-list 0), gauntlet machine-side substantially\ncomplete (G-2/G-3/G-4/G-5-non-UI), SA pack complete (Estate/Goals/\nCoordination/personas/FAIS-POPIA). Final report enumerates everything\nshipped and the CSJ/human/design items that remain. ~40 commits this\nsession; suite 3,049 green, Larastan clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"3402360786fa2f498b1a963edc6dc067c62ccb51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/3402360786fa2f498b1a963edc6dc067c62ccb51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/005a20a42a26511471712dea8ed911578a768ae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/005a20a42a26511471712dea8ed911578a768ae1","node_id":"C_kwDO