ata-protection notice with the data-subject rights list — exposed\nat GET /api/za/compliance and surfaced in the SA Estate dashboard footer.\n2 Feature tests. The SA Estate view now fetches and renders both.\n\nText is DEMONSTRATION-GRADE and every disclosure carries\nreview_required: true — consistent with the app''s existing\n\"demonstration purposes only\" stance, but the exact regulatory wording,\nFSP licence position, and POPIA operator/responsible-party disclosures\nMUST be signed off by a FAIS/POPIA compliance professional before\nproduction (flagged, not invented as authoritative). Architecture + ZA\nsuites 232 green; UI compiles clean.\n\nCompletes the SA pack workstream: Estate, Goals, Coordination, personas,\nFAIS/POPIA.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"c79dfb8b991f92ecb074cbe01c14ddda3b54ef5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/c79dfb8b991f92ecb074cbe01c14ddda3b54ef5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/a0637959d0f1ef585ad63a045dea17a19bdabf56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com