t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:12:10Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(za-personas): seed one SA preview persona with cross-module data\n\nZaPreviewUserSeeder creates \"Thabo Nkosi\" — an SA preview persona\n(is_preview_user, preview_persona_id=sa_professional) with ZA as primary\njurisdiction (user_jurisdictions) and cross-module SA financial data: a\nretirement fund + Two-Pot buckets, a TFSA contribution, an SDA offshore\ntransfer, and a life policy. Idempotent (delete-then-insert). 2 tests\nverify the persona, its ZA jurisdiction, the data, and reseed idempotency.\n\nScope note: this is the DATA layer only. Surfacing an SA persona in the\nlanding-page selector is FLAGGED (not done) — it''s blocked on two design\ndecisions: (1) the core preview system (VALID_PERSONAS, personas JSON,\npreview.js) is UK-hardcoded and would need to become pack-aware, crossing\nthe pack boundary; (2) SA module access is installation-gated via\nFYNLA_ACTIVE_PACKS, not the per-user jurisdiction model (WS-D). Until\nthose land, log in as this persona directly for SA demo/E2E. Architecture\n+ ZA suites 230 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"f0d23a0fbafbea7ab2e8c113f30ce18967ec52e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/f0d23a0fbafbea7ab2e8c113f30ce18967ec52e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b890bcba3d2ccea046e4e7bbc9bd62d18b354d80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu