epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b8d40139da70de7d19781e5863901ce8685e32c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:53:25Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:53:25Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(za-coordination): SA cross-module position summary\n\nNew (nothing existed before): ZaPositionAggregator sums a user''s known\nSA balances into buckets — retirement funds (Two-Pot vested/provident/\nsavings/retirement), tax-free savings (TFSA contributions), and offshore\n(SDA/FIA exchange-control transfers) — plus a total. ZaCoordinationController\nexposes it at GET /api/za/coordination/summary, pack-registered under the\nza auth group. 4 Feature tests (empty position, cross-module aggregation,\nper-user scoping, auth).\n\nHonest about the data: the discretionary/offshore PER-ASSET split widget\nfrom SA_Research §12 is deliberately OUT — SA holdings carry no\noffshore/local classification, so that needs an offshore-classification\ndata-model decision (flagged for CSJ, not invented autonomously). The\noffshore bucket here is money actually moved offshore under SDA/FIA,\nwhich is recorded. No new tax math. Architecture + ZA suites 228 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"90b2a9c64f97525cc63df91b129f5d2e7f7e23aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/90b2a9c64f97525cc63df91b129f5d2e7f7e23aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b8d40139da70de7d19781e5863901ce8685e32c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},