":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/4e21b56302ad8e4f7755a04149a6388dd45e5c1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:42:21Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:42:21Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(za-goals): SA Goals — defaults + severance-benefit endpoints\n\nWire the two built, config-seeded SA goals services to the API:\n  - GET  /api/za/goals/defaults — SA-appropriate bond (deposit %, term)\n    and tuition (public/private tertiary) defaults + severance tax-free\n    threshold, to seed SA goal creation.\n  - POST /api/za/goals/severance-benefit — tax on a retrenchment lump\n    sum via the SARS retirement table (tax-free/taxable/net breakdown).\nZaGoalsController is a thin proxy over ZaGoalsDefaults +\nZaSeveranceBenefitCalculator; both pack-registered under the za auth\ngroup. 5 Feature tests (defaults ordering, sub-R550k untaxed, large\nseverance taxed, auth, validation). No new tax math. Combined\nspec/plan/PRD doc (proportionate for a 2-endpoint wiring feature).\nArchitecture + ZA suites 224 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"e1cba83e923b5ebcfec19c68c53935e1b07d50da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/e1cba83e923b5ebcfec19c68c53935e1b07d50da"},"url":"https://api.github.com