github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/fbfb5051e1feca2a93086ce6577f5feba9b6c4ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:35:34Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:35:34Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(za-estate): slice 3 — ZA Estate dashboard UI\n\nzaEstateService (estate summary, exemptions, CGT-on-death, donations\nCRUD, donations-tax) + ZaEstateDashboard.vue: an estate-duty calculator\n(gross/liabilities/spouse-bequest/portability -> duty, net estate,\nexecutor fees) and a donations register showing the running SARS\ndonations-tax position with add/remove. Routed at /za/estate behind\nrequiresJurisdiction: za, mirroring the other ZA dashboards. Compiles\nclean (7.4kB chunk), currencyMixin for formatting, design-guide\ncompliant. Full E2E deferred until SA personas exist (spec crit 6).\n\nCompletes the SA Estate module — backend (slices 1-2: estate duty,\nCGT-on-death, exemptions, donations register + tax, 10 Feature tests)\nplus UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"cb5f56a456334aeafa9afae890c6bed9f8171513","url":"https://api.github.c