thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/3ff1bfccb859d59d42ece03c69a8df6835ac0b8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:09:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T18:09:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(gauntlet): G-5 H-1 rate limits + H-3 HTTP timeouts closed\n\nH-1: verified every pre-auth surface is throttled (from G-4-b slice 1);\nadded throttle to the four authenticated MFA-management routes —\nverify-setup accepts a brute-forceable TOTP code, and\nsetup/disable/recovery-codes rotate the MFA secret. Only idempotent\n/logout stays unthrottled.\n\nH-3: swept every external Http:: call in the service layer. Revolut,\nxAI, and Awin already carried timeouts; the one gap was\nPushNotificationService''s FCM call, now timeout(10)/connectTimeout(5).\nNew HttpTimeoutTest statically pins \"every external HTTP call has a\ntimeout\" against regression. Auth + architecture suites 209 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 