    supports savings (savingsPlanService, the ''savings'' match arm, the\n     funding-source in:savings,investment rule). Added savings to all four\n     plan-route constraints. The dashboard calls plans/fetchPlan(''savings'').\n  2. LetterEstateWarnings.vue called api.get(''/api/gb/estate/letter-validation'')\n     — the api client already prepends /api, producing /api/api/gb/…. Dropped\n     the leading /api.\n\nG-3-a harness: tests/E2E/helpers/persona.js (demo-flow login for all 6\npersonas + third-party-filtered console-error collector); config baseURL\nenv-driven, webServer auto-start removed (runs against dev.sh with built\nassets + public/hot removed, Node 20). G-3-b: 00-persona-journeys.spec.js\nwalks 8 core modules per persona asserting URL + authenticated shell +\nzero console errors — that gate is what caught both bugs. 5/6 personas\ngreen; retired_couple passes isolated but flakes under full sequential\nload against single-threaded artisan serve. API + middleware suite 347\ngreen after the route change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"c88bf267c449d8f49cd09e22e7d5f743a079487d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/c88bf267c449d8f49cd09e22e7d5f743a079487d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/9a03fdea03768e3bb223bc533285e676d72f864b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login"