ub.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/f60a180716cb4f083445b18ec0452f80fd208f31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:25:01Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:25:01Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"test(gauntlet): G-2-a controller coverage — enforced auth backstop for all 601 routes\n\nInstead of one auth test per controller, ApiAuthCoverageTest walks the\nentire route table and asserts every api/* route is sanctum-guarded,\nAgentTokenAuth-gated, or on an explicit 21-entry public allow-list\n(auth entry points, health, webhook, preview, public marketing). A new\nroute with no guard fails the build — a stronger, uncircumventable\nversion of the per-controller auth column, and the exact backstop the\nSPA-catch-all 200s were hiding before the api/ exclusion. Runtime\nspot-checks confirm 401s behind the static guard. Coverage matrix\n(Plans/test-gauntlet-coverage-matrix.md) records column 2 (auth) closed\nGREEN, column 3 (IDOR) closed for high-risk paths (savings/goals/morph\ntests; systemic sweep = triage E-24), column 1 (happy-path) deferred to\nG-3''s 42 persona-journeys. G-2-b covered by the existing 59 observer\ntests + G-2-e. Suite 3,017 green (2 known parallel flakes pass isolated).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"104fdc9167279cfc74646df8a0fe5f3fe1612cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/104fdc9167279cfc74646df8a0fe5f3fe1612cab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/f60a180716cb4f083445b18ec0452f80fd208f31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18