.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d019a53b55c3625b113984adff9f8df4ec16b98f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T15:11:55Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T15:11:55Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"test(gauntlet): G-2-c/d/e integration — binding walk, morph replay, cache poisoning\n\nG-2-c (PackBindingWalkTest): all 16 pack.gb.* container keys resolve to\ntheir core contract instance — the post-R-17 completion of the old\n5-of-16 binding test — plus the 4 query-layer bindings verified as shared\nsingletons (the G-(-1) fix).\n\nG-2-d (MorphMigrationReplayTest): fresh-DB tokens carry the\nFynla\\Core\\Models\\User morph; a row dirtied back to App\\Models\\User is\ncanonicalised by the backfill path, is idempotent on re-run, and still\nauthenticates as the right user; the real 2026_05_11 migration re-runs\nclean.\n\nG-2-e (CachePoisoningTest): a hand-poisoned net-worth cache entry is\ninvalidated when the underlying model mutates (never served stale), the\nlegacy App\\Models\\User FQCN resolves via class_alias, and net worth\nrebuilds cleanly after invalidation — no 500.\n\nGauntlet v2: G-2-c/d/e closed (G-2-f/g already closed by R-17). Suite\n3,016 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"2d750a6b7e850c8351c42187e0f40bcc4d2a59f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/tre