tps://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ee4070ffb8012cba7cf1f94af4eae820ff846971/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:59:28Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:59:28Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(gauntlet): G-4-d/e pass + G-5 H-2 log redaction processor\n\nG-4-d (secret management, local subset): confirmed zero real secrets are\ntracked in the repo — both deploy/.env.production files carry only YOUR_*\nplaceholders. G-4-e (auth-flow review): verify-code/resend/login rate\nlimits, MFA verify+recovery preview exclusions, and the mobileLogout\nbiometric guard all verified against the documented checklist.\n\nBuilds G-5 H-2: App\\Logging\\RedactionProcessor (Monolog) + a\nRedactSensitiveData tap wired onto the single/daily channels. Redacts\nsensitive context keys wholesale and masks secret-shaped tokens\n(sk_/pk_/wsk_ Revolut, xai-, sk-ant-, Bearer headers, Sanctum\nplaintext) anywhere in message/context/extra. 5 unit tests + a live\ntinker write confirm secrets hit disk as [REDACTED]. Gauntlet v2:\nG-4-d, G-4-e, H-2 closed (G-4 machine-side done bar the CSJ-flagged\nexternal-LLM audit). Suite 2,990 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"93d4455584c2913e428a7e2bdc287a83d475efa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/93d4455584c2913e428a7e2bdc287a83d475efa1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/ee4070ffb8012cba7cf1f94af4eae820ff846971","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/ee4070ffb8012cba7cf1f94af4eae820ff846971","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGVlNDA3MGZmYjgwMTJjYmE3Y2YxZjk0YWY0ZWFlODIwZmY4NDY5NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/80d4b9e901de1c3a9e293a5ba44eceda4d243296","sha":"80d4b9e901de1c3a9e293a5ba44eceda4d243296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/80d4b9e901de1c3a9e293a5ba44eceda4d243296"}],"sha":"ee4070ffb8012cba7cf1f94af4eae820ff846971","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ee4070ffb8012cba7cf1f94af4eae820ff846971"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/80d4b9e901de1c3a9e293a5ba44eceda4d243296/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:44:54Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T14:44:54Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(security): G-4-b slice 4 HIGH S4-H1 + G-4-c morph escalation tests\n\nSlice 4 (Form Request sweep, sample-of-10) found and this closes one HIGH:\nStoreGoalRequest/UpdateGoalRequest validated linked_savings_account_id as\nan unscoped exists rule, letting a goal link to another user''s savings\naccount. The TracksGoalContributions observer resolves linked goals by\naccount id with no owner filter, so the victim''s deposit deltas leaked\nonto the attacker''s goal. Both requests now scope the FK to accounts the\ncaller owns or jointly owns; 3 regression tests\n(GoalLinkedAccountScopingTest) pin it. 8 MEDIUM + 9 LOW logged to triage\n(E-24..E-28) — the systemic FK-IDOR / currency-max / unbounded-text\nclasses. Also lands G-4-c: MorphEscalationTest proves a token steered at\nanother user''s id authenticates as them but cannot reach the original\nowner''s resources (404), plus legacy-alias resolution and fail-closed on\na nonsense tokenable_type (G-4-c-i robustness nit logged). Gauntlet plan\nv2 tracker: G-4-b and G-4-c closed. Suite 2,985 green, Larastan clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"7d5ec4231bc8ef468d610c6dda03e91a47bbc467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/7d5ec4231bc8ef468d610c6dda03e91a47bbc467"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/80d4b9e901de1c3a9e293a5ba44eceda4d243296","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/80d4