 loop execution, re-scopes every\nlayer for local-only (no dev server — CSJ 2026-07-06), records G-2-f and\nG-2-g as closed by R-17, refreshes drifted counts, and flags every\nCSJ-only/human item instead of blocking on it. Layer definitions,\nseverity rubric, and exit gates carry over from v1 unchanged. G-4-b\nslice 4 dispatched as the first v2 action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"e90b3ff467e0114cdf3c8e5e09d15e77b4d56647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/e90b3ff467e0114cdf3c8e5e09d15e77b4d56647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/022535751ef85cd7287ab95ec102cd235aef9b0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/022535751ef85cd7287ab95ec102cd235aef9b0a","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDAyMjUzNTc1MWVmODVjZDcyODdhYjk1ZWMxMDJjZDIzNWFlZjliMGE",