 (28 files)\n\nProperty (4), Trust (2), UserProfile UK set (4), WhatIf, Chattel,\nBusiness, PrerequisiteGateService, ChildBenefitService, the AI UK\ncluster (KycGateChecker, QueryClassifier, StructuredResponseValidator,\nSystemPromptBuilder, AdviceReviewService + all 4 Prompts),\nUkExchangeControl (E-3 binding rebound), RunMonteCarloSimulation and\nRiskRecalculationObserver (both pack-coupled), and the 8 UK form\nrequests all relocate to the GB pack. Same-namespace traps fixed with\nexplicit imports (3 core risk observers, SystemPromptBuilder). Float\ndebt pinned. PackIsolationTest allow-list ratchets 29 -> 2 — only the\nframework bases (Controller, SanitizedErrorResponse) remain. Suite\n2,976 green + 3 parallel flakes that pass isolated, arch 133, Larastan\nclean (baseline path-regenerated, 10).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0166i352ARG2pHrKpifZv3D4","tree":{"sha":"e8dd0f2208e4cdb454295e7a216ae6bf609ad62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/e8dd0f2208e4cdb454295e7a216ae6bf609ad62b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/1afb24c419c8ca9d08b99db782d2dc0d6c1813bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff