i.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/a8a6e5addd30936d9a57f56d2193c78e39c1e366/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T09:51:18Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T09:51:18Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): context-clear handover 2026-05-13-session-2 + G-4-b slice 3 audit\n\nSlice 3 audit phase complete. 10/10 top-sensitivity controllers reviewed:\n3 HIGH (admin write endpoints lack mfa.verified; legacy GDPR erasure\nbypasses 3-step flow; FamilyMembersController spouse auto-link overwrites\nvictim data + auto-accepts SpousePermission without consent), 1 MEDIUM\n(TrustController currency overflow), 5 LOW (currency-bound + convention\ndrift items). No source code changes — fixes deferred to next working\nsession per CSJ direction. Audit doc captures evidence + fix shapes +\ntests-to-add for each finding.\n\nSlice 1+2 deploy to dev still blocked: ssh-fynla MCP targets production\n(frozen), no ssh-csjones-dev MCP configured.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d344f91b7cb9032d750d0b4f81a14aa35e93908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/6d344f91b7cb9032d750d0b4f81a14aa35e93908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/a8a6e5addd30936d9a57f56d2193c78e39c1e366","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","eve