e_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/a4014df7eaf74730febec3dad57fe606165662ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:41:19Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:41:19Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): context-clear handover 2026-05-12-session-4\n\nSession 4 ships G-0-iv/v + G-1-a + G-1-b. Dev .env restored. 122 commits ahead of main, all pushed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c11b08bf0256e75a16cc2f24faa0b471577e9fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/c11b08bf0256e75a16cc2f24faa0b471577e9fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/a4014df7eaf74730febec3dad57fe606165662ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/a4014df7eaf74730febec3dad57fe606165662ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGE0MDE0ZGY3ZWFmNzQ3MzBmZWJlYzNkYWQ1N2ZlNjA2MTY1NjYyYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa","sha":"29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa"}],"sha":"a4014df7eaf74730febec3dad57fe606165662ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/a4014df7eaf74730febec3dad57fe606165662ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:03:14Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T14:03:14Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(gauntlet): G-1-b — observer-firing tests, 59/59 passing\n\nConverts all 13 observer test scaffolds from `it()->todo()` placeholders to real assertions. Every observer''s create/update/delete behaviour is now asserted using the appropriate pattern for its side-effect shape:\n\n- **Risk family** (7 files: User, FamilyMember, LifeEvent, DCPension, InvestmentAccount, Property, SavingsAccount, plus the abstract parent RiskRecalculationObserver) — `Bus::fake()` + `Bus::assertDispatched(RecalculateRiskProfileJob::class)`. Parent class tests cover the per-user debounce cache key isolation.\n- **Cache invalidation** (NetWorthCacheObserver) — `Mockery::spy(NetWorthService::class)` + `shouldHaveReceived(''invalidateCache'')`. Includes joint-owner duplication and a smoke-check that the observer is wired onto all 9 expected model types via EventServiceProvider.\n- **Multi-service spies** (LifeEventMonteCarloObserver) — spies on MonteCarloSimulator, GoalsProjectionService, CacheInvalidationService.\n- **Agent routing** (RecommendationCacheObserver) — spies on all 7 agent classes; verifies model-class → agent-list routing for SavingsAccount / InvestmentAccount / DCPension / Property / LifeEvent, and the unconditional CoordinatingAgent + joint-owner branches.\n- **Trait-based** (SavingsAccountGoalObserver, InvestmentAccountGoalObserver) — DB record assertions on GoalContribution rows; verifies contribution_type=automatic, the institution/provider note format, streak_qualifying flag (savings=true, investment=false per observer), and paused-goal short-circuit.\n\nThree scope corrections discovered during implementation:\n- LifeEvent factory needs valid enum values for `event_type` (`''gift_received''` not `''birthday''`).\n- Property uses split address columns (`address_line_1`), not a single `address` field.\n- Goal isn''t registered with RecommendationCacheObserver in EventServiceProvider, so the observer''s `''Goal''` routing arm is exercised via LifeEvent (same routing target).\n\nTest counts:\n- 13 files / 59 tests / 110 assertions / 0 failures (was 59 todos)\n- Suite-wide local: still 2,836 passed / 1 skipped (no regressions; this commit only adds real assertions to previously-todo tests)\n\nCloses gauntlet gate G-1-b per Plans/test-gauntlet-plan-v1.md § 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29e81236fc5c405426da6f81055b27393d62d105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/29e81236fc5c405426da6f81055b27393d62d105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDI5YWVjZmQ2NmQ0M2NhNWVmOWZjZjE3ODA5YjFmMjZjNmFmMWE1ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8","sha":"7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8"}],"sha":"29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/29aecfd66d43ca5ef9fcf17809b1f26c6af1a5fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T13:45:29Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T13:45:29Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(gauntlet): G-0-iv/v + G-1-a green on dev — observer test scaffolds + triage backlog\n\nCloses three gauntlet gates and unblocks G-1-b:\n\n- **G-0-iv** — lifecycle test recipient override verified on dev. Three exit-gate checks: `config(''lifecycle.test_recipient_override'')` returns `chris@fynla.org` via tinker; `schedule:list` shows `0 7 * * *  php artisan lifecycle:run-daily`; `tests/Unit/Services/Lifecycle/LifecycleEngineTest.php` 7/7 passing locally.\n- **G-0-v** — triage backlog created at `May/May12Updates/triage-backlog.md` (open bugs / enhancements / open questions / closed-resolved / conventions). Seeded with the session-4 incidents (APP_KEY placeholder, APP_URL prefix) and standing tech debt from sessions 2–3.\n- **G-1-a** — Pest baseline re-confirmed on dev: 2,836 passed / 1 skipped / 59 todos / 0 failed, exactly matching local baseline. Companion fix landed in commit b2ac915 (APP_URL override).\n\nPlus `tests/Feature/Observers/` scaffolds (13 files, 59 `it()->todo()` placeholders) for G-1-b. Each file has full docblock (observer path, firing conditions, dispatch target) and proper `beforeEach()` setup (Bus::fake / Mockery::spy / Cache::flush as appropriate). G-1-b implementer just replaces each todo() with a real assertion using the documented pattern. The 59 todos are visible in the Pest output as yellow `↓` markers — neither pass nor fail.\n\nGauntlet G-0 is now 3/5 done (i + iii remain CSJ-only). G-1-a is green. Next active task is G-1-b (~2 days).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"856d2ec964b4cd292b9e25ce553f1801cc967f7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/856d2ec964b4cd292b9e25ce553f1801cc967f7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDdjYjMzNDI3YmRiZTYzNGM1NzNhZDA3ZDQyOTAwMzE3MTUxYTliYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b2ac915995c2b2a9e971084fea3e953d8d71ac35","sha":"b2ac915995c2b2a9e971084fea3e953d8d71ac35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b2ac915995c2b2a9e971084fea3e953d8d71ac35"}],"sha":"7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/7cb33427bdbe634c573ad07d42900317151a9ba8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b2ac915995c2b2a9e971084fea3e953d8d71ac35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T13:45:14Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T13:45:14Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(test): override APP_URL=http://localhost in phpunit.xml for subpath-deployed staging\n\nPest''s TestCase prepends APP_URL to relative paths passed to `getJson()`/`postJson()`. When APP_URL contains a path component (e.g. `https://csjones.co/fynla_inter` on the dev staging server), `postJson(''/api/auth/register'')` resolves to `https://csjones.co/fynla_inter/api/auth/register` — the path Laravel''s router sees is `/fynla_inter/api/auth/register`, not `/api/auth/register`. Routes don''t match → 404 fallback (or 405 if a catch-all GET route partially matches).\n\nSurfaced during gauntlet G-1-a: full Pest suite on `csjones.co/fynla_inter` returned 749 spurious failures (vs. 0 locally on the same code). Single fix — override APP_URL in the phpunit `<env>` block — restored full parity (2,836 passed / 1 skipped / 59 todos / 0 failed) on dev.\n\nThe override is test-env-scoped only; runtime APP_URL on dev/prod is unaffected. Works for any future subpath staging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a840fe40b4587ceb94610c33c02a51a33cc3eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/0a840fe40b4587ceb94610c33c02a51a33cc3eda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b2ac915995c2b2a9e971084fea3e953d8d71ac35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"htt