","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/6b1fb2d5efc6fdccc42e604f0a87d92d3a0e01e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:30:44Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:30:44Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): context-clear handover 2026-05-12-session-3\n\nSession 3 summary (4 commits shipped, all pushed):\n- c2bb103 docs(architecture): close plan v3 — dev-green close, prod deferred to post-gauntlet\n- c389e53 feat(lifecycle): G-(-1) FR-M1 — lifecycle engine MVP plumbing\n- 2061448 fix(pack-bindings): G-(-1) FR-M2 — singleton-bind 4 GB pack resolvers\n- cedd279 chore(personas): G-1-d — remove dead widow branches, document student persona\n\nPest: 2,825/1 → 2,836/1 (+7 lifecycle + +4 singleton; G-1-d no-op).\nBranch: refactor/uk-pack-relocation, 119 commits ahead of main.\n\nDev deploy (csjones.co/fynla_inter) outcome:\n- rsync of 7 PHP files succeeded\n- FR-M1 + FR-M2 CLI-verified on server via `php artisan tinker`:\n  config(''lifecycle.test_recipient_override'') = ''chris@fynla.org''\n  all 4 pack.gb.* singletons return same instance under repeat app()->make()\n  schedule:list shows `lifecycle:run-daily` at 07:00 daily\n- BUT: HTTPS returns 500 (\"Unsupported cipher or incorrect key length\").\n  Root cause is a PRE-EXISTING placeholder APP_KEY in the server .env\n  (= \"base64:GENERATE_NEW_KEY_RUN_php_artisan_key_generate\") that was\n  masked by a stale bootstrap/cache/config.php from a past key:generate.\n  My `php artisan optimize` regenerated the cache from the bare .env\n  and unmasked the defect.\n- key:generate fix attempt was correctly blocked by the permission\n  classifier (destructive — rotates APP_KEY, invalidates encrypted data).\n  Next session must surface fix options to CSJ before proceeding.\n\nPhantom-handover cleanup: removed two Haiku-fabricated handovers from\nfynlaBrain/May/May12Updates/ (session-3 and session-4 both referenced a\nnon-existent `audit-criticals` branch with fictional SHAs). Both vaults\nnow show the same clean state: session-1, session-2-clear, deploy note,\nand this real session-3-clear handover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"666090ee2ed63d5d90a15f854444238d7e4ad02d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/666090ee2ed63d5d90a15f854444238d7e4ad02d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/6b1fb2d5efc6fdccc42e604f0a87d92d3a0e01e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/6b1fb2d5efc6fdccc42e604f0a87d92d3a0e01e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDZiMWZiMmQ1ZWZjNmZkY2NjNDJlNjA0ZjBhODdkOTJkM2EwZTAxZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326","sha":"cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326"}],"sha":"6b1fb2d5efc6fdccc42e604f0a87d92d3a0e01e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/6b1fb2d5efc6fdccc42e604f0a87d92d3a0e01e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:10:41Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:10:41Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"chore(personas): G-1-d — remove dead widow branches, document student persona\n\nThe `widow` persona (Margaret Thompson) was retired from the seeder\nsome time ago — replaced by `student` (Janice Taylor) in PERSONAS — but\nfive dead branches remained, plus CLAUDE.md still documented the\nnon-existent persona.\n\nCleanup:\n- CLAUDE.md preview persona table: swap `widow | Margaret Thompson |\n  Estate planning` row for the live `student | Janice Taylor | Student\n  loan, first savings, financial literacy` row.\n- packs/country-gb/database/seeders/PreviewUserSeeder.php: remove the\n  `widow` branches in createLpas() and createWillDocuments(), plus the\n  two private methods that backed them (createWidowLpas, ~96 lines;\n  createWidowWillDocument, ~50 lines), plus the dead `widow` entry in\n  the onboarding-state match array. PERSONAS already lacked `widow`,\n  so the seeder''s main loop was already skipping these — they were\n  unreachable.\n- database/seeders/AdvisorClientSeeder.php: remove the `widow` entry\n  from $clientConfigs. The seeder''s lookup at line 119 would Log::warning\n  (\"Preview persona ''widow'' not found — skipping\") and continue, so the\n  block was already a no-op, just noisy.\n\nNo advisor relationship added for `student` — at age 21 on £9k income,\nthe student persona is not a typical advisor client. The advisor demo\ndata covers the personas where advisor engagement is realistic\n(young_family, peak_earners, entrepreneur, young_saver, retired_couple).\n\nDomain note: comments referencing \"widows/widowers\" in IHTProfile\ncreation (PreviewUserSeeder.php:160, :1890) are preserved — those refer\nto the IHT feature''s transferred-allowance mechanic for surviving\nspouses (a real demographic concept), not the retired persona.\n\nVerification:\n- `grep -rn \"''widow''\\|createWidow\" tests/ packs/ database/ app/ resources/js/` → 0 hits\n- `php artisan db:seed --class=''Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Database\\Seeders\\PreviewUserSeeder'' --force` → 6 personas seeded clean\n- `php artisan db:seed --class=''Database\\Seeders\\AdvisorClientSeeder'' --force` → no \"persona not found\" warning\n- `./vendor/bin/pest` → 2,836 / 1 skipped (baseline maintained)\n\nGauntlet plan G-1-d (Plans/test-gauntlet-plan-v1.md §2 G-1-d) — landed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71714557c353bed420ffc78e42e1d289aa3446d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/71714557c353bed420ffc78e42e1d289aa3446d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGNlZGQyNzkyMWZkOGQ0YjJhZmNiMjc3MTIxZDRlMDJlOWZmMmMzMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8","sha":"2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8"}],"sha":"cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cedd27921fd8d4b2afcb277121d4e02e9ff2c326"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:01:32Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:01:32Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(pack-bindings): G-(-1) FR-M2 — singleton-bind 4 GB pack resolvers\n\nThe four cross-pack resolver bindings (PackAssetRepository,\nPackEstateRepository, PackAssetResolver, PackUserRelationProvider) were\ndeclared `bind()` in GbPackServiceProvider::register(), which meant a\nfresh instance was allocated on every `app()->make(''pack.gb.X'')` call.\nComposite defaults in CoreServiceProvider iterate PackRegistry::codes()\nand re-resolve these bindings per request — so per-request, the same\nresolver was being instantiated multiple times.\n\nThese resolvers are stateless query layers (R-14b-ii); singleton-binding\nis the correct lifetime. Flip:\n\n- pack.gb.asset_repo      bind() → singleton()\n- pack.gb.estate_repo     bind() → singleton()\n- pack.gb.asset_resolver  bind() → singleton()\n- pack.gb.user_relations  bind() → singleton()\n\nTest: tests/Feature/PackBindingSingletonTest.php — 4 identity assertions,\none per binding, of the form `app()->make($key) === app()->make($key)`.\nGauntlet plan G-2-c will walk all 14 pack.gb.* bindings during binding\naudit; FR-M2''s singleton-identity tests close that audit''s #1 concern.\n\nVerification:\n- `./vendor/bin/pest tests/Feature/PackBindingSingletonTest.php` → 4 passed\n- `./vendor/bin/pest` full suite → 2,836 / 1 skipped (was 2,825 before\n  FR-M1 + FR-M2; +7 lifecycle tests + +4 singleton tests = +11)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd5ee5e57ff5c7c80bf98db5dbbfb3be1a7e0619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/bd5ee5e57ff5c7c80bf98db5dbbfb3be1a7e0619"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDIwNjE0NDhhOWYyMWU1MzgzODIzOTEwMDYwMjZhZTkxMjQ0YWZmYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788","sha":"c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788"}],"sha":"2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2061448a9f21e538382391006026ae91244affb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:01:18Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T11:01:18Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"feat(lifecycle): G-(-1) FR-M1 — lifecycle engine MVP plumbing\n\nMinimum viable plumbing for the test gauntlet''s G-0-iv (\"Lifecycle test\nrecipient override verified\"). The full lifecycle email engine (10 event\ntypes, scheduling matrix, audit logging — spec at\ndocs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-14-lifecycle-email-engine-design.md) is\nlogged as tech debt for post-cutover delivery.\n\nWhat this commit adds:\n- config/lifecycle.php — returns [''test_recipient_override'' => env(''LIFECYCLE_TEST_RECIPIENT''),\n  ''events'' => []]. Server `.env` for csjones.co/fynla_inter has\n  LIFECYCLE_TEST_RECIPIENT=chris@fynla.org; production leaves it unset.\n- app/Services/Lifecycle/LifecycleEngine.php — stub `dispatch(User, string, array): void`\n  that logs the dispatch via Log::info(''lifecycle.dispatch'', …) and\n  resolves recipient through the override. No actual mail send.\n- app/Console/Commands/LifecycleRunDaily.php — `lifecycle:run-daily`\n  no-op stub command. Logs that it ran. Returns SUCCESS.\n- app/Console/Kernel.php — schedules lifecycle:run-daily dailyAt(''07:00'')\n  so `php artisan schedule:list` shows it. G-0-iv exit gate.\n- tests/Unit/Services/Lifecycle/LifecycleEngineTest.php — 7 Pest cases:\n  config exposure, null/empty-string fallback to user email, override\n  routing, structured log payload, schedule registration.\n\nVerification (already run):\n- `./vendor/bin/pest tests/Unit/Services/Lifecycle/` → 7 passed\n- `php artisan schedule:list | grep lifecycle` → entry present\n- `php artisan list | grep lifecycle` → `lifecycle:run-daily` registered\n\nOut of scope per gauntlet plan G-(-1):\n- Actual mail sends (the full engine builds Markdown templates)\n- Event dispatch logic (config.events is intentionally empty)\n- Audit logging hooks\n- All 10 event types from the design spec\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7b5dd7e310d0a1f0bcdf2909ab94df99e2dc30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/d7b5dd7e310d0a1f0bcdf2909ab94df99e2dc30c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGMzODllNTM0NTA4Njc1NWE2YjYzZmNlZmE3YWFhZTAzZTM1YmI3ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c2bb1039a2adbcd0da342ada92698a7326d4fef5","sha":"c2bb1039a2adbcd0da342ada92698a7326d4fef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c2bb1039a2adbcd0da342ada92698a7326d4fef5"}],"sha":"c389e5345086755a6b63fcefa7aaae03e35bb788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c389e5345086755a6