ll,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/5633c93faef1d60462cddc047f37e3b266aef0a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDU2MzNjOTNmYWVmMWQ2MDQ2MmNkZGMwNDdmMzdlM2IyNjZhZWYwYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341","sha":"d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341"}],"sha":"5633c93faef1d60462cddc047f37e3b266aef0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/5633c93faef1d60462cddc047f37e3b266aef0a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:36:23Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:36:23Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"chore(ai): bump xAI default model to grok-4.3\n\nCSJ confirmed 2026-05-12 we''re using Grok 4.3 going forward. xAI''s /v1/models\nendpoint exposes it as a single `grok-4.3` identifier (no separate reasoning /\nnon-reasoning split — reasoning_content streams alongside content in the same\nresponse).\n\nUpdated:\n- config/services.php fallback model ids for chat / advanced / vision: all\n  now default to `grok-4.3` (was `grok-4-1-fast-{reasoning,non-reasoning}`).\n  The env vars override these as before; this is just the default path.\n- deploy/csjones-fynla/.env.production template — XAI_CHAT_MODEL /\n  XAI_ADVANCED_CHAT_MODEL / XAI_VISION_MODEL placeholders updated to grok-4.3\n  so future dev bootstraps land on the right model out of the gate.\n- app/Services/AI/XaiClient.php docstring corrected (referenced the old\n  grok-4-1-fast-reasoning model name).\n\nServer .env on csjones.co/fynla_inter already updated with the real key and\ngrok-4.3 model ids; smoke-tested through XaiClient — returns content=\"PONG\"\nwith model=grok-4.3 (273 tokens).\n\nThe real key is in the server .env only; templates retain YOUR_XAI_API_KEY\nplaceholder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"676091bbaf1e69f0c0e22eb769b041912cf4f101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/676091bbaf1e69f0c0e22eb769b041912cf4f101"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGQ5NzI0Zjk3MWM5NWQ5ZTgwNTc2Y2M4NzUyZjFjZDRiOTFlNzQzNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9","sha":"cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9"}],"sha":"d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d9724f971c95d9e80576cc8752f1cd4b91e74341"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:28:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:28:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(gauntlet): PRD + amended spec/plan after codebase-audit-driven interview\n\nprd-writer flow on 2026-05-12. Two validation agents (feature-dev:code-explorer\nfor factual claims, feature-dev:code-architect for fit) returned 14 distinct\nconcerns + numerous factual corrections. 12-question rolling interview with\nCSJ resolved every open question. Spec + plan amended in place; PRD synthesised\nfrom the resolved state.\n\nMaterial outcomes:\n\n- **G-7 (closed beta) deleted entirely** — internal-only user testing via G-6\n  is the human-validation layer. Removes ~2 weeks of scheduling + GDPR\n  exposure + recruitment work. Buffer grows from 3 weeks to 5 weeks before\n  the 12-week hard stop.\n\n- **G-(-1) pre-gauntlet workstream added** — codebase audit revealed\n  `config/lifecycle.php` doesn''t exist; the lifecycle email engine from the\n  April spec was never implemented. MVP plumbing built so G-0-iv can pass.\n  Full implementation logged as tech debt (post-cutover, separate spec\n  pipeline).\n\n- **Singleton-binding fix scheduled pre-G-2** — `pack.gb.user_relations`,\n  `pack.gb.asset_repo`, `pack.gb.estate_repo`, `pack.gb.asset_resolver` were\n  bound with `bind()` (transient). Coordination agent over a household =\n  ~50-100 fresh container makes per page load. Switching to `singleton()`\n  with binding-identity tests.\n\n- **G-3/G-5 resequenced** — non-UI hardening (rate-limit, log redaction,\n  HTTP timeouts, env:validate) moves to weeks 2-3 parallel with G-2. UI\n  hardening (CSP, ErrorBoundary, Sentry browser) deferred until G-3 green.\n  Avoids the mutual-invalidation trap.\n\n- **G-5 collapsed** from 7 sub-gates to a single hardening checklist.\n\n- **Severity-1 defined**: user-visible numeric error >= GBP 10, OR auth\n  failure, OR data loss. UI/copy bugs = severity-2 (v1.1 backlog).\n\n- **Migration safety hardened** — added dirty-DB replay test (PAT with\n  legacy App\\Models\\User string survives backfill and re-run is idempotent)\n  + cache poisoning test (pre-relocation cache entries don''t break the\n  post-deploy app) + rollback runbook explicitly documents the class_alias\n  re-add step on `main` branch (highest-blast-radius gap in the original\n  plan).\n\n- **Security threat model corrected** — replaced G-4-c \"forge a PAT with\n  tokenable_type=Console\\Command\" class-injection test with a\n  horizontal-privilege-escalation test (PAT for user A pointing at user B\n  must not bypass resource ownership checks).\n\n- **Persona surgery** — `widow` removed from PreviewUserSeeder months ago,\n  replaced by `student`. CLAUDE.md still listed `widow`; spec/plan still\n  listed `widow`. All amended to `student`. Dead `widow` branches in\n  PreviewUserSeeder slated for removal in G-1-d.\n\n- **Counts corrected throughout**: 2,825 -> ~2,669 tests, 12 -> 13 observers\n  (split across `app/Observers/` and `packs/country-gb/src/Observers/`),\n  12 -> 19 contracts (R-14b added 4 query contracts + GoalCalculationEngine),\n  89 -> ~98 controllers, 83 -> ~104 form requests.\n\n- **PackIsolationTest exit gate corrected** — the `App\\Models` sub-section\n  IS empty (R-14b closed). The full allow-list is 60+ entries (R-14a\n  deferrals). Added counter ratchet to prevent silent growth.\n\n- **`CoreContracts::all()` helper to be created** via filesystem scan, since\n  the original G-2-c test snippet referenced a class that doesn''t exist.\n\n- **2 R-14a residual bindings** (pack.gb.exchange_control,\n  pack.gb.tax_optimisation) explicitly tracked rather than silently carried.\n\n- **Week-6 checkpoint gate** — defined trigger for soft re-baseline if\n  G-1/G-2/G-3/G-4 aren''t all green at end of week 6.\n\n- **All 10 spec-time open questions resolved** in interview — answers\n  documented in spec § 7 resolution table.\n\nPRD lives at May/May12Updates/PRD-test-gauntlet-v1.md per project convention.\nSpec and plan front matter updated to status: amended with the path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de98fa8e5f6078746f2fa014eb02290dcdab9210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/de98fa8e5f6078746f2fa014eb02290dcdab9210"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGNjOTJkOTAzODA1NGEwMTA1OTUzYWIxMjE2YmY0YWM1YjUxZjAwYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd","sha":"40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd"}],"sha":"cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cc92d9038054a0105953ab1216bf4ac5b51f00c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:02:03Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T10:02:03Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(gauntlet): test gauntlet spec + plan v1 — 8-layer pre-prod validation\n\nThe R-15 workstream originally closed on prod cutover. Per CSJ 2026-05-12, prod\n(fynla.org) is frozen for ~2 months pending a full test gauntlet (unit, e2e,\nuser, beta, logic, systems, security, hardening). This commit captures the\nspec + plan for that gauntlet so it has the same provenance the architecture\ncampaign did.\n\nSpec (Plans/test-gauntlet-spec-v1.md):\n- Why a normal deploy is unsafe for the 107-commit, 1,931-file campaign that\n  relocates the entire App\\Models\\* namespace and touches 370 live Sanctum\n  sessions on prod.\n- 8 layers: unit, logic, systems, e2e, security, hardening, user, beta — each\n  with what it tests, why it exists, scope-this-gauntlet, exit gate.\n- Mutual-exclusion principle: no new features during the gauntlet. Hardening\n  adjustments and severity-1 fixes only.\n- 10 open questions for the PRD interview (beta pool, severity-1 threshold,\n  CSP rollback posture, beta-account lifecycle, R-16 timing, etc).\n- Constraints: 8-week target, 12-week hard stop, single-developer pace,\n  dev-only via csjones.co/fynla_inter.\n\nPlan (Plans/test-gauntlet-plan-v1.md):\n- 9 workstreams G-0 → G-8 (setup, unit/logic, systems, e2e, security,\n  hardening, user, beta, prod readiness review). Cutover itself is explicitly\n  out of scope and happens post-G-8 in a separate session.\n- Calendar grid (week 1 → week 9) shows parallelism: G-1 ⊥ G-4, G-3 ⊥ G-5,\n  G-6 tail ⊥ G-5 close. Buffer ~3 weeks before the 12-week hard stop.\n- Effort estimates per workstream, exit gates, risk register, what''s not in\n  this plan, companion-doc cross-references.\n\nCompanion PRD pending — to be generated via /prd-writer next. Plan and spec\nwill be amended during the rolling PRD interview as ambiguities surface.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a0d1dea4d81c27efe17fe5108b2deb30754265c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/a0d1dea4d81c27efe17fe5108b2deb30754265c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDQwZDlhYzQ5NzVhYzNjODNlN2FlNTk1YTAxNWUxMTBiYjVjNzdhYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30","sha":"2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30"}],"sha":"40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/40d9ac4975ac3c83e7ae595a015e110bb5c77abd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:29:49Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:29:49Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(deploy): R-15-bootstrap learnings — anchored rsync excludes, suexec chmod, /fynla_inter paths\n\nThree corrections surfaced when bootstrapping csjones.co/fynla_inter from\nscratch on 2026-05-12 (the dev env had never been provisioned despite multiple\ndeploy notes referencing it as a routine target):\n\n1. **rsync excludes must be anchored.** BOOTSTRAP.md previously used\n   `--exclude=\"tests/\"`-style patterns, which match every nested `tests/`\n   or `Plans/` directory anywhere in the tree. That dropped 98 critical\n   files from the upload (`app/Services/Plans/`, `packs/country-gb/src/Plans/`,\n   `packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/Plans/`,\n   `packs/country-gb/resources/js/components/Plans/`,\n   `resources/js/views/Plans/`) and produced 500s on every plan-service API\n   endpoint with `Class App\\Services\\Plans\\BasePlanService not found`.\n   Added a leading `/` to every custom exclude and documented the trap.\n   Also added `public/hot` to the exclude list — that file points Vite at\n   `127.0.0.1:5173` for HMR and would silently break the live site if\n   rsync''d.\n\n2. **SiteGround suexec rejects group-writable files.** macOS''s default\n   umask gives rsync''d files 664/775, which Apache rejects before PHP\n   runs — Laravel never logs anything because suexec aborts execution\n   upstream. Added the full normalise step (find -type d -exec chmod 755,\n   find -type f -exec chmod 644, chmod 600 .env, chmod 755 artisan,\n   chmod -R 775 storage bootstrap/cache) to section 6 of BOOTSTRAP.md\n   and the ongoing-deploy block of CLAUDE.md.\n\n3. **Path drift: csjones.co/fynla vs csjones.co/fynla_inter.** The legacy\n   UK-only Fynla lives at `csjones.co/fynla`. Fynla International''s dev\n   env sits ALONGSIDE it at `csjones.co/fynla_inter` (separate\n   `fynla_inter-app/` sibling, separate DB, separate Vite base path).\n   CLAUDE.md deployment matrix, the .env.production template''s APP_URL /\n   VITE_API_BASE_URL / header comments, and the Revolut webhook URL all\n   referenced the legacy path. Updated all three to /fynla_inter to match\n   what the build script has hard-coded all along.\n\nAlso:\n- Flipped the dev .env template''s AI block from Anthropic to xAI/Grok\n  with the standing model defaults, matching the current AI provider on\n  prod.\n- The two `deploy/*/.env.production` template files were never tracked\n  (caught by the blanket `.env.production` .gitignore rule). Added a\n  `!deploy/*/.env.production` exemption so the templates are versioned\n  while personal/server .env.production files remain ignored. Both\n  templates verified to contain only `YOUR_*` placeholders before\n  tracking.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4038f1d71c86bb7a18b609eb72e7fea288dedfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/f4038f1d71c86bb7a18b609eb72e7fea288dedfa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDJlOWZjYjY3ODcxNDEzYmViMTQwNWZhOTMwYTMwZWFiZDAwOWJhMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2","sha":"ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2"}],"sha":"2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/2e9fcb67871413beb1405fa930a30eabd009ba30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:27:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T08:27:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"fix(composer): move country packs to require so prod composer install --no-dev resolves them\n\n`fynla/pack-country-{gb,za,xx-smoke}` were declared in `require-dev`. Running\n`composer install --no-dev` on a production / staging server skipped them, then\n`package:discover` (post-autoload-dump) failed with `Class\nFynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Models\\Investment\\InvestmentAccount not found` because the pack\nservice providers reference pack models the autoloader didn''t know about.\n\nSurfaced during the R-15-bootstrap of csjones.co/fynla_inter on 2026-05-12:\n`composer install --no-dev` aborted post-autoload; falling back to a full\n`composer install` worked because dev deps include the path-repo entries.\nThat fallback is fine for staging but would either drag Pest / Pint / faker\nonto prod or fail the same way as dev did.\n\nPacks are runtime requirements (every request touches a pack service provider),\nso they belong in `require`. `composer update fynla/pack-country-* --no-scripts`\nleft the lockfile structure unchanged in terms of installed versions but\nre-sorted entries; that''s the bulk of the lock diff.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"968246f2f59cecc28e73c7305b15598e9dc535cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/968246f2f59cecc28e73c7305b15598e9dc535cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGVmOTQ2OTkxZDUzYmNhOTZlNWY4ZmRjNzI1NWVmOTIxNGY5NTc2YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cfcae55ff776091feb0769a7a7864561ef1eaa41","sha":"cfcae55ff776091feb0769a7a7864561ef1eaa41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cfcae55ff776091feb0769a7a7864561ef1eaa41"}],"sha":"ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ef946991d53bca96e5f8fdc7255ef9214f9576a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cfcae55ff776091feb0769a7a7864561ef1eaa41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T19:21:06Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T19:21:06Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): end-of-day handover 2026-05-12-session-1 + R-15 deploy note\n\nEnd-of-day wrap for 2026-05-11, session 4. R-15 non-destructive prep SHIPPED\nacross 2 commits today (9be466d backfill migration + 34361e3 import-path fixes).\nFull Pest 2,825/1 + Architecture 130/130 reconfirmed. Browser test complete for\nboth UK and SA journeys via Playwright.\n\nDeploy note captures the dev → prod flow targeting csjones.co/fynla then\nfynla.org for 2026-05-12. Includes the prod row counts (370 live PATs +\n9 notifications + 0 audit_logs), the load-bearing class_alias context, and\nthe rollback plan. Plan v3 closes after R-15 prod smoke verifies green.\n\nVault synced: fynlaBrain + fynlaInter both refreshed. May2026 total now\n126 commits across 8 days. May11.md captures all 22 commits today.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92847f5771654a4d3b8959c9fdd7afcd05b4c92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/92847f5771654a4d3b8959c9fdd7afcd05b4c92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/cfcae55ff776091feb0769a7a7864561ef1eaa41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co