":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/85eaf19e3b39f60d61eb25e48296ba57236c8e0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T16:29:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T16:29:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-viii — legacy App\\Models\\User class_alias\n\nFinal piece of the User relocation. The bulk of R-14b-viii''s mechanical\nwork (sed-replace across 465 consumers, config/auth.php update,\npre-flight row count check on PAT + audit_logs morph columns) shipped\nin R-14b-vii (commit 0b432d5). This commit closes viii with the\nproduction-safety backwards-compat alias:\n\n    if (! class_exists(''App\\\\Models\\\\User'', false)) {\n        class_alias(\\Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User::class, ''App\\\\Models\\\\User'');\n    }\n\nIn CoreServiceProvider::boot(). Any legacy polymorphic rows still\nstoring `App\\Models\\User` (Sanctum `personal_access_tokens.tokenable_type`,\n`audit_logs.model_type`) resolve to the new core class via PHP class\naliasing — Eloquent''s class_exists() check passes, the model instance\nis the same underlying class.\n\nWhy class_alias over Relation::enforceMorphMap\n----------------------------------------------\n\nConsidered the morph-map route (plan § 16b suggested it). Rejected\nbecause `enforceMorphMap([''App\\\\Models\\\\User'' => User::class])` forces\nNEW tokens / audit rows to write the legacy string back — exactly the\nopposite of what we want. class_alias provides the read-side fallback\nwithout changing write behaviour: new rows store\n`Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User` (FQCN), old rows still resolve.\n\nPre-flight check showed zero rows locally so this is purely defensive\nfor the production deploy. If prod row count is also zero, the alias\nis dead code but costs nothing. If non-zero, it prevents authenticated\nsession breakage at deploy switch-over.\n\nVerification\n------------\n\n- Architecture suite: 130 / 130 maintained.\n- Live smoke (php tinker): `class_exists(''App\\\\Models\\\\User'')` returns\n  YES, `new App\\\\Models\\\\User instanceof Fynla\\\\Core\\\\Models\\\\User`\n  returns YES.\n\nR-14b (9/9 — sub-batch viii closed).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b55936d601aaeb4db72c583692ce7d721b13a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/4b55936d601aaeb4db72c583692ce7d721b13a3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/85eaf19e3b39f60d61eb25e48296ba57236c8e0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/85eaf19e3b39f60d61eb25e48296ba57236c8e0a","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDg1ZWFmMTllM2IzOWY2MGQ2MWViMjVlNDgyOTZiYTU3MjM2YzhlMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570","sha":"0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570"}],"sha":"85eaf19e3b39f60d61eb25e48296ba57236c8e0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/85eaf19e3b39f60d61eb25e48296ba57236c8e0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T16:24:37Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T16:24:37Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-vii — relocate User + UserResource to core\n\nR-14b campaign-final move. User and UserResource live in core under\n`Fynla\\Core\\Models` / `Fynla\\Core\\Http\\Resources`. The R-14b-deferred\nsection of PackIsolationTest''s allow-list is now empty — every entry\nthe campaign was scoped to retire (6 core models + UserResource) is\ngone.\n\nHow the pack literals come out of core\n--------------------------------------\n\nUser had 19 pack-mediated relations (6 Estate hasMany/hasOne + 5\nProtection policies + 1 Protection profile + 2 Property/Mortgage +\n1 Investment + 1 Savings + 4 Pensions + 4 Business/Chattel/Cash/\nPersonal + 1 LetterToSpouse). Replacing each `hasMany(\\Fynla\\Packs\\…)`\nwith an accessor would have lost Eloquent''s relation API entirely\n(eager loading, `()->where()`, `()->exists()`, chainable query\nbuilder) — the cost was 78+ method-call sites and 17+ eager-load\nsites to migrate, which the PRD risk #4 explicitly flagged as the\nsplit-vii contingency.\n\nStrategy adopted: container-resolved class strings inside the\nexisting `hasMany()` / `hasOne()` calls. Core User holds no static\npack literals; every pack-typed relation reads its target class\nthrough the contract:\n\n    public function dcPensions(): HasMany\n    {\n        return $this->hasMany($this->packModel(''gb.dc_pension''));\n    }\n\n    protected function packModel(string $relationType): string\n    {\n        return app(PackUserRelationProvider::class)\n            ->modelClassFor($relationType) ?? throw …;\n    }\n\nThis keeps the relation API intact — `User::with([''dcPensions''])`,\n`$user->dcPensions()->exists()`, `$user->dcPensions->sum(…)` all\ncontinue to work. Zero caller migrations needed for the 78 method-\ncall sites or the 17 eager-load sites. The trade-off: the relation\ntarget is now resolved at runtime via the container, so static\nanalysis tools that map relations by `::class` won''t see them — an\nacceptable swap given the alternative was rewriting every consumer.\n\nContract surface added in R-14b-vii-prep (d65ee8e) earned the\n`modelClassFor(string): ?string` method this commit, completing the\nprovider''s role.\n\nPackUserRelationProvider extension\n----------------------------------\n\n- `core/app/Core/Contracts/PackUserRelationProvider.php` — adds\n  `modelClassFor(string $relationType): ?string`.\n- `core/app/Core/Query/CompositePackUserRelationProvider.php` — walks\n  PackRegistry; first non-null wins.\n- `packs/country-gb/src/Query/GbPackUserRelationProvider.php` —\n  centralised classMap() with 25 type tags (15 hasMany pack-asset\n  models + 6 Estate models + 4 HasOne profile models). modelClassFor,\n  userRelatedModels, userRelatedModel all read from the same map.\n- `packs/country-za/src/Query/ZaPackUserRelationProvider.php` —\n  null-returning Null impl.\n\nUser + UserResource relocation\n------------------------------\n\n- `git mv app/Models/User.php → core/app/Core/Models/User.php`\n  (namespace `App\\Models` → `Fynla\\Core\\Models`). All 19 pack-typed\n  relations refactored to read their target class via\n  `packModel(string $type)` helper. Core relations (Subscription,\n  Payment, Referral, Household, Role, UserSession, UserConsent,\n  DataExport, ErasureRequest, FamilyMember, SpousePermission,\n  OnboardingProgress, ExpenditureProfile, AiConversation,\n  AdvisorClient, UserAssumption, Goal, Jurisdiction) use bare class\n  names since they share the new namespace.\n- `git mv app/Http/Resources/UserResource.php →\n  core/app/Core/Http/Resources/UserResource.php`. Namespace bumped to\n  `Fynla\\Core\\Http\\Resources`.\n- `app/Models/` directory removed (empty after the move).\n\nAtomic sed-replace across 465 consumer files\n--------------------------------------------\n\n- `App\\Models\\User` → `Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User` (465 files; perl with\n  `\\b` boundary protects against `App\\Models\\UserSession` etc. —\n  audited zero false matches).\n- `App\\Http\\Resources\\UserResource` →\n  `Fynla\\Core\\Http\\Resources\\UserResource` (9 files).\n- `config/auth.php` line 65 — `''model'' => Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User::class`.\n- `app/Console/Commands/SendProtectionAlerts.php` — escaped morph\n  string `''App\\\\Models\\\\User''` in notifications lookup updated to\n  `''Fynla\\\\Core\\\\Models\\\\User''` (manual; missed by the perl regex\n  because of the double-escape).\n\nSA pack `resolveAppModel(''User'')` shim retired\n----------------------------------------------\n\nSix ZA pack model files (`ZaProtectionPolicy`, `ZaTfsaContribution`,\n`ZaRetirementFundBucket`, `ZaReg28Snapshot`, `ZaHoldingLot`,\n`ZaExchangeControlEntry`) used a runtime-string indirection\n(`self::resolveAppModel(''User'')` building `\\App\\Models\\User` at\nruntime) to dodge PackIsolationTest''s static-import scan. Now that\nUser is in `Fynla\\Core\\Models` — a legit pack→core import path —\ndirect references (`\\Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User::class`) replace the\nshim. Six SA unit test files using the same `$userClass = ''\\\\'' .\n''App'' . ''\\\\Models\\\\User''` pattern updated identically.\n`FamilyMember` references migrated the same way. (The shim is still\ncalled for non-relocated targets — `DCPension`, `SavingsAccount`,\n`Investment\\Holding` — leaving the pre-existing tech debt around\nthose references untouched.)\n\nArchitecture test refresh\n-------------------------\n\n`tests/Architecture/ApplicationArchitectureTest.php` — four\n`expect(''App\\Models'')` arch assertions retargeted to\n`Fynla\\Core\\Models` (post-User move, `app/Models/` is empty, so the\nold expectation would fail vacuously). User exclusion preserved on\nthe `toExtend Eloquent\\Model` rule (User extends Authenticatable).\n\nPre-flight row count\n--------------------\n\nVerified zero rows in `personal_access_tokens.tokenable_type` and\n`audit_logs.model_type` matching `App\\Models\\User` locally — so\nR-14b-viii''s backfill migration is unnecessary in the local DB.\nProduction should re-run the check at deploy time; if non-zero, a\nsingle UPDATE migration covers it.\n\nVerification\n------------\n\n- Architecture suite: 130 / 130 maintained. CoreIndependenceTest\n  green (no `Fynla\\Packs\\` literals in core); PackIsolationTest\n  R-14b-deferred allow-list now empty.\n- Full Pest: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped — baseline maintained.\n  Resolved the 53 pre-fix failures by retiring the SA pack\n  `resolveAppModel(''User'')` shim.\n- Live smoke (php tinker): User loads from core namespace,\n  `dcPensions()` / `protectionProfile()` / `liabilities()` resolve\n  to Illuminate HasMany / HasOne, eager-load + chain calls work.\n\nPlan reference\n--------------\n\nCloses plan § 16b sub-batches vii + viii partial (morph alias not\nneeded locally; config/auth.php updated; sed-replace done). R-14b-ix\nverification is essentially satisfied by this commit''s Pest run —\nwill tag as a separate small commit for documentation hygiene.\n\nR-14b (8/9 — sub-batch vii). Branch tip: refactor/uk-pack-relocation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"922339279ac53f89e7115454c08c3a4ef6163caa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/922339279ac53f89e7115454c08c3a4ef6163caa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDBiNDMyZDU0ZTgwYWFhZWQ5MTI1NWZmZjE4YjMxNmJiOTQ5YTk1NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575","sha":"d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575"}],"sha":"0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/0b432d54e80aaaed91255fff18b316bb949a9570"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T15:35:46Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T15:35:46Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-vii-prep — PackUserRelationProvider contract\n\nAdds a new container-resolved contract for user-scoped pack relations\nthat need full Eloquent Models (not AssetSummary VOs). Prep for User\nrelocation in R-14b-vii proper: User''s per-module hasMany / hasOne\nliterals (Protection profile + 5 policies, Property, Mortgage,\nInvestment, Savings, DC/DB/State pensions, Retirement profile,\nBusiness, Chattel, Cash, Personal, LetterToSpouse) currently keep\nUser pinned to App\\Models\\ — this contract is the resolution path\nthat lets them come out of core.\n\nNew core surface (additive, no behaviour change):\n- core/app/Core/Contracts/PackUserRelationProvider.php — 2 methods:\n  userRelatedModels(userId, type): Collection<Model> for HasMany;\n  userRelatedModel(userId, type):  ?Model            for HasOne.\n- core/app/Core/Query/CompositePackUserRelationProvider.php — walks\n  PackRegistry::codes() and concats / first-non-null per the method\n  semantics; binding key per pack is `pack.{code}.user_relations`.\n\nGB impl (packs/country-gb/src/Query/GbPackUserRelationProvider.php)\nmaps 15 hasMany type tags + 4 hasOne type tags onto the relocated GB\nmodels. Queries `WHERE user_id = ?` only (NOT joint-owner aware) to\nmirror the legacy User `hasMany` semantics. Joint-owner aggregations\nremain on PackAssetRepository::userAccounts.\n\nZA Null impl bound for structural symmetry; real ZA per-module\nsurfaces land in WS 1.x follow-ups.\n\nArchitecture: 130 / 130 maintained. CoreIndependenceTest green (no\n`Fynla\\Packs\\` literals in core files). Pest baseline unchanged at\nthis commit (additive only; consumers don''t touch the contract yet).\n\nR-14b-vii-prep / R-14b (9/9 — sub-batch vii prerequisite)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9787e8d9bae40ae90c946d33fc3a372d58e1c9d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/9787e8d9bae40ae90c946d33fc3a372d58e1c9d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGQ2NWVlOGUyMWE2MDRjN2JkMzhlZjU0MTk3MmYyZDYyZmViZmU1NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c6e77508c6c5e5b64aa484c60c1fe0f9d879e0be","sha":"c6e77508c6c5e5b64aa484c60c1fe0f9d879e0be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c6e77508c6c5e5b64aa484c60c1fe0f9d879e0be"}],"sha":"d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/d65ee8e21a604c7bd38ef541972f2d62febfe575"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c6e77508c6c5e5b64aa484c60c1fe0f9d879e0be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:28:31Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T13:28:31Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): context-clear handover 2026-05-11-session-2 + R-14b ii-vi SHIPPED (5/9)\n\nSession 2 of 2026-05-11 wrapped via /session-end (context-clear mode).\nFive R-14b sub-batches shipped — branch tip eca602f, 100 commits ahead\nof main, Pest 2,825/1 skipped and Architecture 130/130 maintained\nthroughout. PackIsolationTest R-14b-deferred allow-list shrunk -5\nentries (only App\\Models\\User remains pinned; closes in R-14b-vii).\n\nHandover documents: (1) the 5 commits in detail; (2) the architectural\ndecisions taken within PRD § 8 defaults (GoalCalculationEngine contract\nintroduction, Goal FK relation → PackAssetResolver-backed accessors,\nHousehold pack hasMany drop in favour of PackAssetRepository-routed\naccessor); (3) pre-flight row-count check needed before R-14b-vii kicks\noff (personal_access_tokens + audit_logs for legacy App\\Models\\User\nstrings); (4) the auto-continue pickup script for R-14b-vii through ix.\n\nVault state captured separately in canonical\n/Users/CSJ/Desktop/fynlaInter/FynlaInter/ (108 total May commits, May\nIndex session-2 entry, Home.md updated). Legacy fynlaBrain backup\ncontains 7 phantom handover files from prior session''s vault-sync\nagent — flagged in handover for manual cleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4896eff1ccb9d63546f6b798637837c9674d5547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/4896eff1ccb9d63546f6b798637837c9674d5547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/c6e77508c6c5e5b64aa484c60c1fe0f9d879e0be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/o