"2026-05-11T10:56:07Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-vi — relocate Household to core, drop 6 unused pack hasMany\n\nMove Household from app/Models/ to core/app/Core/Models/ under namespace\nFynla\\Core\\Models. The 6 pack-namespaced hasMany methods (properties,\nbusinessInterests, chattels, cashAccounts, investmentAccounts, trusts)\nare dropped — codebase audit showed zero direct caller usage of any of\nthem (no $household->X reads, no $user->household->X chains). The\nhousehold-aggregate read surface they were meant to provide is now\nserved by Fynla\\Core\\Contracts\\PackAssetRepository::householdAssets()\nintroduced in R-14b-i.\n\nReplaced with a single accessor `getHouseholdAssetsAttribute()` that\nroutes through the PackAssetRepository contract — gives future\nconsumers a clean read surface without core needing to import pack\nmodel literals.\n\nKept: users() hasMany (User still in App\\Models pending R-14b-vii;\nuse-imported), familyMembers() hasMany (Fynla\\Core\\Models\\FamilyMember\nsibling).\n\n27 caller imports updated by mechanical sed-replace: 6 pack models\n(Trust, CashAccount, BusinessInterest, InvestmentAccount, Property,\nChattel — each belongsTo(Household)), FamilyMember (core), 11 test\nfiles, 2 seeders, 2 factories. User gained `use Fynla\\Core\\Models\\\nHousehold` so belongsTo(Household::class) still resolves.\n\nPackIsolationTest allow-list -1 (App\\Models\\Household removed). Only\nApp\\Models\\User remains pinned (R-14b-vii closes it).\n\nArchitecture suite: 130/130 green.\nPest suite: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped (baseline maintained).","tree":{"sha":"d57ea9ca6460f77f770567d7c8e51e355a5032bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/d57ea9ca6460f77f770567d7c8e51e355a5032bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/eca602f5be7ca21ebaf797ad505a09450896e1fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/eca602f5be7ca21ebaf797ad505a09450896e1fc","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGVjYTYwMmY1YmU3Y2EyMWViYWY3OTdhZDUwNWEwOTQ1MDg5NmUxZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57","sha":"c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57"}],"sha":"eca602f5be7ca21ebaf797ad505a09450896e1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/eca602f5be7ca21ebaf797ad505a09450896e1fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:48:01Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:48:01Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-v — relocate Goal to core, FK relations → PackAssetResolver\n\nMove Goal from app/Models/ to core/app/Core/Models/ under namespace\nFynla\\Core\\Models. The 3 pack-namespaced FK relations are replaced\nwith accessor-resolved PackAssetResolver lookups so core no longer\nreferences pack model literals:\n\n  - linkedSavingsAccount() belongsTo(SavingsAccount) →\n    getLinkedSavingsAccountAttribute(): ?Model resolving\n    PackAssetResolver->resolveAccount(''gb.savings_account'', $id)\n  - linkedInvestmentAccount() belongsTo(InvestmentAccount) →\n    getLinkedInvestmentAccountAttribute(): ?Model resolving\n    ''gb.investment_account''\n  - savingsAccounts() belongsToMany(SavingsAccount, ''goal_savings_account'') →\n    getSavingsAccountsAttribute(): Collection<Model> querying the\n    pivot table directly and resolving each row via PackAssetResolver.\n    Pivot columns (allocated_amount, is_primary, priority_rank) are not\n    attached — no current caller reads them.\n\nAccessor magic preserves the property-style call surface\n($goal->linkedSavingsAccount, $goal->savingsAccounts) so the caller-\nfacing API is unchanged. Eloquent''s relation-as-method form\n($goal->savingsAccounts()) and with()-eager-load are no longer valid;\n2 call sites adjusted:\n\n  - GoalStrategyService: dropped with([''linkedSavingsAccount'',\n    ''linkedInvestmentAccount'']) (now no-ops; accessor magic does the\n    work at the property-access sites that follow).\n  - SavingsActionDefinitionService: replaced $goal->savingsAccounts()\n    ->exists() with $goal->savingsAccounts->isNotEmpty(); dropped\n    with(''savingsAccounts'') eager-load; pivot subquery preserved at the\n    Collection-iteration call site.\n  - TracksGoalContributions trait: replaced Goal::whereHas(''savingsAccounts'')\n    with an explicit pivot-table subquery (functionally equivalent;\n    works on the new Goal without needing the relation method).\n\nGoalCalculationEngine contract introduced in core to break the second\ncore→pack coupling. Goal''s 8 calculation accessors (progress_percentage,\ndays_remaining, milestones, etc.) call app(GoalCalculationEngine::class)\ninstead of importing Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Goals\\GoalCalculationService directly.\nThe pack''s GoalCalculationService now implements the contract; bound by\nGbPackServiceProvider. CoreIndependenceTest green — the moved Goal has\nzero Fynla\\Packs\\ references.\n\nGoalResource: dropped whenLoaded on linkedSavingsAccount (the relation\nno longer loads via Eloquent; emit the resource based on FK presence).\n\n37 caller imports updated by mechanical sed-replace: app/Services/*,\napp/Models/User.php, packs/country-gb/src/*, tests/, database/. User\ngained `use Fynla\\Core\\Models\\Goal` so hasMany(Goal::class) still\nresolves.\n\nPackIsolationTest allow-list -1 (App\\Models\\Goal removed). Household,\nUser remain pinned until R-14b-vi / vii.\n\nArchitecture suite: 130/130 green.\nPest suite: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped (baseline maintained).","tree":{"sha":"4a949db0f5c7f12ec64e829d1d478ba668236684","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/4a949db0f5c7f12ec64e829d1d478ba668236684"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGM3MGE5MTE2YWM2ZTZhMzY2NzNhYzA2OWI3ZDU2NWZkMWE5ZWZhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b442a2778f34b49b17ae065fc862d94401d6b5bb","sha":"b442a2778f34b49b17ae065fc862d94401d6b5bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b442a2778f34b49b17ae065fc862d94401d6b5bb"}],"sha":"c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/c70a9116ac6e6a36673ac069b7d565fd1a9efa57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b442a2778f34b49b17ae065fc862d94401d6b5bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:30:25Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:30:25Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-iv — relocate 3 clean models to core\n\nMove three clean (no pack-namespaced hasMany literals) models from\napp/Models/ to core/app/Core/Models/ under namespace Fynla\\Core\\Models:\n\n  - GoalContribution (Goal-side audit trail of contributions)\n  - LifeEvent (financial-impact events on the user)\n  - LifeEventAllocation (Life-event → account allocations)\n\nEach model''s internal sibling references (LifeEvent → LifeEventAllocation\nand back) resolve via the new shared Fynla\\Core\\Models namespace. Cross-\nnamespace references to User and Goal land via use imports — both still\nlive in app/Models/ pending R-14b-vi (Household) / vii (User) / v (Goal).\n\n22 caller files updated by mechanical sed-replace:\n  - app/Providers/EventServiceProvider, app/Http/Resources/GoalContributionResource\n  - app/Observers/LifeEventRiskObserver + LifeEventMonteCarloObserver\n  - app/Services/{Goals,AI,Investment/Recommendation}/* (4 files)\n  - packs/country-gb/src/{Agents,Goals,Http/Controllers,Investment,Protection,Traits}/* (9 files)\n  - packs/country-gb/database/seeders/PreviewUserSeeder\n  - database/seeders/ChrisUserSeeder\n  - database/factories/GoalContributionFactory + LifeEventFactory (their $model property)\n  - tests/Unit/Agents/SavingsAgentGoalsTest + tests/Unit/Observers/GoalObserversTest\n\nPackIsolationTest allow-list — 3 of the 6 R-14b-deferred App\\Models\\*\nentries removed (GoalContribution / LifeEvent / LifeEventAllocation).\nGoal, Household, User remain pinned until R-14b-v / vi / vii.\n\nCoreIndependenceTest: green — the moved models reference \\App\\Models\\*\nvia use imports only, not Fynla\\Packs\\* (the test''s only target). The\nApp-namespace references will close out as R-14b-v through vii relocate\nthe remaining 3 deferred models.\n\nArchitecture suite: 130/130 green.\nPest suite: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped (baseline maintained).","tree":{"sha":"c4aea780b4b5b18f5069023abec29c8205aaa7f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/c4aea780b4b5b18f5069023abec29c8205aaa7f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b442a2778f34b49b17ae065fc862d94401d6b5bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co