fb33c0ce60125d7b613854336/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:20:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:20:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-iii — ZA Null query impls + bindings\n\nShip the SA pack Null implementations of the three R-14b-i contracts\nso CompositePack*::iterate(PackRegistry::codes()) finds a real binding\nunder pack.za.* rather than silently skipping.\n\n  - ZaPackAssetRepository (PackAssetRepository) — userAccounts +\n    householdAssets return empty Collections.\n  - ZaPackEstateRepository (PackEstateRepository) — 6 methods return\n    empty Collections / null for the singleton.\n  - ZaPackAssetResolver (PackAssetResolver) — resolveAccount returns\n    null for every type tag.\n\nThree singleton bindings added to ZaPackServiceProvider::register():\npack.za.asset_repo, pack.za.estate_repo, pack.za.asset_resolver. Bound\nfor structural symmetry with GB so Phase 2 can swap in real\nimplementations model-by-model (TFSA, Endowment, RA, living annuity,\nSA Estate surfaces) without re-architecting the composite walk.\n\nLive verification:\n  - app(''pack.za.asset_repo'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Za\\Query\\ZaPackAssetRepository\n  - app(''pack.za.estate_repo'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Za\\Query\\ZaPackEstateRepository\n  - app(''pack.za.asset_resolver'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Za\\Query\\ZaPackAssetResolver\n  - Composite walks both packs; GB returns concrete summaries, ZA\n    contributes 0 (verified earlier in R-14b-ii smoke).\n\nNo PackIsolationTest allow-list entries needed — Query/ imports only\nFynla\\Core\\Contracts\\*, Illuminate framework types, and Eloquent Model.\nPackIsolationTest''s ZA strict-isolation test (no App\\ imports outside\nsrc/Http/) passes because Query/ has none.\n\nArchitecture suite: 130/130 green.\nPest suite: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped (baseline maintained).","tree":{"sha":"03cd3edf29bf3e982f3c4f32ccfce820b01f7e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/03cd3edf29bf3e982f3c4f32ccfce820b01f7e58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/72e9c70a27c7144fb33c0ce60125d7b613854336","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/72e9c70a27c7144fb33c0ce60125d7b613854336","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDcyZTljNzBhMjdjNzE0NGZiMzNjMGNlNjAxMjVkN2I2MTM4NTQzMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6","sha":"fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6"}],"sha":"72e9c70a27c7144fb33c0ce60125d7b613854336","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/72e9c70a27c7144fb33c0ce60125d7b613854336"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:09:43Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:09:43Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-ii — GB query layer implementations\n\nShip the GB pack implementations of the three R-14b-i contracts so the\ncomposite defaults in CoreServiceProvider have a concrete pack to walk:\n\n  - GbPackAssetRepository (PackAssetRepository) — 7 portfolio-shaped\n    models (Property, InvestmentAccount, SavingsAccount, DCPension,\n    DBPension, BusinessInterest, Chattel) → AssetSummary with int-minor\n    valueMinor and pack-scoped type tags (gb.property, gb.investment_account,\n    etc.). userAccounts is joint-owner-aware where the column exists\n    (Property/Savings/Investment/Business/Chattel); DC and DB pensions\n    are personal under UK law and have no joint owner. householdAssets\n    walks users.household_id (avoids a temporary App\\Models\\Household\n    import — Household relocates in R-14b-vi).\n  - GbPackEstateRepository (PackEstateRepository) — 6 Estate methods\n    against the existing GB pack Estate models (Liability, Trust,\n    IHTProfile singleton, Asset, Gift, LastingPowerOfAttorney). Direct\n    WHERE user_id queries, no User import needed.\n  - GbPackAssetResolver (PackAssetResolver) — match on type tag,\n    resolves gb.savings_account → SavingsAccount and\n    gb.investment_account → InvestmentAccount (the two typed FK arrows\n    on Goal). Unknown tags return null per contract.\n\nThree singleton bindings added to GbPackServiceProvider::register():\npack.gb.asset_repo, pack.gb.estate_repo, pack.gb.asset_resolver. The\ncomposite defaults from R-14b-i resolve them via PackRegistry::codes()\nwalk + container lookup of pack.gb.* keys.\n\nLive container verification:\n  - app(''pack.gb.asset_repo'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Query\\GbPackAssetRepository\n  - app(''pack.gb.estate_repo'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Query\\GbPackEstateRepository\n  - app(''pack.gb.asset_resolver'') → Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Query\\GbPackAssetResolver\n  - app(PackAssetRepository::class) → CompositePackAssetRepository\n  - Composite->userAccounts(chris->id) returned 7 AssetSummary objects\n    across Property/Savings/Investment surfaces (seeded data).\n\nNotes on per-model field mapping:\n  - Property display name = address_line_1 + '', '' + city (no `name` column).\n  - DB pension valueMinor uses lump_sum_entitlement — the single capital\n    column on the model. Consumers that need the income stream reach for\n    the concrete model via PackAssetResolver and read\n    accrued_annual_pension directly.\n  - Chattel has a literal `name` column; all other models map their\n    domain-specific name field (scheme_name / account_name /\n    business_name).\n\nNo PackIsolationTest allow-list entries needed — Query/ imports only\ncontracts (Fynla\\Core\\Contracts\\*), AssetSummary (Fynla\\Core\\Query\\*),\npack models (Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Models\\*), and the DB facade.\n\nArchitecture suite: 130/130 green.\nPest suite: 2,825 passed / 1 skipped (baseline maintained).","tree":{"sha":"04b81cea448d29e5c4d6eb1bffdb64ee274f8444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/04b81cea448d29e5c4d6eb1bffdb64ee274f8444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGZlOWM0YTQyMjgxZTFiYzU4ZDg2ZGQ1ZWExY2UxMmUzOTA2ZTc0ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583","sha":"b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583"}],"sha":"fe9c4a42281e1bc58d86dd5ea1ce12e3906e74e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/fe