R-14b-deferred allow-list entries added to\nPackIsolationTest. R-9-final CLOSED.\n\nR-14b-i (commit 9) — container query layer kickoff. 3 typed contracts\n(PackAssetRepository, PackEstateRepository, PackAssetResolver),\nAssetSummary value object (int-minor money, pack-scoped type tags),\n3 composite default implementations walking PackRegistry, and\nCoreServiceProvider singleton bindings. R-14b-i COMPLETE (1/9).\n\nPest 2,825 / 1 skipped baseline maintained throughout. Architecture\n130/130. Next workstream R-14b-ii (GB implementations, ~1.5 hr).\n\nCSJTODO front-of-list (gitignored, local-only) refreshed with R-9-final\nclosure + R-14b-i shipment + next concrete action.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd2ef7bda27f58f0d651dd29a96a0e7d33ee3f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/cd2ef7bda27f58f0d651dd29a96a0e7d33ee3f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGI4ZDNhNTJlZGM3MmUxZGUxNGQxOTJjZjQ1ZmY0NzRjYTkxMmQ1ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4","sha":"946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4"}],"sha":"b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b8d3a52edc72e1de14d192cf45ff474ca912d583"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:11:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:11:35Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14b-i — contracts + AssetSummary VO + composite defaults\n\nAdd the typed contract surface that lets the 6 deferred core models\n(User, Household, Goal, GoalContribution, LifeEvent, LifeEventAllocation)\nrelocate into `core/app/Core/Models/` in sub-batches iv–vii without\ntheir relationship arrows pointing back into the GB pack and tripping\n`CoreIndependenceTest`.\n\nThree contracts (one Eloquent-Collection-returning per consumer shape):\n\n- `PackAssetRepository` — cross-module portfolio reads (investments,\n  savings, retirement, protection, properties, business interests,\n  chattels). Methods `userAccounts(int $userId): Collection<AssetSummary>`\n  and `householdAssets(int $householdId): Collection<AssetSummary>`.\n\n- `PackEstateRepository` — 6 Estate-shaped reads currently held as\n  `hasMany` literals on User. `liabilitiesForUser`, `trustsForUser`,\n  `ihtProfileForUser` (singleton `?Model`), `estateAssetsForUser`,\n  `giftsForUser`, `lpasForUser`.\n\n- `PackAssetResolver` — single-asset FK resolution by `(typeTag, id)`\n  for Goal''s typed FK arrows (`linkedSavingsAccount`,\n  `linkedInvestmentAccount`).\n\n`AssetSummary` value object lives at `core/app/Core/Query/AssetSummary.php`\nwith int-minor money (ADR-005) and a pack-scoped `type` tag convention\n(e.g. `gb.investment_account`). Composite default impls live alongside\nin `core/app/Core/Query/` and iterate `PackRegistry::all()`, resolving\nper-pack repositories via container keys `pack.{code}.asset_repo` /\n`pack.{code}.estate_repo` / `pack.{code}.asset_resolver`. Packs without\nthose keys bound are silently skipped (Phase 1 SA pack is still building\nout its surface and shouldn''t break the composite for primary-GB users).\n\n`CoreServiceProvider::register()` binds all three contracts as\nsingletons resolving to their composites. Verified via direct container\nmake() that the bindings resolve to the composite classes:\n\n  PackAssetRepository -> CompositePackAssetRepository\n  PackEstateRepository -> CompositePackEstateRepository\n  PackAssetResolver -> CompositePackAssetResolver\n\nR-14b-ii (GB implementations) and R-14b-iii (ZA Null implementations)\nwill register the per-pack bindings the composites resolve against.\nR-14b-iv → vii then relocate the 6 deferred models and swap their\nrelationship literals for contract calls.\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (baseline maintained)\n- Architecture 130/130 (CoreIndependenceTest green — initial commit\n  used pack-namespace literals in docblocks which tripped the test;\n  rephrased to \"pack-namespaced\" prose)\n\nFirst of 9 R-14b sub-batches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9237dede69a4b8b8633e0fc45e665dd33d33170a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/9237dede69a4b8b8633e0fc45e665dd33d33170a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDk0NmIzYjFhNGQyNjZjZGM2ZmZmNDhjNzY1ZjI3ZmNhNmM3MWMxYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef","sha":"e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef"}],"sha":"946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/946b3b1a4d266cdc6fff48c765f27fca6c71c1b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:23:40Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:23:40Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-viii — relocate ChattelController to pack — closes R-9-final\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/ChattelController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/ChattelController.php` and bump\nnamespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. Chattel route block\nmoves from `routes/api.php` to `packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`; the\nlegacy `/api/chattels/*` paths continue to resolve via\n`LegacyApiRewrite` which gains a new `api/chattels` entry.\n\n1 new allow-list entry pinned in `PackIsolationTest::$allowed`:\n- `App\\Services\\Chattel\\ChattelCGTService`\n\nChattel model + Requests + Resource already live in the pack; the\nstandalone `App\\Services\\Chattel\\ChattelCGTService` straddles the\nboundary and relocates with a future Chattel services workstream.\n\nR-9-final CLOSED — all 8 UK-specific controllers identified in\nthe R-14b PRD kickoff audit have relocated into the GB pack:\n- R-9-final-i  → GoalsController\n- R-9-final-ii → LifeEventController\n- R-9-final-iii → LifeEventAllocationController\n- R-9-final-iv → HouseholdController\n- R-9-final-v  → PropertyController\n- R-9-final-vi → MortgageController\n- R-9-final-vii → BusinessInterestController\n- R-9-final-viii → ChattelController\n\nThe R-14b \"design against settled call sites\" premise is now satisfied:\nno UK-specific controllers remain in `app/Http/Controllers/Api/`. R-14b\nproper (container query layer + 6 deferred core models) can start at\nsub-batch i (contracts) per `Plans/architecture-plan-v3.md` § 16b.\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (baseline maintained)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `chattels` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list — final `coreResidentPrefixes` list now\n  free of UK-specific module prefixes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f44313a18df20f6688dcc27c6ebca7e55800cc4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/f44313a18df20f6688dcc27c6ebca7e55800cc4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGU2ZGMwNzIyNGFjMWRkNDE1MDYwMDgzOTU0OTI3YTM0ZTFjMTRhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a","sha":"f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a"}],"sha":"e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/e6dc07224ac1dd415060083954927a34e1c14aef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:15:20Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T08:15:20Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-vii — relocate BusinessInterestController to pack\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/BusinessInterestController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/BusinessInterestController.php`\nand bump namespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. BusinessInterest\nroute block moves from `routes/api.php` to\n`packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`; the legacy\n`/api/business-interests/*` paths continue to resolve via\n`LegacyApiRewrite` which gains a new `api/business-interests` entry.\n\n1 new allow-list entry pinned in `PackIsolationTest::$allowed`:\n- `App\\Services\\Business\\BusinessInterestService`\n\nBusinessInterest model + Requests + Resource already live in the pack;\nthe standalone `App\\Services\\Business\\BusinessInterestService` straddles\nthe boundary because it references `App\\Models\\User`. Relocates with a\nfuture Business services workstream (post-R-14b User relocation).\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline — a pre-existing flake\n  in `InvestmentControllerTest::it updates an investment account` may\n  surface 1 failure in full-suite runs; that test passes in isolation\n  20s and is unrelated to this change)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `business-interests` from\n  `coreResidentPrefixes` → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nSeventh of 8 R-9-final controllers; 1 remaining (Chattel — closes the\nbatch).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1dc6fff51ac6cf6493668862e2ba6ab9d57db686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/1dc6fff51ac6cf6493668862e2ba6ab9d57db686"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGY2NjNkYTJmMTkxMzUxZjcxMjIwNzczNzNlNzZkZmNhMzA3YWU3NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/df3470d60f401cfe91e8afbdbfa00b9b5a845f6e","sha":"df3470d60f401cfe91e8afbdbfa00b9b5a845f6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/df3470d60f401cfe91e8afbdbfa00b9b5a845f6e"}],"sha":"f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/f663da2f191351f7122077373e76dfca307ae74a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/df3470d60f401cfe91e8afbdbfa00b9b5a845f6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:55:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:55:51Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-vi — relocate MortgageController to pack\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/MortgageController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/MortgageController.php` and bump\nnamespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. Standalone `/mortgages`\nroute block moves to `packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`; the nested\n`/properties/{id}/mortgages` block (relocated in R-9-final-v with a\ntemporary FQN reference) now swaps the FQN for the short-form\n`MortgageController` import.\n\nLegacy `/api/mortgages/*` paths continue to resolve via\n`LegacyApiRewrite` which gains a new `api/mortgages` entry.\n\n2 new allow-list entries pinned in `PackIsolationTest::$allowed`:\n- `App\\Http\\Requests\\StoreMortgageRequest`\n- `App\\Http\\Requests\\UpdateMortgageRequest`\n\nMortgage model already lives in the pack\n(`Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Models\\Mortgage`); the flat Requests reference\n`App\\Models\\User` and relocate alongside the Property services\nworkstream (post-R-14b User relocation).\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- MortgageControllerTest + MortgageServiceTest all green\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `mortgages` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nSixth of 8 R-9-final controllers; 2 remaining (BusinessInterest,\nChattel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b0ae7c893a01e7e51bf4fb4da65b0bee6f2cdac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/0b0ae7c893a01e7e51bf4fb4da65b0bee6f2cdac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/df3470d60f401cfe91e8afbdbfa00b9b5a845f6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","