/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/82d1699d5b7eac102466c9a292070cdda77634ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:48:59Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:48:59Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-v — relocate PropertyController to pack\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/PropertyController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/PropertyController.php` and bump\nnamespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. Property route block\n(CRUD, tax calculations, nested mortgages) moves to\n`packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`. The nested\n`{propertyId}/mortgages` routes still target the still-in-core\nMortgageController via FQN until R-9-final-vi closes the gap.\n\nLegacy `/api/properties/*` paths continue to resolve via\n`LegacyApiRewrite` which gains a new `api/properties` entry.\n\n5 new allow-list entries pinned in `PackIsolationTest::$allowed`:\n- `App\\Http\\Requests\\StorePropertyRequest`\n- `App\\Http\\Requests\\UpdatePropertyRequest`\n- `App\\Services\\Property\\MortgageService`\n- `App\\Services\\Property\\PropertyService`\n- `App\\Services\\Property\\PropertyTaxService`\n\nProperty model already lives in the pack\n(`Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Models\\Property`); the flat Requests + `app/Services/\nProperty/*` services straddle the boundary because they reference\n`App\\Models\\User`. They relocate fully alongside a follow-up Property\nservices workstream (post-R-14b User relocation).\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- PropertyControllerTest + PropertyServiceTest + PropertyTaxServiceTest\n  all green\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `properties` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nFifth of 8 R-9-final controllers; 3 remaining (Mortgage,\nBusinessInterest, Chattel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7548d2a25f574fff0ea73498fda5ac425cbe6517","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/7548d2a25f574fff0ea73498fda5ac425cbe6517"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/82d1699d5b7eac102466c9a292070cdda77634ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/82d1699d5b7eac102466c9a292070cdda77634ef","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDgyZDE2OTlkNWI3ZWFjMTAyNDY2YzlhMjkyMDcwY2RkYTc3NjM0ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b66eb298b92ea3fdb95b193b70594d50227ce2a9","sha":"b66eb298b92ea3fdb95b193b70594d50227ce2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b66eb298b92ea3fdb95b193b70594d50227ce2a9"}],"sha":"82d1699d5b7eac102466c9a292070cdda77634ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/82d1699d5b7eac102466c