lowed` so the pack HouseholdController can\nimport it across the boundary.\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline; a flaky test surfaces\n  intermittently across the full-suite run on this branch — pre-existing\n  and not introduced here)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `household` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nFourth of 8 R-9-final controllers; 4 remaining (Property, Mortgage,\nBusinessInterest, Chattel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02d5ce0c5b84ef31e72cdb4081539c01623232d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/02d5ce0c5b84ef31e72cdb4081539c01623232d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b66eb298b92ea3fdb95b193b70594d50227ce2a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b66eb298b92ea3fdb95b193b70594d50227ce2a9","node_id