ationController.php`\nand bump namespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`.\n\nNo route changes: this controller has no route registration anywhere in\nthe repo (frontend `goalsService.js` calls `/life-events/{id}/allocations`\nbut the endpoint is currently a 404 — a pre-existing bug, out of scope\nfor R-9-final). The file move keeps the pack-controller layout\ncomplete; route wiring is a follow-up.\n\nAll controller imports already covered by existing allow-list entries\n(Controller, SanitizedErrorResponse, LifeEvent, LifeEventAllocation,\nLifeEventAllocationService).\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline)\n- Architecture 130/130\n\nThird of 8 R-9-final controllers; 5 remaining (Household, Property,\nMortgage, BusinessInterest, Chattel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e82d48832eb4ba04ac9d8de52b4e0d9151b507dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/e82d48832eb4ba04ac9d8de52b4e0d9151b507dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/bf802c9dd2ca99219c6fc5a71170d3fd42e718e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred