e":"2026-05-11T07:16:13Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-ii — relocate LifeEventController to pack\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/LifeEventController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/LifeEventController.php` and bump\nnamespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. LifeEvent route block\nmoves from `routes/api.php` to `packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`; the\nlegacy `/api/life-events/*` paths continue to resolve via\n`LegacyApiRewrite` which gains a new `api/life-events` entry.\n\n`StoreLifeEventRequest` + `UpdateLifeEventRequest` wrap the deferred\n`App\\Models\\LifeEvent` (one of the 6 R-14b core models) and are pinned\nin `PackIsolationTest::$allowed` until R-14b sub-batch vi relocates the\nLifeEvent model + its Request bundle together.\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from baseline)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `life-events` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nSecond of 8 R-9-final controllers; 6 remaining (LifeEventAllocation,\nHousehold, Property, Mortgage, BusinessInterest, Chattel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2b3c9941ee23d3bce0b9e02d7e119620fe1bf37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/a2b3c9941ee23d3bce0b9e02d7e119620fe1bf37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/4c83dac42b43a00ca3a1d9908eeff465feba0f17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/4c83dac42b43a00ca3a1d9908eeff465feba0f17","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDRjODNkYWM0MmI0M2EwMGNhM2ExZDk5MDhlZWZmNDY1ZmViYTBmMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/b418fbb45378df75c194735dcdd021e249852136","sha":"b418fbb45378df75c194735dcdd021e249852136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b418fbb45378df75c194735dcdd021e249852136"}],"sha":"4c83dac42b43a00ca3a1d9908eeff465feba0f17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/4c83dac42b43a00ca3a1d9908eeff465feba0f17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/b418fbb45378df75c194735dcdd021e249852136/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:57:50Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T06:57:50Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-9-final-i — relocate GoalsController to pack\n\nMove `app/Http/Controllers/Api/GoalsController.php` →\n`packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/GoalsController.php` and bump\nnamespace to `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Http\\Controllers`. Goals route block moves\nfrom `routes/api.php` to `packs/country-gb/routes/api.php`; the legacy\n`/api/goals/*` paths continue to resolve via `LegacyApiRewrite` which\ngains a new `api/goals` entry.\n\nThe 4 `App\\Http\\` imports (`StoreGoalRequest`, `UpdateGoalRequest`,\n`GoalContributionResource`, `GoalResource`) wrap `App\\Models\\Goal` —\none of the 6 R-14b deferred core models — so they''re pinned in\n`PackIsolationTest::$allowed` until R-14b sub-batch vi relocates the\nGoal model + its Request/Resource bundle together.\n\nTests:\n- Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped (unchanged from session start baseline)\n- Architecture 130/130\n- LegacyApiRewriteTest moves `goals` from `coreResidentPrefixes`\n  → `prefixes` (rewritten) list\n\nFirst of 8 R-9-final controllers; R-9 closes once the remaining 7\n(LifeEvent, LifeEventAllocation, Household, Property, Mortgage,\nBusinessInterest, Chattel) relocate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37efa83abdf43d242f9fe8aa1f2864e6db4e2b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/37efa83abdf43d242f9fe8aa1f2864e6db4e2b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/b418fbb45378df75c194735dcdd021e249852136","verification":{"payload":null,"reas