r_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cf4e6de6844d5dbed055eb4b507dd995b9038d75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T12:43:11Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T12:43:11Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): end-of-day handover 2026-05-10-session-1 — R-14b PRD shipped + plan re-scope\n\nWraps session 4 of 2026-05-09 (end-of-day mode). Tomorrow''s session-start\nhandover lives at May/May10Updates/handover-2026-05-10-session-1.md and\nmirrors to both vault roots (fynlaInter/FynlaInter canonical + fynlaBrain\nlegacy backup, byte-identical).\n\nToday''s totals (4 sessions): 5 commits — 1 docs(prd) (this session), 1\ndocs(session) (session 3 wrap), 2 refactor(uk-pack) R-14a-Traits-i+ii,\n1 refactor(uk-pack) R-14a-Tax-v carried over from session 1.\n\nBranch tip ce48565, 83 commits ahead of main, all pushed. Pest baseline\n2,825 / 1 skipped maintained. Architecture 130/130. Working tree clean.\n\nNext session pickup: R-9-final-i (relocate GoalsController to GB pack —\nthe heaviest of 8 R-9 residuals at 15 Goal:: static calls), then the\nremaining 7 R-9-final controllers, then R-14b proper at sub-batch i\n(contracts). Plan § 16b has the per-sub-batch decomposition. PRD at\nMay/May9Updates/PRD-r-14b-container-query-layer.md is the implementation\ncontract. Strategy B does NOT apply to R-14b — relationship literals\ncome out of core models entirely; caller updates are mandatory.\n\nCSJTODO.md updated locally (gitignored — not in this commit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a44cab2e3e8e3ba901722aa258b66b1df99a13ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/a44cab2e3e8e3ba901722aa258b66b1df99a13ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/cf4e6de6844d5dbed055eb4b507dd995b9038d75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/cf4e6de6844d5dbed055eb4b507dd995b9038d75","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKGNmNGU2ZGU2ODQ0ZDVkYmVkMDU1ZWI0YjUwN2RkOTk1YjkwMzhkNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/ce48565c428413191695dcb0c7e3781fbcc05388","sha":"ce48565c428413191695dcb0c7e3781fbcc05388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ce48565c428413191695dcb0c7e3781fbcc05388"}],"sha":"cf4e6de6844d5dbed055eb4b507dd995b9038d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/cf4e6de6844d5dbed055eb4b507dd995b9038d75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/ce48565c428413191695dcb0c7e3781fbcc05388/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T12:31:30Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T12:31:30Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(prd): R-14b PRD complete — re-scope plan § 16b after kickoff audit\n\nDrove the R-14b kickoff through the prd-writer flow with parallel audit\nsubagents (feature-dev:code-architect for architectural fit, feature-dev:\ncode-explorer for consumer-surface enumeration). Saved the canonical PRD\nto May/May9Updates/PRD-r-14b-container-query-layer.md (9-section template,\ninfrastructure persona since R-14b is structural-only). Spec unchanged\n(architecture-spec-v3.md § 5 already designated the 6 models as core-\nresident — design intent was correct, only the plan needed re-scoping).\n\nPlan amendments to architecture-plan-v3.md (+91 / -34):\n\n1. Single AssetQueryService → three typed contracts (PackAssetRepository\n   for aggregations, PackEstateRepository for typed Estate queries that\n   are independently called, PackAssetResolver for Goal''s typed FK\n   arrows). Grounded in actual coupling shape: User has 6 Estate methods\n   never merged into a flat collection; Goal has typed FK pointers that\n   don''t fit ownedBy(). Single-contract design forces type-filtering in\n   core, which is worse abstraction than starting typed.\n\n2. R-9-final pre-condition added (~1.5 hr, NOT numbered as R-14b-N):\n   8 UK-specific controllers still in app/Http/Controllers/Api/ —\n   GoalsController (15 Goal:: static calls), LifeEventController,\n   LifeEventAllocationController, HouseholdController, PropertyController,\n   MortgageController, BusinessInterestController, ChattelController.\n   Closing them first means the contract surface is designed against\n   settled call sites, not a moving target.\n\n3. Estimate revised 5 hr → 11 hr provisional, decomposed into 9 sub-\n   batches (R-14b-i contracts → R-14b-ix verification). Plan total\n   bumped 61 hr → 67 hr. Audit data driving: 417 import lines to\n   update, 64 method-call sites to redirect, 162 test files referencing\n   App\\Models\\User, 103 GB pack files referencing the old namespace.\n\n4. UserResource added to scope (sub-batch R-14b-vii) — the allow-list\n   comment at PackIsolationTest.php:224-228 already promised this; the\n   plan task list previously omitted it.\n\n5. Morph-map risk re-bounded: audit found NO App\\Models\\User strings\n   in the 2 GB pack morphTo tables. Actual exposure is Sanctum''s\n   personal_access_tokens.tokenable_type and audit_logs.model_type.\n   Mitigation: register morph alias ''user'' => Fynla\\Core\\Models\\User::class\n   in CoreServiceProvider + targeted backfill only if production row\n   counts > 0.\n\n6. Verified 0 global scopes on the 6 models (no risk).\n\nFrontmatter records the amendment date and links the PRD. Status line\nupdated: \"R-0 → R-14a CLOSED (14/14); R-14b PRD complete; R-9-final\npending kickoff.\"\n\nDecisions taken without asking per CSJ''s no-stopping instruction (PRD §\n8 lists all 6 with rationale; CSJ can redirect at implementation kickoff\nif needed): three contracts not one, R-9-final as separate pre-condition\nbatch, UserResource in scope, 11 hr realistic, morph-alias-first\nstrategy, Goal FK arrows through PackAssetResolver.\n\nBranch tip 506e573 + this commit; still 82 R-14a refactor commits ahead\nof main; uncommitted: none. Pest 2,825 / 1 skipped baseline maintained\n(no code touched).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a5ae65d2be6ed51279303c0713caead4ae7d41f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/8a5ae65d2be6ed51279303c0713caead4ae7d41f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/ce48565c428413191695dcb0c7e3781fbcc05388","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: