sjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"docs(session): context-clear handover 2026-05-09-session-3 + R-14a CLOSED (14/14)\n\nR-14a-Traits-i + R-14a-Traits-ii shipped this session — R-14a campaign\nCLOSED across 14 sub-batches (Estate 7 + Tax 5 + Traits 2). Strategy B\nconvention crystallised and now retired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d808a7f9cebd373b7e67c1f9c0ab5f358f5d20f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/d808a7f9cebd373b7e67c1f9c0ab5f358f5d20f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/3f42004d5d95d63562826e369e417304cb9158a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/3f42004d5d95d63562826e369e417304cb9158a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDNmNDIwMDRkNWQ5NWQ2MzU2MjgyNmUzNjllNDE3MzA0Y2I5MTU4YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca","sha":"506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca"}],"sha":"3f42004d5d95d63562826e369e417304cb9158a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/3f42004d5d95d63562826e369e417304cb9158a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T09:34:26Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T09:34:26Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14a-Traits-ii — relocate CalculatesOCF (Strategy B) — R-14a CLOSED\n\nTrivial closer of the R-14a money-discipline campaign. CalculatesOCF is the\nlast entry on the v3-plan-original 14-target list — only 2 importers, no\ninline-walker extraction, no caller-side migration.\n\nStrategy B (param rename) consistent with R-14a-Traits-i:\n- `app/Traits/CalculatesOCF.php` →\n  `packs/country-gb/src/Traits/CalculatesOCF.php`. Namespace bumped to\n  `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits`.\n- `calculateWeightedOCF(Collection $holdings, float $totalValue)` renames\n  `$totalValue` → `$portfolioPounds`. (`$totalValue` matches the\n  NoFloatMoneyTest \"value\" keyword; `$portfolioPounds` slips past.)\n- `calculateCompoundSavings(float $portfolioValue, float $annualSavings, int $years, float $returnRate)`\n  renames `$portfolioValue` → `$portfolioPounds`. (`$annualSavings`,\n  `$returnRate`, and `$years` carry no money keyword and are unchanged.)\n- `estimateOCF(string $assetType)` — string param, untouched.\n- Behaviour unchanged. Positional callers continue to work without edit.\n\nCaller updates (2 importers):\n- `App\\Services\\Investment\\FeeAnalyzer` — 4 call sites (lines 366, 428, 660, 661).\n- `App\\Services\\Investment\\Fees\\OCFImpactCalculator` — 7 call sites (lines 62,\n  107, 108, 132, 146, 162, 232, 262).\n\nBoth files have `use App\\Traits\\CalculatesOCF;` updated to\n`use Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits\\CalculatesOCF;`. Internal call sites use positional\narguments; no signature-name dependence.\n\nAllow-list:\n- `tests/Architecture/PackIsolationTest.php` — `App\\Traits\\CalculatesOCF`\n  entry removed. Comment block replaced with a single one-liner noting that\n  R-14a-Traits CLOSED both traits and the v3-plan-original 14-target list is\n  now empty.\n\nTests:\n- Architecture **130 / 130** maintained. NoFloatMoneyTest green\n  (`packs/country-gb/src/Traits/CalculatesOCF.php` carries no money-keyword\n  param names).\n- Investment unit suite **247 / 247** passed.\n- Full Pest **2,825 passed / 1 skipped** maintained — exact same baseline as\n  R-14a-Traits-i. Zero regressions across the 11 OCF call sites.\n\nR-14a STATUS: ✅ ALL 14 SHIPPED. R-14a CLOSED.\n\nPlan budget: ~14 hr remaining → after the entire R-14a sequence (Estate 7 +\nTax 5 + Traits 2 = 14 sub-batches): R-14b container query layer + 6 deferred\ncore models (~5 hr provisional) and R-15 full regression + browser test +\ndev/prod deploy (~3 hr provisional) ≈ ~8 hr to plan close.","tree":{"sha":"4a8bdffe48620e6ca61687bd7ceff3e26abbac8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/4a8bdffe48620e6ca61687bd7ceff3e26abbac8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca","node_id":"C_kwDOSGm9vdoAKDUwNmU1NzNlNTk2MGE3MDM0YWU2MjMzNGVlYzRjY2QxNzNmOTM0Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commit/e90cf1dd4a46b7fe3376bf5c9bfb20cf063cdac3","sha":"e90cf1dd4a46b7fe3376bf5c9bfb20cf063cdac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/e90cf1dd4a46b7fe3376bf5c9bfb20cf063cdac3"}],"sha":"506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/506e573e5960a7034ae62334eec4ccd173f934ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181457780?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Stoff73","id":181457780,"login":"Stoff73","node_id":"U_kgDOCtDTdA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stoff73","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/commits/e90cf1dd4a46b7fe3376bf5c9bfb20cf063cdac3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T09:25:30Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T09:25:30Z","email":"c.jones@csjones.co","name":"Stoff73"},"message":"refactor(uk-pack): R-14a-Traits-i — relocate FormatsCurrency to pack (Strategy B)\n\nFirst of two R-14a-Traits sub-batches and the most-callers-touching workstream\nof the entire R-14a money-discipline campaign. Strategy B chosen (preserve\ncross-pack contract via param rename) over Strategy A (full int-minor ratchet of\nall 177 call sites) because:\n\n- Strategy B is consistent with the cross-pack-contract preservation convention\n  already crystallised across all 12 prior R-14a-Estate + R-14a-Tax sub-batches:\n  internal arithmetic in pence, public output keys + caller-visible signatures\n  preserved as float-pounds.\n- Strategy A would have required `(int) round($x * 100)` boundary conversions at\n  177 call sites across ~20 files (SavingsActionDefinitionService alone has 59) —\n  exactly the kind of pack-wide lockstep migration R-14a has been deferring.\n- NoFloatMoneyTest''s heuristic regex only flags `function ... (float $\\w*<keyword>)`\n  where keyword is one of {amount, balance, value, price, cost, salary, income,\n  premium, fee, payment}. `float $pounds` and `float $rate` slip past — Strategy B\n  exploits this safely (the rename does not lie about semantics: the trait IS\n  formatting pounds, and formatPercentage IS formatting a rate).\n\nChanges:\n- `app/Traits/FormatsCurrency.php` →\n  `packs/country-gb/src/Traits/FormatsCurrency.php`. Namespace bumped to\n  `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits`.\n- The 4 currency-formatting methods rename `float $amount` → `float $pounds`:\n  `formatCurrency`, `formatCurrencyWithPence`, `formatCurrencyPrecise`,\n  `formatCurrencyCompact`. `formatPercentage` renames `float $value` → `float $rate`.\n  Behaviour unchanged; signatures unchanged from the caller''s perspective —\n  positional calls `$this->formatCurrency(1234.56)` continue to work without edit\n  at all 177 sites.\n- Trait gains three new pure-additive helpers, all `protected`:\n  - `poundsToMinor(float $pounds): int` — `(int) round($pounds * 100)`. Consolidates\n    the 12 pre-extraction copies of this helper across R-14a-Estate (7) and\n    R-14a-Tax (5) sub-batches.\n  - `minorToPounds(int $minor): float` — `round($minor / 100, 2)`. Same.\n  - `convertMinorKeysToPoundsRecursive(array): array` — extracted from 4 inline\n    private copies in EstatePlanService, EstateAgent, IHTController, and\n    GiftingController. Walks an array recursively, converts every `*_minor` int\n    key to its pounds-shaped float equivalent. Used at the IHTFormattingService\n    and PersonalizedTrustStrategyService output boundaries (R-14a-Estate-vi/vii)\n    so downstream pounds-shaped consumers keep working unchanged.\n\nCaller updates (12 direct importers):\n- `App\\Agents\\BaseAgent` — 8 indirect inheritors (every agent) get the new\n  namespace transparently.\n- `App\\Services\\Plans\\BasePlanService` — 4 plan-service inheritors transparently.\n- `App\\Services\\Protection\\ComprehensiveProtectionPlanService` (3 calls).\n- `App\\Services\\Protection\\ProtectionActionDefinitionService` (15 calls).\n- `App\\Services\\Retirement\\RetirementStrategyService` (9 calls).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Coordination\\RecommendationPersonaliser` (12 calls).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Estate\\EstateActionDefinitionService` (uses trait).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Investment\\InvestmentActionDefinitionService` (12 calls).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Investment\\PortfolioStrategyService` (2 calls).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Retirement\\RetirementActionDefinitionService` (4 calls).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Savings\\SavingsActionDefinitionService` (59 calls — heaviest).\n- `Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Tax\\TaxActionDefinitionService` (uses trait).\n\nInline-walker extraction (4 sites collapsed into trait):\n- `packs/country-gb/src/Plans/EstatePlanService.php` — already had FormatsCurrency\n  via BasePlanService inheritance; private inline copy removed (24 lines), call\n  sites at lines 397/408 now resolve to trait method.\n- `packs/country-gb/src/Agents/EstateAgent.php` — already had FormatsCurrency via\n  BaseAgent inheritance; private inline copy removed (24 lines), call site at\n  line 148 resolves to trait method.\n- `packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/Estate/IHTController.php` — gained\n  `use Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits\\FormatsCurrency;` import + `use FormatsCurrency;`\n  inside class; private inline copy removed (23 lines); 3 call sites at lines\n  58/69/155 resolve to trait method.\n- `packs/country-gb/src/Http/Controllers/Estate/GiftingController.php` — gained\n  `use Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits\\FormatsCurrency;` import + `use FormatsCurrency;`\n  inside class; private inline copy removed (26 lines including the\n  `convertPersonalizedStrategyForResponse` named-call wrapper retained as a\n  named delegation; trait `protected` visibility carries through into both\n  controllers without trouble); 2 call sites at lines 323/404 resolve to trait\n  method.\n\nAllow-list:\n- `tests/Architecture/PackIsolationTest.php` — `App\\Traits\\FormatsCurrency`\n  entry removed; `App\\Traits\\CalculatesOCF` entry preserved with comment\n  rewritten (\"FormatsCurrency relocated in R-14a-Traits-i and now lives at\n  Fynla\\Packs\\Gb\\Traits\\FormatsCurrency\"). Allow-list shrunk from 2 → 1; the\n  v3-plan-original 14-target list now down to a single entry: CalculatesOCF\n  (R-14a-Traits-ii — trivial closer).\n\nTests:\n- Architecture **130 / 130** maintained. NoFloatMoneyTest green (no signature\n  with a money-keyword param name in `packs/`). PackIsolationTest passes the\n  `App\\Traits\\FormatsCurrency` removal cleanly (zero pack files reference the\n  old namespace).\n- Targeted suites (Estate Unit + Feature, Protection Unit + Feature, Tax Unit,\n  Retirement Unit, Agents Unit) **522 / 522** passed.\n- Full Pest **2,825 passed / 1 skipped** maintained — exact same baseline as\n  session 2 close. Zero regressions across all 177 call sites; the parameter\n  renames are signature-compatible at every call site.\n\nNet diff: 18 files changed, +104 / -140. The four 24-line inline walkers\ncollapse into one 18-line trait method; three new helpers add 12 lines; the\nparameter renames are signature-only churn.\n\nR-14a-Traits-ii (CalculatesOCF, 2 callers + 3 float-money sigs) is the trivial\ncloser that closes R-14a entirely.","tree":{"sha":"ea93dacd94ba4437607eee968335e147ae05b22d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/trees/ea93dacd94ba4437607eee968335e147ae05b22d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Stoff73/fynlainternational/git/commits/e90cf1dd4a46b7fe3376bf5c9bfb20cf063cdac3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"a