,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/750c9498bc950a5125467fa0441a261b63e7f984/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:39:30Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T17:39:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: improve core boot, offline support and app registration (#40)\n\n* feat: Add welcome flow and multi-account relay\n\nIntroduces the Mazmot welcome app with tap-through onboarding, background official app installs, and home app listing. Also adds the mascot component demo, updates the official app manifest, and expands the AI relay admin to keep multiple saved servers with switch/disconnect flows and matching e2e coverage.\n\n* feat(mz/comps): 新增 `<m-mascot>` 相机机器人吉祥物组件\n\n新增 mascot 组件（state 支持默认/happy/angry/soulless，可调尺寸与眼色），\n并在 official-apps/welcome 引导页中以真实组件替换原灰色圆圈占位。\n\n* chore(welcome): 将欢迎应用从 official-apps 移至 main\n\n* feat(main): 将 welcome 改造为主应用并重构应用管理\n\n* refactor(welcome): 重构欢迎应用并移除旧配置文件\n\n移除 __app.json、app-config.js、app.json 等旧文件，更新 lib 和 pages 下的逻辑与页面，新增 welcome-plan 及测试页面。\n\n* feat(启动页): 支持多语言词条与语言校准\n\n* Delete plan-sess_99676e4e-5db0-406a-8fd1-ef6258e46dc2.md\n\n* feat(mascot): 新增吉祥物组件 demo 与 mascot 页面并升级版本至 1.5.0\n\n* docs: 补充根 index.html 的 /gh/ 动态源选择说明\n\n更新 AGENTS.md 与 CONTEXT.md，记录根入口按\nnavigator.serviceWorker.controller 探测 NoneOS Core SW\n是否已接管页面，动态选择 /gh/ 本地前缀或 jsdelivr，\n并将决策写入 window.__GH_BASE。\n\n* feat(welcome): 优化提供商选择默认邀请码与占位符\n\n- 将 relay (邀请码) 选项移至首位并设为默认值\n- 根据所选提供商动态显示对应输入占位符\n\n* pack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"df269846b817405c9aecbbc677223c8e9bbd65a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/df269846b817405c9aecbbc677223c8e9bbd65a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/750c9498bc950a5125467fa0441a261b63e7f984","verification":{"payload":"tree df269846b817405c9aecbbc677223c8e9bbd65a9\nparent 5f08df8082aa75ac97f671a6ad4a7269e7173403\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1790703570 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790703570 +0800\n\nfeat: improve core boot, offline support and app registration (#40)\n\n* feat: Add welcome flow and multi-account relay\n\nIntroduces the Mazmot welcome app with tap-through onboarding, background official app installs, and home app listing. Also adds the mascot component demo, updates the official app manifest, and expands the AI relay admin to keep multiple saved servers with switch/disconnect flows and matching e2e coverage.\n\n* feat(mz/comps): 新增 `<m-mascot>` 相机机器人吉祥物组件\n\n新增 mascot 组件（state 支持默认/happy/angry/soulless，可调尺寸与眼色），\n并在 official-apps/welcome 引导页中以真实组件替换原灰色圆圈占位。\n\n* chore(welcome): 将欢迎应用从 official-apps 移至 main\n\n* feat(main): 将 welcome 改造为主应用并重构应用管理\n\n* refactor(welcome): 重构欢迎应用并移除旧配置文件\n\n移除 __app.json、app-config.js、app.json 等旧文件，更新 lib 和 pages 下的逻辑与页面，新增 welcome-plan 及测试页面。\n\n* feat(启动页): 支持多语言词条与语言校准\n\n* Delete plan-sess_99676e4e-5db0-406a-8fd1-ef6258e46dc2.md\n\n* feat(mascot): 新增吉祥物组件 demo 与 mascot 页面并升级版本至 1.5.0\n\n* docs: 补充根 index.html 的 /gh/ 动态源选择说明\n\n更新 AGENTS.md 与 CONTEXT.md，记录根入口按\nnavigator.serviceWorker.controller 探测 NoneOS Core SW\n是否已接管页面，动态选择 /gh/ 本地前缀或 jsdelivr，\n并将决策写入 window.__GH_BASE。\n\n* feat(welcome): 优化提供商选择默认邀请码与占位符\n\n- 将 relay (邀请码) 选项移至首位并设为默认值\n- 根据所选提供商动态显示对应输入占位符\n\n* pack\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu/fSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAILAQAILnA/ZIzsPUm7+zoo8ykRjA\nAJSgZaKg1xVcu6P/H+MJRwrRItA9lhdTH5265moy9WAdff/SmlUL3gc6kxcSR75W\ntkh+wqpkF82Fchn9XM9EDD5YxD/XKik/xY35Xu1gj/qxMwMUBQjWDCxSMMJjEw/u\nNljeIgi8VrwVGUTnnhoHcWvrsVISp5KivRrvxWWztH5Cxw4kOVbI4U25QI05C/su\nAfCcny810RKu2MKlCEKI