com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/e9b04d5d20205f7b3953ef324881174f937ca322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:37:20Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:37:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Enhance AI App Builder with navigation, state management, and UI updates (#34)\n\n* feat: Add AI App Builder official app\n\n* style(ai-app-builder): 优化侧边栏标签页样式与结构\n\n1. 调整tab标签为图标+文字组合样式，统一图标尺寸与间距\n2. 修改侧边栏头部标题为「资源」，更新各tab项文本与图标\n3. 调整panel-body顶部内边距与新建按钮外边距\n4. 修正部分样式选择器适配新的tab结构\n\nfeat: 实现多项目标签式导航与会话标题展示\n\n新增项目抽屉侧边栏，支持跨标签复用已打开项目；重构顶栏布局，按项目状态展示对应标题；添加发送/停止按钮切换逻辑，完善仓库与页面的状态同步与URL参数管理。\n\nrefactor(ai-app-builder): 抽离业务逻辑到builder-store状态仓库\n\n将AI应用构建器的全部业务逻辑从页面中抽离为独立可观察状态仓库，页面仅负责视图渲染与交互，所有业务变更通过仓库方法处理，彻底分离UI与业务逻辑，解决页面作用域变量错乱问题，同时统一了上下文切换的代码路径。\n\n* feat: Add key disable, rename ai-app-builder to conjure\n\nAdds setKeyDisabled API to mz/ai (with UI in ai-manager and tests) so keys can be temporarily disabled; getAssistant skips disabled keys and throws on access by id. Improves ai chain usage aggregation to include cache hit/miss fields. Renames official app ai-app-builder → conjure (files, manifests, docs, UI). Adds auto-initialize when write_file skips create_app (ensureAppInitialized + onAppCreated), per-session message buckets, thinking mode, session resize, skill install/update flows and UI. Adds .agents skill zip, build-skill script, and updates bump/package.json to emit skill version/zip.\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(test): 修正测试文件中的模块导入路径与一处判断逻辑\n\n1. 调整所有测试文件的导入路径，将../xxx改为../lib/xxx以匹配源码目录结构\n2. 修复unzipText测试中的文件匹配判断逻辑，补充了缺失的参数\n3. 为sb-test环境添加了/nos/fs模块加载的容错处理，避免环境缺失导致测试失败\n\n* fix ci\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4964d4e7eaf0e9d85e6c8bcdc7985fab0489a561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/4964d4e7eaf0e9d85e6c8bcdc7985fab0489a561"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/e9b04d5d20205f7b3953ef324881174f937ca322","verification":{"payload":"tree 4964d4e7eaf0e9d85e6c8bcdc7985fab0489a561\nparent 19d07887560158846d419dcddf725baebd98db9e\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1788367040 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788367040 +0800\n\nfeat: Enhance AI App Builder with navigation, state management, and UI updates (#34)\n\n* feat: Add AI App Builder official app\n\n* style(ai-app-builder): 优化侧边栏标签页样式与结构\n\n1. 调整tab标签为图标+文字组合样式，统一图标尺寸与间距\n2. 修改侧边栏头部标题为「资源」，更新各tab项文本与图标\n3. 调整panel-body顶部内边距与新建按钮外边距\n4. 修正部分样式选择器适配新的tab结构\n\nfeat: 实现多项目标签式导航与会话标题展示\n\n新增项目抽屉侧边栏，支持跨标签复用已打开项目；重构顶栏布局，按项目状态展示对应标题；添加发送/停止按钮切换逻辑，完善仓库与页面的状态同步与URL参数管理。\n\nrefactor(ai-app-builder): 抽离业务逻辑到builder-store状态仓库\n\n将AI应用构建器的全部业务逻辑从页面中抽离为独立可观察状态仓库，页面仅负责视图渲染与交互，所有业务变更通过仓库方法处理，彻底分离UI与业务逻辑，解决页面作用域变量错乱问题，同时统一了上下文切换的代码路径。\n\n* feat: Add key disable, rename ai-app-builder to conjure\n\nAdds setKeyDisabled API to mz/ai (with UI in ai-manager and tests) so keys can be temporarily disabled; getAssistant skips disabled keys and throws on access by id. Improves ai chain usage aggregation to include cache hit/miss fields. Renames official app ai-app-builder → conjure (files, manifests, docs, UI). Adds auto-initialize when write_file skips create_app (ensureAppInitialized + onAppCreated), per-session message buckets, thinking mode, session resize, skill install/update flows and UI. Adds .agents skill zip, build-skill script, and updates bump/package.json to emit skill version/zip.\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* fix(test): 修正测试文件中的模块导入路径与一处判断逻辑\n\n1. 调整所有测试文件的导入路径，将../xxx改为../lib/xxx以匹配源码目录结构\n2. 修复unzipText测试中的文件匹配判断逻辑，补充了缺失的参数\n3. 为sb-test环境添加了/nos/fs模块加载的容错处理，避免环境缺失导致测试失败\n\n* fix ci\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","si