ived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/f7d187b4e6af5dd301719646eb77cc65bd9a3b40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:12:53Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T16:12:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add cred-hub server, UI components, and configuration updates (#30)\n\n* feat: Add cred-hub server, CF worker, pairing UI\n\n* feat(cred-manager+cred-hub): 添加上传大小限制与凭证中心选择组件\n\n1. 新增 cred-server-select 组件统一管理配对服务器选择与自定义存储\n2. 为 cred-hub 两个版本添加请求体大小上限拦截（默认2048字节），验签前拦截超限请求\n3. 重构 cred-manager 页面，移除重复的服务器选择逻辑，复用新组件\n4. 补充相关文档、测试用例与配置注释\n\n* chore: release cred-hub to 1.0.0, add config system and cred-client\n\n1. 升级cred-hub版本到1.0.0，新增TOML配置支持，替换原有环境变量方案\n2. 添加cred-hub浏览器端管理面板cred-client，纯静态无依赖\n3. 更新文档与gitignore，新增配置示例文件与相关依赖\n\n* docs(cred-hub): 重构配置说明与实现，适配CF wrangler同构格式\n\n更新了文档与代码，将配置改为与CF版wrangler.toml的[vars]段同构，调整了配置加载优先级与环境变量匹配逻辑，统一了配置项命名\n\n* chore(server/cred-hub-cf): add wrangler.toml example config file\n\n添加了 Cloudflare Worker 项目的 wrangler 配置示例文件，包含数据库绑定、CORS 配置和管理令牌的示例说明，方便开发者快速部署配置。\n\n* chore: 调整配置文件管理与UI细节优化\n\n1.  更新gitignore，添加cred-hub.toml忽略并修正wrangler.toml跟踪\n2.  将cred-hub-cf的配置模板重命名为wrangler.toml.example并更新文档\n3.  移除package.json中cred-hub启动的CORS环境变量\n4.  调整凭证管理页面的刷新按钮位置到用户信息旁\n\n* refactor(cred-client): 迁移至 ofa.js + senti-ui 重构项目\n\n- 将原纯静态无框架代码重构为基于 ofa.js 的单页应用\n- 新增登录过的服务器本地保存与快速复用功能\n- 调整组件样式适配 Material Design 系统色\n- 更新文档说明项目结构与运行方式\n- 移除旧版单独的 CSS 和 JS 文件\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"770116074403b318dd898da48d1da2efaf2d306f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/770116074403b318dd898da48d1da2efaf2d306f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/f7d187b4e6af5dd301719646eb77cc65bd9a3b40","verification":{"payload":"tree 770116074403b318dd898da48d1da2efaf2d306f\nparent 6e86aaef1f067fb86b0f43c9699d36138cdc8b1c\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787847173 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787847173 +0800\n\nfeat: Add cred-hub server, UI components, and configuration updates (#30)\n\n* feat: Add cred-hub server, CF worker, pairing UI\n\n* feat(cred-manager+cred-hub): 添加上传大小限制与凭证中心选择组件\n\n1. 新增 cred-server-select 组件统一管理配对服务器选择与自定义存储\n2. 为 cred-hub 两个版本添加请求体大小上限拦截（默认2048字节），验签前拦截超限请求\n3. 重构 cred-manager 页面，移除重复的服务器选择逻辑，复用新组件\n4. 补充相关文档、测试用例与配置注释\n\n* chore: release cred-hub to 1.0.0, add config system and cred-client\n\n1. 升级cred-hub版本到1.0.0，新增TOML配置支持，替换原有环境变量方案\n2. 添加cred-hub浏览器端管理面板cred-client，纯静态无依赖\n3. 更新文档与gitignore，新增配置示例文件与相关依赖\n\n* docs(cred-hub): 重构配置说明与实现，适配CF wrangler同构格式\n\n更新了文档与代码，将配置改为与CF版wrangler.toml的[vars]段同构，调整了配置加载优先级与环境变量匹配逻辑，统一了配置项命名\n\n* chore(server/cred-hub-cf): add wrangler.toml example config file\n\n添加了 Cloudflare Worker 项目的 wrangler 配置示例文件，包含数据库绑定、CORS 配置和管理令牌的示例说明，方便开发者快速部署配置。\n\n* chore: 调整配置文件管理与UI细节优化\n\n1.  更新gitignore，添加cred-hub.toml忽略并修正wrangler.toml跟踪\n2.  将cred-hub-cf的配置模板重命名为wrangler.toml.example并更新文档\n3.  移除package.json中cred-hub启动的CORS环境变量\n4.  调整凭证管理页面的刷新按钮位置到用户信息旁\n\n* refactor(cred-client): 迁移至 ofa.js + senti-ui 重构项目\n\n- 将原纯静态无框架代码重构为基于 ofa.js 的单页应用\n- 新增登录过的服务器本地保存与快速复用功能\n- 调整组件样式适配 Material Design 系统色\n- 更新文档说明项目结构与运行方式\n- 移除旧版单独的 CSS 和 JS 文件\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkGIFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZHoQAE0gjmRwu0nLM11brG3brIer\nDLC0In9da2kCfXGFVJ+82KU