8ac35f46760c815495c8731174250","node_id":"C_kwDOSGntdtoAKDMwOWY1ZTI3MDU2OGFjMzVmNDY3NjBjODE1NDk1Yzg3MzExNzQyNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/Mazmot/commit/98e8cb2009619ae5a65366566857f560ce653b15","sha":"98e8cb2009619ae5a65366566857f560ce653b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/98e8cb2009619ae5a65366566857f560ce653b15"}],"sha":"309f5e270568ac35f46760c815495c8731174250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/309f5e270568ac35f46760c815495c8731174250"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/98e8cb2009619ae5a65366566857f560ce653b15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:13:42Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:13:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add bilingual internationalization support and fix app compatibility (#26)\n\n* feat(i18n): 为应用添加中英双语国际化支持\n\n1. 新增多语言组件与工具函数，支持模板与JS文案双语切换\n2. 为应用市场、添加应用、主页等页面全量替换静态文案为双语格式\n3. 新增设置弹窗，支持手动切换语言，语言跟随浏览器语言自动初始化\n4. 语言切换后重载页面以同步所有文案与属性提示\n\n* add icon\n\n* fix(app-runner,home): 兼容旧版NoneOS Core，修复应用列表加载和UI样式\n\n1. 为app-runner.js添加兼容逻辑，当DirHandle不支持flat()时手动遍历收集文件\n2. 修复home.html中添加应用和权限重试按钮缺少前缀图标\n3. 调整home页面的应用列表初始化逻辑，避免深拷贝破坏句柄原型\n\n* feat: 为多个应用添加多语言支持并更新版本号\n\n1. 为ai-manager和speed-dial更新版本号\n2. 为network、speed-dial、run-app添加页面标题本地化\n3. 为network应用的页面、speed-dial的多个页面添加中英语文案支持\n4. 更新CONTEXT.md文档补充多语言覆盖范围说明\n\n* refactor(official-apps): 实现多语言支持，调整应用元数据规范\n\n1. 将官方应用元数据的基准名称和描述改为英文，新增i18n字段支持中文覆盖\n2. 在官方应用加载逻辑中添加按当前语言解析元数据的功能\n3. 更新文档说明新的元数据格式和多语言回退规则\n\n* docs(manifest): 完善应用元数据多语言支持文档与实现\n\n1. 更新SKILL.md与CONTEXT.md，新增i18n字段说明与官方应用基准值要求\n2. 为ai-manager和speed-dial官方应用添加中文i18n覆盖\n3. 改造home.html的应用名称描述加载逻辑，支持多语言优先加载\n\n* docs: 完善模板系统的多语言支持文档与实现\n\n1. 更新SKILL.md和CONTEXT.md，补充模板元数据多语言规范\n2. 新增resolveLocalizedMeta函数实现按语言解析模板元数据\n3. 为所有内置模板添加i18n中文翻译字段，统一元数据基准为英文\n4. 重构loadTemplates调用多语言解析逻辑，替换硬编码的元数据读取\n\n* fix(rdn-network): 修正网络应用加载的相对路径为站内绝对路径\n\n1. 更新rdn-network组件的app加载路径为绝对路径\n2. 同步更新CONTEXT.md文档中的路径说明\n3. 优化设置弹窗的布局样式，修复高度适配和滚动溢出问题\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a601e9d6943328ef1d275a9f6ff5db6b5ac7a4dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/a601e9d6943328ef1d275a9f6ff5db6b5ac7a4dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/98e8cb2009619ae5a65366566857f560ce653b15","verification":{"payload":"tree a601e9d6943328ef1d275a9f6ff5db6b5ac7a4dd\nparent 5d8bd5c25de8b4b83853fc2a7a5fde2de6783890\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787505222 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787505222 +0800\n\nfeat: Add bilingual internationalization support and fix app compatibility (#26)\n\n* feat(i18n): 为应用添加中英双语国际化支持\n\n1. 新增多语言组件与工具函数，支持模板与JS文案双语切换\n2. 为应用市场、添加应用、主页等页面全量替换静态文案为双语格式\n3. 新增设置弹窗，支持手动切换语言，语言跟随浏览器语言自动初始化\n4. 语言切换后重载页面以同步所有文案与属性提示\n\n* add icon\n\n* fix(app-runner,home): 兼容旧版NoneOS Core，修复应用列表加载和UI样式\n\n1. 为app-runner.js添加兼容逻辑，当DirHandle不支持flat()时手动遍历收集文件\n2. 修复home.html中添加应用和权限重试按钮缺少前缀图标\n3. 调整home页面的应用列表初始化逻辑，避免深拷贝破坏句柄原型\n\n* feat: 为多个应用添加多语言支持并更新版本号\n\n1. 为ai-manager和speed-dial更新版本号\n2. 为network、speed-dial、run-app添加页面标题本地化\n3. 为network应用的页面、speed-dial的多个页面添加中英语文案支持\n4. 更新CONTEXT.md文档补充多语言覆盖范围说明\n\n* refactor(official-apps): 实现多语言支持，调整应用元数据规范\n\n1. 将官方应用元数据的基准名称和描述改为英文，新增i18n字段支持中文覆盖\n2. 在官方应用加载逻辑中添加按当前语言解析元数据的功能\n3. 更新文档说明新的元数据格式和多语言回退规则\n\n* docs(manifest): 完善应用元数据多语言支持文档与实现\n\n1. 更新SKILL.md与CONTEXT.md，新增i18n字段说明与官方应用基准值要求\n2. 为ai-manager和speed-dial官方应用添加中文i18n覆盖\n3. 改造home.html的应用名称描述加载逻辑，支持多语言优先加载\n\n* docs: 完善模板系统的多语言支持文档与实现\n\n1. 更新SKILL.md和CONTEXT.md，补充模板元数据多语言规范\n2. 新增resolveLocalizedMeta函数实现按语言解析模板元数据\n3. 为所有内置模板添加i18n中文翻译字段，统一元数据基准为英文\n4. 重构loadTemplates调用多语言解析逻辑，替换硬编码的元数据读取\n\n* fix(rdn-network): 修正网络应用加载的相对路径为站内绝对路径\n\n1. 更新rdn-network组件的app加载路径为绝对路径\n2. 同步更新CONTEXT.md文档中的路径说明\n3. 优化设置弹窗的布局样式，修复高度适配和滚动溢出问题\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiypGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp2oQAHdMbsOKO/NcrwHPq8zx9itK\nrRL7QHjtQHA195xs/H6EZDj53P/2IC3G3UHAty/5QGHjBskBTQPJyyOxfIHrjdeH\nkefsDNR9U90B2UWOZdh5obUyp+Tjq224/eMBzgCFdL4Wns0eS4nwgnrgXOnCQ0ef\nJIJUCF6WuTQ3h02FsLSM0kE5XoS/c0IQYNRi266k0YSl+01Zsj1BIhLI0H6nh8F7\nRVJ5073sqbeOXh0w1S8yR4f6hravYXGng7vDmgmszJ9t/pZsa+Tjy+n+WPSKuTR6\n/TMT23oH0/iWRkDKWOFUAzvT1wZVrtxUC2TyCazXxlSdnA+DgwTktjUQ9ehtnJan\n3g13vvMhPxvNgNWVKoPICUwKutk4mvRBvwA4GybscEJfB8YWUu2yqaC/tiT4/mzq\n9zg4ziU6c2FkzsoneDhA3fyLDklBeNBdWoWn1omVc5Z2k74mItxk4Pk85l1LDfmw\nZjwL4C15pEAQSR8r+/pTQSeynkQoxdOH94gGjaAxsMNcCB85B1qAdFX9UI8zX3Mx\nWn+O1OHluelmlQsWc1jslMAF01J5dVGteIUoPwk0wzq+QQKICCtJJAJYewppalP4\ncX0op8axRrabR2SCvoI0ClCT+IqduSgwyBL//0myZHswejt/e9dYet/rRzD/aFnl\n+jhnZ/99p1WdnpyQB7om\n=QvOx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T17:13:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com