github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/5d8bd5c25de8b4b83853fc2a7a5fde2de6783890/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:33:21Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:33:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Migrate to Senti-UI and update styles across components (#25)\n\n* docs: 替换全局样式引入为senti-ui启动脚本\n\n将多个demo和README文件中的旧pui全局样式链接，替换为senti-ui的启动脚本引入\n\n* chore: 修复多处引入路径中的仓库名错误\n\n将所有 `/gh/ofafs/senti-ui` 替换为 `/gh/ofajs/senti-ui`，同时将ai-chat的全局css引入替换为senti-ui启动脚本\n\n* refactor(cloud-drive): 替换硬编码颜色为主题色变量\n\n1. 替换原有的#34a853硬编码绿色为md-sys-color-success主题变量\n2. 移除旧的全局css依赖，改用senti-ui启动脚本\n\n* chore(smart-assistant): 迁移到 senti-ui 组件库并重构页面样式\n\n将原有的 punch-ui 组件替换为本地/指定源的 senti-ui 组件，更新所有组件引用和样式选择器，调整弹窗宽度和表单布局样式，优化标签结构。\n\n* remove useless code\n\n* refactor: 完成从Punch-UI到Senti-UI的迁移清理\n\n移除所有Punch-UI相关引用和注释，更新文档与注释内容，统一使用Senti-UI作为组件库\n\n* fix(speed-dial): 修复AI分组文字换行溢出问题并更新版本号\n\n1. 给AI分组按钮文字添加强制不换行样式，避免文字溢出\n2. 将版本号从1.6.0更新至1.6.1\n\n* fix(smart-assistant): 完善身份解析逻辑，支持在线调试模式\n\n新增本地安装模式和在线调试模式的身份解析处理，适配不同路径场景获取应用标识\n\n* Update CONTEXT.md\n\n* Update CONTEXT.md\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n* chore: 添加版本号提升脚本并更新版本到1.3.1\n\n新增bump脚本用于自动化管理版本号，支持patch/minor/major升级和直接指定版本，同时更新package.json和package-lock.json，本次将版本从1.3.0升级到1.3.1\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"965e78c8c6868c224bdd0e3cc811b4aff61e77ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/tree