tion documentation\n\nAdd three new reference documents:\n1. AI assistant module documentation covering DeepSeek/Kimi integration, API usage, key management, streaming and cancellation\n2. AI Agent/chain documentation for tool calling, dynamic tools, streaming and session memory\n3. P2P application communication documentation for peer-to-peer connection, message passing and sharing link implementation\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* refactor: 迁移项目UI组件库从Punch-UI到Senti-UI\n\n1. 替换全局样式引入为Senti-UI启动脚本，使用M3颜色体系\n2. 更新文档说明，统一Senti-UI资源加载规则\n3. 替换所有Punch-UI组件、工具函数为Senti-UI对应实现\n4. 调整组件API适配变更，更新toast/alert参数格式\n5. 新增.gitignore忽略Playwright缓存文件\n\n* refactor: 替换 punch-ui 为 senti-ui v1.0.7 并迁移到本地加载\n\n替换所有项目内的 punch-ui 样式与组件为 senti-ui，将组件源从远程CDN切换为本地gh路径，同时更新组件调用标签与相关工具函数导入路径，统一使用Material3颜色体系。\n\n* chore: 统一将项目内senti-ui依赖版本切换为latest\n\n更新了所有页面、组件引入的senti-ui静态资源版本标记，将固定的1.0.7/1.0.6版本替换为latest，同时同步更新了AGENTS.md和CONTEXT.md文档中的版本说明，确保文档与实际代码一致。\n\n* fix(run-app): 修复首屏加载时Senti-UI组件无法加载的问题\n\nrun-app作为首访入口页，加载时NoneOS Core SW尚未注册，本地/gh/前缀不可用，改用完整jsdelivr URL加载Senti-UI组件，并更新文档说明该例外规则\n\n* docs(speed-dial): 更新AGENTS.md，替换punch-ui为senti-ui\n\n更新了依赖说明、视觉规范，替换所有punch-ui相关内容为senti-ui的使用规则，包括资源加载路径、API调用方式与组件使用注意事项\n\n* Update index.html\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c7957feb844ebf09ce35b797fcfd47c2590da6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/2c7957feb844ebf09ce35b797fcfd47c2590da6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/1a4bf247df4c6d98b6ee989d89940ef531057303","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c7957feb844ebf09ce35b797fcfd47c2590da6c\nparent e0816027d75051c62ffd3c0da65885604445d709\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1787422454 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787422454 +0800\n\nfeat: Update documentation for AI, P2P communication, and Senti-UI migration (#23)\n\n* docs(mazmot-api): add complete AI and P2P communication documentation\n\nAdd three new reference documents:\n1. AI assistant module documentation covering DeepSeek/Kimi integration, API usage, key management, streaming and cancellation\n2. AI Agent/chain documentation for tool calling, dynamic tools, streaming and session memory\n3. P2P application communication documentation for peer-to-peer connection, message passing and sharing link implementation\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* refactor: 迁移项目UI组件库从Punch-UI到Senti-UI\n\n1. 替换全局样式引入为Senti-UI启动脚本，使用M3颜色体系\n2. 更新文档说明，统一Senti-UI资源加载规则\n3. 替换所有Punch-UI组件、工具函数为Senti-UI对应实现\n4. 调整组件API适配变更，更新toast/alert参数格式\n5. 新增.gitignore忽略Playwright缓存文件\n\n* refactor: 替换 punch-ui 为 senti-ui v1.0.7 并迁移到本地加载\n\n替换所有项目内的 punch-ui 样式与组件为 senti-ui，将组件源从远程CDN切换为本地gh路径，同时更新组件调用标签与相关工具函数导入路径，统一使用Material3颜色体系。\n\n* chore: 统一将项目内senti-ui依赖版本切换为latest\n\n更新了所有页面、组件引入的senti-ui静态资源版本标记，将固定的1.0.7/1.0.6版本替换为latest，同时同步更新了AGENTS.md和CONTEXT.md文档中的版本说明，确保文档与实际代码一致。\n\n* fix(run-app): 修复首屏加载时Senti-UI组件无法加载的问题\n\nrun-app作为首访入口页，加载时NoneOS Core SW尚未注册，本地/gh/前缀不可用，改用完整jsdelivr URL加载Senti-UI组件，并更新文档说明该例外规则\n\n* docs(speed-dial): 更新AGENTS.md，替换punch-ui为senti-ui\n\n更新了依赖说明、视觉规范，替换所有punch-ui相关内容为senti-ui的使用规则，包括资源加载路径、API调用方式与组件使用注意事项\n\n* Update index.html\n\n* Update AGENTS.md\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqieb2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh4QQACPrbGiI0s9O7+ECKEgD09A+\nY0kAsgXIKffh7dajZmefMZgs4I4DP5mq/w0IJuVcv1yxBV9ISlkA1RIQYc0ogMkq\nmqSJd9KQ/+LTWzrPE+7Dw2V8aqHt7rvUicPt7ZwiYrTq6RXKv2pJ2kpUbC6M5a7p\nOutJ40qqKQhHF9kQONDz2x+ZSrjtgn61expNResdnmXaAofX033bYueT1KpOyLfH\nAVxbGTX8D+QlOV+T2vB8UUdAeVZsgdS4I2F8WtjgC19J27Er4rsdXQ1yISu26nTY\n8l7VKXohOmcokQFbpwo9JVGwJ1vmTscAOWHWCOY9KLclwDNv4bTbvcTLGdMEpYWS\nvriQ3CXU1hiYZyFL6QBcgvK0Z5YWGpoyKIPpNu9jlgQBi1ItqdIfsp9AloH+sUw9\nmBTc1jNFPEtZkjJl/bhrRQZFM20wVeOYlCqcgFDK1xBmrkxRknPu0cpFbk4ChAyb\nhDdQ5WvF9NfPLR7OvjQjuz37OqVNsbv/Znzgxifis66XGle/mMyc