mot/commit/3903f1a5db08de01bde1d20e3223fc5f62f7a807","node_id":"C_kwDOSGntdtoAKDM5MDNmMWE1ZGIwOGRlMDFiZGUxZDIwZTMyMjNmYzVmNjJmN2E4MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray/Mazmot/commit/738c57ebcd2dd77408f89a9fe537f1797c87133d","sha":"738c57ebcd2dd77408f89a9fe537f1797c87133d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/738c57ebcd2dd77408f89a9fe537f1797c87133d"}],"sha":"3903f1a5db08de01bde1d20e3223fc5f62f7a807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/3903f1a5db08de01bde1d20e3223fc5f62f7a807"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5945154?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/738c57ebcd2dd77408f89a9fe537f1797c87133d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:39:29Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T15:39:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add official app sharing, installation support, and documentation updates (#19)\n\n* Update run-app.html\n\n* chore: release version 1.1.17\n\nadd official app sharing and installation support\n- add new official app share link format and related utils\n- update share URL parsing to support both P2P and official app modes\n- add auto share support for official apps in main home page\n- add official app installation flow in run-app\n- update AGENTS.md documentation for new sharing rules\n\n* refactor(share-link): 统一替换\"自动分享\"为\"分享\"\n\n更新了页面提示文案、配置文档和代码注释中的相关表述，将所有\"自动分享\"相关的文字统一修正为\"分享\"，保持术语一致性。\n\n* docs: add local handshake server setup steps for full local debug\n\n补全了中英文README中关于完整本地调试需要启动NoneOS Core握手服务器的说明步骤\n\n* refactor(cloud-drive,smart-assistant): 替换旧分享链接生成逻辑为官方HTTP渠道实现\n\n两个官方应用均移除了复杂的本地发布流程，改用统一的buildOfficialRunUrl生成同源分享链接，无需发布者在线即可被客户端通过官方渠道拉取安装，同时简化了代码逻辑并更新了文档说明。\n\n* feat(cloud-drive): add file list cache and optimistic session recovery\n\n实现了文件列表缓存功能，在页面刷新时使用缓存数据进行乐观恢复，后台自动重连后更新列表，提升页面切换和刷新的体验\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 调整空状态样式并修复列表刷新问题\n\n1. 重构空状态布局为弹性居中布局，优化垂直居中展示效果并调整内边距\n2. 在刷新文件列表前清空原有列表，避免旧数据残留\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 优化文件列表加载逻辑，修复切换目录时列表闪烁问题\n\n1.  初始加载空状态仅在loading且无文件列表时显示\n2.  切换目录时清空旧列表，自动重连同目录保留缓存列表避免闪烁\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 替换加载状态图标为eos-icons版本\n\n将原本的mdi:loading图标更换为eos-icons:loading图标，统一图标风格\n\n* Update package-lock.json\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbed6203aeb45e1ffde1db4a94d5d2550fdb40e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/dbed6203aeb45e1ffde1db4a94d5d2550fdb40e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/738c57ebcd2dd77408f89a9fe537f1797c87133d","verification":{"payload":"tree dbed6203aeb45e1ffde1db4a94d5d2550fdb40e6\nparent 3f0069ddd259dd850c3b27ed0366bfecdbc0d92a\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1786117169 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786117169 +0800\n\nfeat: Add official app sharing, installation support, and documentation updates (#19)\n\n* Update run-app.html\n\n* chore: release version 1.1.17\n\nadd official app sharing and installation support\n- add new official app share link format and related utils\n- update share URL parsing to support both P2P and official app modes\n- add auto share support for official apps in main home page\n- add official app installation flow in run-app\n- update AGENTS.md documentation for new sharing rules\n\n* refactor(share-link): 统一替换\"自动分享\"为\"分享\"\n\n更新了页面提示文案、配置文档和代码注释中的相关表述，将所有\"自动分享\"相关的文字统一修正为\"分享\"，保持术语一致性。\n\n* docs: add local handshake server setup steps for full local debug\n\n补全了中英文README中关于完整本地调试需要启动NoneOS Core握手服务器的说明步骤\n\n* refactor(cloud-drive,smart-assistant): 替换旧分享链接生成逻辑为官方HTTP渠道实现\n\n两个官方应用均移除了复杂的本地发布流程，改用统一的buildOfficialRunUrl生成同源分享链接，无需发布者在线即可被客户端通过官方渠道拉取安装，同时简化了代码逻辑并更新了文档说明。\n\n* feat(cloud-drive): add file list cache and optimistic session recovery\n\n实现了文件列表缓存功能，在页面刷新时使用缓存数据进行乐观恢复，后台自动重连后更新列表，提升页面切换和刷新的体验\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 调整空状态样式并修复列表刷新问题\n\n1. 重构空状态布局为弹性居中布局，优化垂直居中展示效果并调整内边距\n2. 在刷新文件列表前清空原有列表，避免旧数据残留\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 优化文件列表加载逻辑，修复切换目录时列表闪烁问题\n\n1.  初始加载空状态仅在loading且无文件列表时显示\n2.  切换目录时清空旧列表，自动重连同目录保留缓存列表避免闪烁\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 替换加载状态图标为eos-icons版本\n\n将原本的mdi:loading图标更换为eos-icons:loading图标，统一图标风格\n\n* Update package-lock.json\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdfwxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATOMQAFlIVlgHmHeh1GUIcj5DQEia\n0MnxRC3ivhlnp5Xwr9hv5XU+FaATZ4xoMbpqD11oyvoiRWB27Yh93AJLyGmx9LsB\nZCqFdmRhRo91hXkjMOqtb0ORHxFk+iYW6YaseB7oZjT6Su7aCU/tFWX6OZDT3eJ6\nwd9NKVHbNErI1rMJHn33zT5ABFPyRtx2jHTpE04TLa8tBVlaJmS1d16gvDOIemVu\nhOFmnBeOH4ZsRtTgh4Cjx+jqWo0+mYuT1vhEXY9iZfFG2quuNjPDlbjH3h4eYium\n+bqEonkCmDlfL6EOi+Dlq1NAAJwSWX5QB6RuqlOvpVAOb6SeJXRzwBblyf9+rRRq\nQBSwfoWDNUU/fR+2mJu5xSLXq/9vFrCyshat5joPPb6OCo6oYCQNVkiYKKDaKucs\n4CQMNXblWqygwgv7paufR9+8h8MbJUKtauFAfQeEvhLUTyURaHxUtDn6npVKelnH\nhZu1aujJDXGTfUPH9ujJoEVbq0c1zH4ppbd7GJHY54NFktZ1ptemmQJEiKvaTAOS\nYhjnDNJQHfZY2iWaly+QeFEUfVaAn68IJrKFB9k21fHTeHV3G7A3HP1zHMGeFS4F\nk+gkLDiLuRq+3