//api.github.com/users/kirakiray/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/ccdf5c5498bfce5c6777986c4ee8fd9d10000f97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:16:16Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T17:16:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add cloud-drive app (#17)\n\n* Update home.html\n\n* feat(official-apps): add new p2p cloud drive official app\n\nadd cloud-drive official app to manifest, create full app files including config, entry pages and implementation, update documentation to include the new app\n\n* Update server.html\n\n* Update server.html\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 修复客户端重连后消息发送到旧session和下载竞态问题\n\n1. 服务端侧包装sendToService，确保回复定向到当前会话，解决刷新重连后缓存旧session导致消息发送失败的问题\n2. 客户端侧优化二进制下载处理：\n   - 支持处理非Blob类型的二进制数据\n   - 新增预缓冲先于元数据到达的下载分块，解决网络竞态问题\n   - 拆分哈希校验逻辑为异步，不阻塞分块存储流程\n   - 新增连接清理逻辑，在组件卸载和重连时主动断开旧连接\n\n* backup\n\n* refactor(cloud-drive): 优化上传分块处理逻辑，支持多类型输入并修复竞态问题\n\n1. 重构unpackBinary函数，支持Blob、ArrayBuffer和TypedArray类型输入\n2. 新增自动组装逻辑，分块全部到达时自动触发文件组装，避免RTC竞态\n3. 拆分上传处理逻辑，提取_getRemoteCtx和_assembleUpload公共方法\n4. 调整upload_complete处理逻辑，处理分块先于完成请求到达的竞态场景\n5. 优化日志输出和错误提示信息\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 修正分片大小与连接冲突问题\n\n1. 将分片大小调整为240KB适配服务端中转上限\n2. 优化连接过程中的旧连接清理逻辑，避免断开事件干扰新连接\n3. 新增_connecting状态标记，在连接过程中忽略旧会话触发的断开事件\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 移除客户端页面多余的返回工具栏按钮\n\n删除了client.html中不必要的返回按钮代码，精简页面工具栏布局\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3035073a2774dd0fb38572644bceced2464b923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/a3035073a2774dd0fb38572644bceced2464b923"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/ccdf5c5498bfce5c6777986c4ee8fd9d10000f97","verification":{"payload":"tree a3035073a2774dd0fb38572644bceced2464b923\nparent 29287b354ef919327e1269317bbee06119289545\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1785777376 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785777376 +0800\n\nfeat: Add cloud-drive app (#17)\n\n* Update home.html\n\n* feat(official-apps): add new p2p cloud drive official app\n\nadd cloud-drive official app to manifest, create full app files including config, entry pages and implementation, update documentation to include the new app\n\n* Update server.html\n\n* Update server.html\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 修复客户端重连后消息发送到旧session和下载竞态问题\n\n1. 服务端侧包装sendToService，确保回复定向到当前会话，解决刷新重连后缓存旧session导致消息发送失败的问题\n2. 客户端侧优化二进制下载处理：\n   - 支持处理非Blob类型的二进制数据\n   - 新增预缓冲先于元数据到达的下载分块，解决网络竞态问题\n   - 拆分哈希校验逻辑为异步，不阻塞分块存储流程\n   - 新增连接清理逻辑，在组件卸载和重连时主动断开旧连接\n\n* backup\n\n* refactor(cloud-drive): 优化上传分块处理逻辑，支持多类型输入并修复竞态问题\n\n1. 重构unpackBinary函数，支持Blob、ArrayBuffer和TypedArray类型输入\n2. 新增自动组装逻辑，分块全部到达时自动触发文件组装，避免RTC竞态\n3. 拆分上传处理逻辑，提取_getRemoteCtx和_assembleUpload公共方法\n4. 调整upload_complete处理逻辑，处理分块先于完成请求到达的竞态场景\n5. 优化日志输出和错误提示信息\n\n* fix(cloud-drive): 修正分片大小与连接冲突问题\n\n1. 将分片大小调整为240KB适配服务端中转上限\n2. 优化连接过程中的旧连接清理逻辑，避免断开事件干扰新连接\n3. 新增_connecting状态标记，在连接过程中忽略旧会话触发的断开事件\n\n* style(cloud-drive): 移除客户端页面多余的返回工具栏按钮\n\n删除了client.html中不必要的返回按钮代码，精简页面工具栏布局\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>"