 for installed apps via payload hash\n\n1. add findByPayloadHash util and its tests\n2. store payloadHash and fileHash in app records during install\n3. implement pre-core fast jump to skip network installation for existing apps\n\n* feat: 实现自分享应用秒跳功能，完善fastJump逻辑\n\n1. 自动分享成功后持久化payloadHash到应用记录\n2. 重构run-app的快速跳转逻辑，拆分出resolveRunUrl方法\n3. 支持virtual和local类型应用的秒级跳转，适配开发者自分享场景\n4. 更新文档说明秒跳流程和自分享命中条件\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"36177e422bb54a2dc63d3ea4c0bfa7b92739b847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/36177e422bb54a2dc63d3ea4c0bfa7b92739b847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/72376a3a8062bfd319b1491ee38dae9e0b5953f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 36177e422bb54a2dc63d3ea4c0bfa7b92739b847\nparent 96e57ddc65c72872c2f6291163966cfdbcc7a31f\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1784644952 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784644952 +0800\n\nfeat: Optimize the application running process (#11)\n\n* feat(run-app): add fast jump for installed apps via payload hash\n\n1. add findByPayloadHash util and its tests\n2. store payloadHash and fileHash in app records during install\n3. implement pre-core fast jump to skip network installation for existing apps\n\n* feat: 实现自分享应用秒跳功能，完善fastJump逻辑\n\n1. 自动分享成功后持久化payloadHash到应用记录\n2. 重构run-app的快速跳转逻辑，拆分出resolveRunUrl方法\n3. 支持virtual和local类型应用的秒级跳转，适配开发者自分享场景\n4. 更新文档说明秒跳流程和自分享命中条件\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX4VYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8sQQAEDwGIP23Ic44G01UZ8Uq+96\nuOSTmvYd+SqFvZGPLhF47NVvn4NwOhBuXdkziV6DiDW2icfLc1eo9xeFumEk2BBV\nyu7Pc57MCJsuaGoo3pZvpWFt6Wya/YkoC/G6lSNHqNS7HoAlcqBo3ug2SJydGeJd\nEzeR9wOHS3s56dYhMKPnwjZpKpFRJmZ9bDSlgnotyVeHnZpqSCxN45OPeUQuu3UI\nXEdeaTp7RD/lQT3uHK6WoOCtF4SB7ryv5PUEG+eOwupnjFkuRzhbD+qd0Y+FtSpW\n0OR