com/users/kirakiray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/dd85cda3453c3e2b2a4430f3ba4bd30e629a4d22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:25:59Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T10:25:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Restructure the sharing process to automatic sharing (#8)\n\n* Update home.html\n\n* refactor(run-app): 抽离连接与安装流程逻辑，精简页面代码\n\n将原页面内的RTC等待、块重试、路径格式化等连接工具函数，以及应用安装、查找已安装应用的流程逻辑抽离到独立模块，删除页面内冗余的重复实现代码，提升代码可维护性与可测试性。\n\n* feat: add auto-share feature for apps, refactor share logic into share-mgr\n\n1. 抽离原home.html的分享逻辑到share-mgr.js的publishApp函数\n2. 新增应用自动分享开关，支持持久化配置\n3. 页面加载/刷新时自动发布已开启自动分享的应用\n4. 优化分享弹窗UI，新增二维码展示和进度回调\n5. 重构原有分享流程，统一代码逻辑\n\n* refactor(home): 移除独立分享按钮，重构自动分享UI逻辑\n\n1. 移除应用列表中独立的\"分享应用\"按钮，将分享入口整合到自动分享开关区域\n2. 调整分享弹窗UI，缩小弹窗宽度并简化展示内容\n3. 新增自动分享状态下的链接展示与复制、二维码查看按钮\n4. 移除不再使用的输入框组件与分享进度相关逻辑\n5. 精简share-mgr.js的导入依赖与handleShare函数\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"48509b8c5cc4f50bdbd7c1f670409cecf2895273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/trees/48509b8c5cc4f50bdbd7c1f670409cecf2895273"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/git/commits/dd85cda3453c3e2b2a4430f3ba4bd30e629a4d22","verification":{"payload":"tree 48509b8c5cc4f50bdbd7c1f670409cecf2895273\nparent ce289e5bb8f50237d3171a7c481e5abe02a3db68\nauthor Yao <kirayao@hotmail.com> 1784543159 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784543159 +0800\n\nfeat: Restructure the sharing process to automatic sharing (#8)\n\n* Update home.html\n\n* refactor(run-app): 抽离连接与安装流程逻辑，精简页面代码\n\n将原页面内的RTC等待、块重试、路径格式化等连接工具函数，以及应用安装、查找已安装应用的流程逻辑抽离到独立模块，删除页面内冗余的重复实现代码，提升代码可维护性与可测试性。\n\n* feat: add auto-share feature for apps, refactor share logic into share-mgr\n\n1. 抽离原home.html的分享逻辑到share-mgr.js的publishApp函数\n2. 新增应用自动分享开关，支持持久化配置\n3. 页面加载/刷新时自动发布已开启自动分享的应用\n4. 优化分享弹窗UI，新增二维码展示和进度回调\n5. 重构原有分享流程，统一代码逻辑\n\n* refactor(home): 移除独立分享按钮，重构自动分享UI逻辑\n\n1. 移除应用列表中独立的\"分享应用\"按钮，将分享入口整合到自动分享开关区域\n2. 调整分享弹窗UI，缩小弹窗宽度并简化展示内容\n3. 新增自动分享状态下的链接展示与复制、二维码查看按钮\n4. 移除不再使用的输入框组件与分享进度相关逻辑\n5. 精简share-mgr.js的导入依赖与handleShare函数\n\n* chore: bump version\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Yao <5945154+kirakiray@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXfe3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYRMQAIigYrUl5aDKagTR97ZOGTLC\nK9L985MW6VXEroeR9Y4XMQI3bF90ERedg7Iv3C1UcJkP+LTUF4mp0aH1siVd9QB8\n/hVJcbij0LgikOE66Nli3f1GLXK88BdPjSzmrNyOp/DHuwh1yEmtxfNb5FkxPuKD\ngMKhgAP56pVPVqpWYAVk99mhPhLP7fWxx9q7ng/dLo6hp+CoxF56Z/gNOmjOUCIW\nec9nfPw/QLL5t+ShnAzt29K8ZsD1Re176rWWL4GTk/sx5b+k/aIt2hOb6HuB3oLK\nbSao8DtFY7cvk1+TXWcSAF862LxCDr6ZPbFYsRbU8GnJ945agsyc3hiQ6wHx7hwr\ngc2SNDENrNWToxXAVloAhRQZdD9vH6Bu+3A4NG9D7cRbEwLegElq0b06S1MDX/2O\nh0pkCt1Gd4C850R55TGrzAPsIifxjc4kCwX3JkJWTzihXn2p72NXktqvuhEQwuZB\nMYvgUEd3v/5rj5SiLSykbvZ24iApdZ16XYuEWNqkHLco30ynGHyH+Zngg2uh0Xl/\nv9MQGQTjDLt/tDGoPq7AEVRMR+mJljPfDNthwCEK007gXmzVBIiwS69ht6fs2tzN\n4/i8bknnA9mP91Ic3vZpu+0UHYITBzx1P6WVm6rCFfGLWjycf3+3LDiKycWhwo8T\n5oQFN43E0bw6t56UvNZx\n=/oDP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T10:26:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi