tml_url":"https://github.com/kirakiray","id":5945154,"login":"kirakiray","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDUxNTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kirakiray","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kirakiray/Mazmot/commits/bee3e7cbbb0c164b9852fd16315f061419fa4565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T16:00:00Z","email":"kirayao@hotmail.com","name":"Yao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T16:00:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Redesign the application homepage (#2)\n\n* backup\n\n* refactor(run-js): 改用web worker执行js代码提升安全性\n\n* feat(emulator-inspect): 新增模拟器调试能力及测试用例\n\n* backup\n\n* Update test-module.md\n\n* refactor(emulator): 重构iframe加载逻辑，移除冗余封装\n\n* Update capabilities.json\n\n* refactor(capabilities): 调整模拟器导航相关代码结构并补充测试用例\n\n* fix(test-capability, emulator-navigate): 修复模拟器导航测试相关问题\n\n* style(test-capability): 添加iframe插槽样式适配\n\n* fix(emulator-navigate): 返回实际iframe加载的url而非传入的url\n\n* fix(test-capability): 完善测试断言逻辑\n\n* backup\n\n* Update float-container.html\n\n* style: 添加拖拽遮罩层并完善拖拽状态逻辑\n\n* refactor(test-capability): 替换测试页面为cv.html并删除旧测试页\n\n* docs(test-capability): add documentation for page interaction capability testing\n\n* docs(test-capability): 重构测试用例编写文档\n\n* Update test-module.md\n\n* feat(emulator-navigate): add test file and register test entry\n\n* docs(test-capability): 替换旧的测试模块文档为最新版指南\n\n* feat(capabilities): add test badge display for capability items\n\n* Update capabilities.json\n\n* feat(resources/capabilities): add ability to run capability tests inline\n\n* fix(capabilities