essandroMartini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlessandroMartini","id":11137129,"login":"AlessandroMartini","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTM3MTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/2bb8bf6ed4afa44751029bd3da285d920776ba6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:15Z","email":"alessandromartini@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Martini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: harden installer security — IPv6 loopback, script review, temp dir (#575)\n\nThree security improvements addressing audit findings:\n\n1. IPv6 loopback + env hardening (.env.example)\n   - Add ::1 to MC_ALLOWED_HOSTS\n   - Comment out MC_ALLOW_ANY_HOST (undefined is safest default)\n\n2. Downloaded installer script security review (src/lib/agent-runtimes.ts)\n   - mkdtemp() for unpredictable temp dirs — eliminates TOCTOU\n   - Regex scan with scanForInjection() (shell context)\n   - Optional AI review via Claude API (graceful skip without ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)\n   - Blocks install if review flags critical issues\n   - Cleans up temp dir on success or failure\n\n3. Eliminate bash -c string concatenation in Hermes install\n   - Use runCommand(''bash'', [scriptPath, ''--skip-setup'']) array form\n   - Separate sed invocation for /dev/tty patch","tree":