eneric \"gateway\"\nterminology while keeping legitimate OpenClaw product references intact.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz7IYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtXYQAIFkVnQar8zhBnYaUnJuZD2q\n1xJGu/d3/eTJEHlQ2O8Drh6m0HQaVGVBSSeQlGz1gzhiJOW2eNh0KRNwbSTJ+6U9\neUaDLeqbGDiaKDrm13PUvDPoMj0JmYfAsbI6iOHmjDXIASV+2IWmjysizg3h1BNL\ndhc4MtucYA9kMr/IZZD4SrMomBnT75LN8huT1eQi226WqjJIKQnwQYGdGXaUFuHA\nM0Dg+QeavYA6QqUV2pwOBzejOqRv1A7oA1VXq26WaI8p58XTtIyec4dNB3pMihwJ\njoeDDT9x2JYuM1UKzupPSO0/wypZCmsmI4VekbiwR6EIGhsN1930KO33BJ/Ems+D\nWGRjXAwT7hCVHCECiOzE4Uoec9fTK7AHNs54uSzelm4+t5EE4n8Xzfl81IZ7cEEC\nSd64H1kKF/7rOaBUpf/Vb/BZ5KLMnAc3BRKIAgvgFBCIbdWByGJFhIjztwYeB9pK\nxtMzrPc+Ovun1c41eDRXnVS9yJLT7Slk+Y2VN2RdZiwtgLRK4cbRGU/mLSXi9aCq\ncstSqCtpSnfJ0HKyI1iCschABXVBOPYpbh6jrSuraBRkhgRnxR5I4gm3ZeLiQHX3\nG9DVDXfWynY0aObL/v67hqsV5xn4k13Ey5W6kTHmUXIZ8mH6/EcmB98SAzkcYxZn\nkhKCyKD51gD0QYnkY8i9\n=4+/5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T08:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OG-Capital/mission-control/commit/a0a4d60451d42df5460c9cb4b031f91b5d9cab4e","node_id":"C_kwDOSGpFnNoAKGEwYTRkNjA0NTFkNDJkZjU0NjBjOWNiNGIwMzFmOTFiNWQ5Y2FiNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OG-Capital/mission-control/commit/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","sha":"3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d"}],"sha":"a0a4d60451d42df5460c9cb4b031f91b5d9cab4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/a0a4d60451d42df5460c9cb4b031f91b5d9cab4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:45:48Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:45:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add runtime_type to agents + Hermes multi-agent profile provisioning (#550)\n\nSupport creating agents with an explicit runtime type (hermes, openclaw,\nclaude, codex, custom). When creating a Hermes agent, automatically\nprovisions a profile directory at ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ with\nconfig.yaml and SOUL.md — ready for Hermes multi-profile support.\n\n- DB migration 049: add runtime_type column to agents table\n- Validation: add runtime_type enum to createAgentSchema\n- Agent creation UI: runtime type dropdown (Auto-detect, Hermes, OpenClaw,\n  Claude Code, Codex CLI, Custom)\n- Agent card: shows runtime type badge\n- POST /api/agents: provisions ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ for hermes type\n- i18n keys for runtime type labels (10 locales)","tree":{"sha":"cdefa0f44cb4f1a5bb87b4169c5a168c2e8f8f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/trees/cdefa0f44cb4f1a5bb87b4169c5a168c2e8f8f3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","verification":{"payload":"tree cdefa0f44cb4f1a5bb87b4169c5a168c2e8f8f3d\nparent d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775213148 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775213148 +0700\n\nfeat: add runtime_type to agents + Hermes multi-agent profile provisioning (#550)\n\nSupport creating agents with an explicit runtime type (hermes, openclaw,\nclaude, codex, custom). When creating a Hermes agent, automatically\nprovisions a profile directory at ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ with\nconfig.yaml and SOUL.md — ready for Hermes multi-profile support.\n\n- DB migration 049: add runtime_type column to agents table\n- Validation: add runtime_type enum to createAgentSchema\n- Agent creation UI: runtime type dropdown (Auto-detect, Hermes, OpenClaw,\n  Claude Code, Codex CLI, Custom)\n- Agent card: shows runtime type badge\n- POST /api/agents: provisions ~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/ for hermes type\n- i18n keys for runtime type labels (10 locales)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz5pcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAA