on-control/commit/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","sha":"d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52"}],"sha":"3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/3bd1eb7606a8094a4e6e1721fe0181b76d14ea8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:35:44Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:35:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Hermes integration gaps + stale Claude Code task detection (#549)\n\n* fix(hermes): add missing /api/hermes/events endpoint + improve cron history\n\n- Create POST /api/hermes/events to receive hook events (session:start,\n  agent:start, agent:end). The hook was silently failing because this\n  endpoint didn''t exist.\n- Events logged to activity table and broadcast to SSE clients\n- Agent status updated on agent:start/agent:end events\n- Add session.updated event type to event bus\n- Add runCount to HermesCronJob (counts all execution output files)\n\n* fix(claude-tasks): detect stale in_progress tasks from dead sessions\n\nClaude Code team tasks written to ~/.claude/tasks/ often get stuck as\nin_progress when sessions crash or end without cleanup. Detect stale\ntasks by checking file mtime — if not modified in 60+ minutes while\nstill in_progress, mark as stale. UI shows these dimmed with \"stale\"\nlabel instead of the misleading \"in_progress\" badge.","tree":{"sha":"a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/trees/a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","verification":{"payload":"tree a7510fe2172895fb2ba58cc02195c556229f41f6\nparent 6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775212544 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775212544 +0700\n\nfix: Hermes integration gaps + stale Claude Code task detection (#549)\n\n* fix(hermes): add missing /api/hermes/events endpoint + improve cron history\n\n- Create POST /api/hermes/events to receive hook events (session:start,\n  agent:start, agent:end). The hook was silently failing because this\n  endpoint didn''t exist.\n- Events logged to activity table and broadcast to SSE clients\n- Agent status updated on agent:start/agent:end events\n- Add session.updated event type to event bus\n- Add runCount to HermesCronJob (counts all execution output files)\n\n* fix(claude-tasks): detect stale in_progress tasks from dead sessions\n\nClaude Code team tasks written to ~/.claude/tasks/ often get stuck as\nin_progress when sessions crash or end without cleanup. Detect stale\ntasks by checking file mtime — if not modified in 60+ minutes while\nstill in_progress, mark as stale. UI shows these dimmed with \"stale\"\nlabel instead of the misleading \"in_progress\" badge.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz5gACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHE4QADyA7HtNoZb/AKYd3NkXUfjd\nfilBPlmbFa402Uh1vxYSEoWtpwE9otnh/2fOQDeehx5H7EbV4Kj4DCJurvcTGDj6\nLPNErTL9q14WFezzERcc/WbVpuHPObLiEBzQTc8YcPV9cMMJbkukN/CYNjGxEo6y\n2i1IGKte2jE99H2vf6qQH8bXj7oE+gpYnNdSWItHaoFLvj+Sx+JiKrOKrG6H3qG6\nRoN+IoZXX3O1f759xhfE1dpwZoA1cGbabbrJUaf8SjUljiJlquFwhuT5fkIeX+ar\nMoW9i8sJEQGvOvlNPAEOkgv43bAgvmn00ZSb0Ir3kShKm9E3vTpyUuHnlKI0U3Sj\nblnVjWIJCm7n+3nDlm/wuzN9ewvx8EfclWVUSoCHVBjgYyaCytj19by3r4YthD7u\nz1VnmSTTiGvV83Tfvf85fuFjBaaEPmgv/eOjndViVzvbadfNT7+C4TtD/W3teFOC\n4iukprGC2JGLzh12mr4NHZf0m68N9QODoU0nxiQfySx5wdh/BZ1yB9PnOoKkn2OQ\ndiKRWOXAwCmwtufghuHRHEzJwY37VWhC+w9AlRDvnElKTKtFkRSieC9T6AkgPrNn\n/cyQ1UXpgxdP333Txm8WcIX69SQfmNVFFBHCQYiJisoab12N+Qwb3Ko6GoDjxDFm\nQMc6XGpd9OedF+r4OoOa\n=fWnT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T08:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/OG-Capital/mission-control/commit/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","node_id":"C_kwDOSGpFnNoAKGQ1MDYyODc5OTExZDY2ODg2Yzg1OTAxY2M5ZDI3YzA3Y2RiYWNjNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/OG-Capital/mission-control/commit/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","sha":"6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483"}],"sha":"d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/d5062879911d66886c85901cc9d27c07cdbacc52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:06:20Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T10:06:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: overhaul task system — outbound sync, escalation, failed column, MCP filtering (#548)\n\nFixes all critical and medium priority issues from task system audit:\n\nOutbound sync (H1/H2):\n- Create syncTaskOutbound() shared helper in github-sync-engine.ts\n- Wire into bulk PUT (drag-and-drop), replacing per-endpoint inline sync\n- Wire into task-dispatch.ts at all 5 status transition points\n- GNAP sync now updates on status changes (was create-only)\n\nEscalation (H3):\n- Add task.escalated event type to event bus\n- Broadcast escalation when tasks fail after max retries (dispatch, Aegis, stale)\n- Webhook subscribers auto-receive escalation events\n\nFailed + awaiting_owner as formal statuses (H4):\n- Add to validation schemas, github-label-map, gnap-sync, all Task types\n- New \"Failed\" column on task board with error display and retry button\n- Retry resets dispatch_attempts and moves task back to assigned\n\nMCP server filtering (M2):\n- mc_list_tasks now accepts: status, assigned_to, priority, search, limit\n- Backward compatible — no params returns all tasks\n\nModel classification (M3):\n- Add size heuristics: description >2000 chars or estimated_hours >=4 → opus\n\nTests updated for new status counts and enums.","tree":{"sha":"50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/trees/50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/commits/6d89924fcd9fff2e6ce1f421e900aa68f0105483","verification":{"payload":"tree 50480394912feae52a1444d16d2753e77bdd4ae6\nparent e8023d3733133bee31410f1c6684b469368d776f\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1775210780 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775210780 +0700\n\nfix: overhaul task system — outbound sync, escalation, failed column, MCP filtering (#548)\n\nFixes all critical and medium priority issues from task system audit:\n\nOutbound sync (H1/H2):\n- Create syncTaskOutbound() shared helper in github-sync-engine.ts\n- Wire into bulk PUT (drag-and-drop), replacing per-endpoint inline sync\n- Wire into task-dispatch.ts at all 5 status transition points\n- GNAP sync now updates on status changes (was create-only)\n\nEscalation (H3):\n- Add task.escalated event type to event bus\n- Broadcast escalation when tasks fail after max retries (dispatch, Aegis, stale)\n- Webhook subscribers auto-receive escalation events\n\nFailed + awaiting_owner as formal statuses (H4):\n- Add to validation schemas, github-label-map, gnap-sync, all Task types\n- New \"Failed\" column on task board with error display and retry button\n- Retry resets dispatch_attempts and moves task back to assigned\n\nMCP server filtering (M2):\n- mc_list_tasks now accepts: status, assigned_to, priority, search, limit\n- Backward compatible — no params returns all tasks\n\nModel classification (M3):\n- Add size heuristics: description >2000 chars or estimated_hours >=4 → opus\n\nTests updated for new status counts and enums.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpz5EcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3FEQAIIJx2W2o+pCS/VTA8H4zfbb\nDkJh1dyawDxw8CqDsoKe2NflLBbTj2odHl5JXX+4ceU9qZSiYYtA5oYx75GsFFNC\nW6LKyZRxhbBczm7u/1NHhHfXcoog+FDAhjzftDtsrwngpR0GC9uN0EB4P7GrDLb0\nz4Mphqp6hRyN/cN1VlKmyl3Hz9p9RQKk7DcL+YOJc8h4L7408GwjQWBQMbCnM/0S\nJ5mMSslKEt8LIRuZrLXVxNj3B40xcpcYxt9LEc55ft6QwIvTWC1F2O0TmNrOu82V\num1tk/O5QzTDby9wGsi/CwIBCwD1255+o2utQ+tzQ08fR9TDuWQ9LcgolW3kBCug\n/RGIynvEoL0VgOhvFX5b9QMOSLrxafnGyFneRu8cQCBtpevjviR2Yww5GA0hA3Av\nRkUZOSJwkZX2L+e674gQ6JRqXc1bKWuKfTRvW5wBeQTGbSVcsslg1p0O2SIFsqLj\nR4rP2OZH0VTYDXawo7FM+4C3ZqNrZ1XL9seJ4iwAaHxltCV27foX9ODTxnnChBwM\nB0B6lfKuFNEM+BPlI+Lwo2IW8f/sOTwRRnHl0e6LBDftgd3RsILUM8qJvJWWD72O\nkySsfi5lqnxR5jLvYfQY0wmOSMDzDEUpVWpAT75LWJnCOuL0PdV91khoBP3jwxeH\nemUZMc7vpNqduG2Ht3AU\n=Dd/d\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T08:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: