13db4a84463649b671dafee53dc52f91d6"}],"sha":"3bd462c1cbea9992eb5fabebe4e729a78a228a2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/3bd462c1cbea9992eb5fabebe4e729a78a228a2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4118421?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shipu","id":4118421,"login":"Shipu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMTg0MjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shipu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/581fbf13db4a84463649b671dafee53dc52f91d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T02:15:35Z","email":"shipuahamed01@gmail.com","name":"Shipu Ahamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T02:15:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve OPENCLAW_HOME double-nesting and standalone server data loss on rebuild (#508)\n\n* fix: pass OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR explicitly in runOpenClaw to prevent double-nesting\n\nWhen OPENCLAW_HOME is set to the state directory directly (e.g. /root/.openclaw),\nthe OpenClaw CLI interprets it as a parent home directory and appends ''.openclaw'',\nresulting in a double-nested path like /root/.openclaw/.openclaw/credentials.\n\nFix: always inject OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR into the child process environment in\nrunOpenClaw() so the CLI uses the exact resolved path rather than deriving it\nfrom OPENCLAW_HOME.\n\nFixes: ''OAuth dir not present ($OPENCLAW_HOME/.openclaw/credentials)'' warning\nshown in Mission Control when OPENCLAW_HOME=/root/.openclaw is configured.\n\n* docs: clarify OPENCLAW_HOME vs OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR and data persistence\n\n- Add OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR and MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH to env tables in\n  README.md and docs/deployment.md\n- Document the OPENCLAW_HOME double-nesting bug and recommended workaround\n- Add configuration note explaining that MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH /\n  MISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR should use absolute paths when running the\n  Next.js standalone server to survive rebuilds\n\n* docs: simplify data config — MISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR is sufficient\n\nMISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH defaults to DATA_DIR/mission-control.db, so\nsetting DATA_DIR alone is enough for most deployments. Only use\nMISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH if the DB needs to live in a separate location.\n\nAlso removed it from the recommended .env example.\n\n* docs: remove MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH from all docs and examples\n\nMISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR is sufficient for all standard deployments.\nThe DB path is automatically derived as DATA_DIR/mission-control.db.\n\nRemoved MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH from:\n- README.md\n- docs/deployment.md\n- .env.example\n- SKILL.md\n- CLAUDE.md\n\nThe env var still works in code as an escape hatch for advanced use cases\n(e.g. DB on a separate volume), but it should not be documented as a\nrequired or recommended setting.","tree":{"sha":"bae668a4335085e23d1d7d63ee13c3154b9ca242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/trees/bae668a4335085e23d1d7d63ee13c3154b9ca242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/commits/581fbf13db4a84463649b671dafee53dc52f91d6","verification":{"payload":"tree bae668a4335085e23d1d7d63ee13c3154b9ca242\nparent 30ecc3d2a9b6733e4a99f185f5627d14c9b31bba\nauthor Shipu Ahamed <shipuahamed01@gmail.com> 1774923335 +0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774923335 +0700\n\nfix: resolve OPENCLAW_HOME double-nesting and standalone server data loss on rebuild (#508)\n\n* fix: pass OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR explicitly in runOpenClaw to prevent double-nesting\n\nWhen OPENCLAW_HOME is set to the state directory directly (e.g. /root/.openclaw),\nthe OpenClaw CLI interprets it as a parent home directory and appends ''.openclaw'',\nresulting in a double-nested path like /root/.openclaw/.openclaw/credentials.\n\nFix: always inject OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR into the child process environment in\nrunOpenClaw() so the CLI uses the exact resolved path rather than deriving it\nfrom OPENCLAW_HOME.\n\nFixes: ''OAuth dir not present ($OPENCLAW_HOME/.openclaw/credentials)'' warning\nshown in Mission Control when OPENCLAW_HOME=/root/.openclaw is configured.\n\n* docs: clarify OPENCLAW_HOME vs OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR and data persistence\n\n- Add OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR and MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH to env tables in\n  README.md and docs/deployment.md\n- Document the OPENCLAW_HOME double-nesting bug and recommended workaround\n- Add configuration note explaining that MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH /\n  MISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR should use absolute paths when running the\n  Next.js standalone server to survive rebuilds\n\n* docs: simplify data config — MISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR is sufficient\n\nMISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH defaults to DATA_DIR/mission-control.db, so\nsetting DATA_DIR alone is enough for most deployments. Only use\nMISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH if the DB needs to live in a separate location.\n\nAlso removed it from the recommended .env example.\n\n* docs: remove MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH from all docs and examples\n\nMISSION_CONTROL_DATA_DIR is sufficient for all standard deployments.\nThe DB path is automatically derived as DATA_DIR/mission-control.db.\n\nRemoved MISSION_CONTROL_DB_PATH from:\n- README.md\n- docs/deployment.md\n- .env.example\n- SKILL.md\n- CLAUDE.md\n\nThe env var still works in code as an escape hatch for advanced use cases\n(e.g. DB on a separate volume), but it should not be documented as a\nrequired or recommended setting.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpyy5HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYK0QAGzPhXG9vheHe9UmZQo75o0Z\nDrVuR7DYPBQfHFchHjzRfMTyTq5LhDkGeZ5ny2cvaxfOYVo5Pcv631Ic1klRXH9l\nHBjyXbBHGkjvP1t+A/xbHgSRWW1PxN/8b0qep8Xa3VVs2jW1LaG5y+j4h3HtCcMO\nCE9dXPTH4cf+F+u6uS4q2mPcZY2qWURwoQvY6776dseldtBbH+ddmSrJUOLplAnl\n1yXfeHDabGiIuzxkpz495XPnq6ARSFR2ibcdVNSAt9OjInHHOIlYZV2oTj5UEzB1\n0uTrb1nC+owhsxPrL1ZXnFDIOsFzgRVi5BcUsBQSE/aAqZJSwzGfln/prXkZTpYK\nVwnJ846IYVJwlDMxwDWo7Glh+AChIWmob+A47R3NAWgPiPGHpfEDU7V2PyFZziN6\n2egJcbU64G7YUUNHE5Xa7A9HqTRNT9yV3sv3jJykQX8ZMepkpJfT+mcf1BJsg4DT\n87hBJS0LgJMphdMFw7vJWCEoNf3Ufmcruyjl6Js2mBhdwJtnHjk9uRCJjX2lCA0p\no13uOOD2OD2Ge14J8tVcIh2Siz1I1iLdcX/XFujdkVlUKqTMpgyUyKPbomrLj/Sx\nrJrbVlmKh4bx/zSApOQd0fkImoprFl3fZ0/6oO4Uu/pC7tWujnuf6bMEalSYHnRL\nqCbo0o5qja03H1mE+a0q\n=sQHk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T08:31:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com