rol/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/commits/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:25:07Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:25:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions (#472)\n\n* fix: add inline token editor to gateway card (#459)\n\nThe gateway card showed token status as read-only (set/none) with no\nway to update it. Users with a registered gateway but missing token\nhad to delete and re-add the gateway.\n\nAdd [edit] link next to the token indicator that expands an inline\npassword input. Supports Enter to save, Escape to cancel. Calls\nPUT /api/gateways with the token field (already supported by API).\n\n* feat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions\n\n- [n]ew now prompts: title → description → priority → assign agent\n  (Enter skips optional steps)\n- [a]ssign key to assign selected task to an agent (shows available\n  agent names)\n- [p]riority key to change task priority (low/medium/high/critical)\n- Updated help bar and usage text with new keybindings\n\n* feat(tui): task detail view, activity feed, comments, priority column\n\n- Enter on a task opens full detail view showing: status, priority,\n  assignment, description, resolution, quality reviews, and comments\n- Task detail supports [s]tatus, [a]ssign, [p]riority, [c]omment,\n  [r]efresh actions\n- Activity feed below task list shows recent task/agent events with\n  timestamps and icons\n- Priority column added to task list with color coding\n- [e]dit key for title editing (moved from Enter)","tree":{"sha":"f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/trees/f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OG-Capital/mission-control/git/commits/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6","verification":{"payload":"tree f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9\nparent 5bc5737d5611a2dcb0e441d561f359e9a6b18b5b\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774175107 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774175107 +0700\n\nfeat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions (#472)\n\n* fix: add inline token editor to gateway card (#459)\n\nThe gateway card showed token status as read-only (set/none) with no\nway to update it. Users with a registered gateway but missing token\nhad to delete and re-add the gateway.\n\nAdd [edit] link next to the token indicator that expands an inline\npassword input. Supports Enter to save, Escape to cancel. Calls\nPUT /api/gateways with the token field (already supported by API).\n\n* feat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions\n\n- [n]ew now prompts: title → description → priority → assign agent\n  (Enter skips optional steps)\n- [a]ssign key to assign selected task to an agent (shows available\