 the part that needs reading.\n\nA column list an agent has to remember is a column list an agent can\nparaphrase away, so the schema is executable rather than prose. Standard\nlibrary only for the census, because the delivery host has python3 and\nlittle else guaranteed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed76116b634881a72916b72a546b6314e05a4e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/ed76116b634881a72916b72a546b6314e05a4e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/696bf5ee8f0f0a9eb985d2786d5b6628d479fffa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/696bf5ee8f0f0a9eb985d2786d5b6628d479fffa","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKDY5NmJmNWVlOGYwZjBhOWViOTg1ZDI3ODZkNWI2NjI4ZDQ3OWZmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/490579b749cbff94dcc1e4eab0a