"email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"Answer Q1 and Q5 of the twin plan, and record why\n\nQ1 (a): the twin tree lives in this repository, one extension per plugin.\nOne CI run against the existing required checks, a freshness check that is\na local git log rather than a cross-repository call needing a token, and\nclient material that never leaves the repository already governing it.\nQ5 (a): that client material mirrors into the monorepo twin only, never\ninto a separately publishable extension.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"304475f8c8de934fb5041e791f834c84d00eb3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/304475f8c8de934fb5041e791f834c84d00eb3a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/ee9b471a1f6d723e512c9612ee741ae2ca6b8835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/ee9b471a1f6d723e512c9612ee741ae2ca6b8835","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGVlOWI0NzFhMWY2ZDcyM2U1MTJjOTYxMmVlNzQxYWUyY2E2Yjg4MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7","sha":"bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7"}],"sha":"ee9b471a1f6d723e512c9612ee741ae2ca6b8835","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/ee9b471a1f6d723e512c9612ee741ae2ca6b8835"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:00:48Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T22:00:48Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"Enforce LF, because the delivery host is Windows Git Bash\n\ncore.autocrlf is true in the system gitconfig on the target VDI, and\ngemini extensions install clones on its own without passing through the\nuser''s flags. Without this file the shell scripts in this repository\narrive with CRLF terminators and fail with an error that talks about a\nmissing file rather than about line endings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d2dc4ad8cdaacf49b7baab3943b3e00e2807475","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/3d2dc4ad8cdaacf49b7baab3943b3e00e2807475"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/bc19d28986d86cfd866d439a48fc8064113cb2c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGJjMTlkMjg5ODZkODZjZmQ4NjZkNDM5YTQ4ZmM4MDY0MTEzY2IyYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/c