se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/9d33068aa8c600df01d42bfd2312d1b5e157bddb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T04:19:51Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"Luke The Rose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T04:19:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(refactor): per-iteration BootSmokeTest gate + body-length enforcement (warn ≥10k / error ≥12k) (#42)\n\n* docs(refactoring): close shell+nav+405+CORS gaps surfaced by InfoSync retro\n\nAnchored to the InfoSync 2026-05 retrospective\n(INFOSYNC-REFACTORING-AGENT-GAP-REPORT.md, new top-level file): the\npipeline declared green (177/177 + 200/200 + 204/204) while the FE was\nunusable. Patches close every gap-class at the layer that should have\ncaught it.\n\nFrontend scaffolder (agents + reference docs):\n- app-shell.md: mandate full overwrite of app.component.html; provide\n  the canonical `<app-layout><router-outlet/></app-layout>` template;\n  document the placeholder-string self-check.\n- code-skeletons.md: add `core/layout` section with sidenav-per-BC\n  pattern, conditional shell, permission-gated entries, trackBy.\n- frontend-scaffolder.md: add Step 10 self-check (6 greps the agent\n  MUST run before reporting status: ok — no CLI placeholders survive,\n  app-layout referenced, layout exists with routerLinks, interceptors\n  file(s) emitted, no per-service Authorization header).\n\nBackend scaffolder (agents + reference docs):\n- error-and-security.md: add explicit overrides for\n  handleHttpRequestMethodNotSupported (405),\n  handleHttpMediaTypeNotSupported (415),\n  handleHttpMediaTypeNotAcceptable (406). Document that without these\n  overrides the framework exceptions fall through to the generic\n  Exception handler and the FE sees HTTP 500. CORS:\n  setAllowedOriginPatterns with localhost+127.0.0.1 default.\n- backend-scaffolder.md: forbid @CrossOrigin on controllers; the\n  CorsConfigurationSource bean is the single source of truth.\n\nChallengers (always-on adversarial reviewers):\n- phase4-challenger.md: add Check 10 (navigation reachability) — no\n  CLI placeholder, layout shell exists, every protected route in\n  app.routes.ts is reachable via routerLink/router.navigate in the UI\n  tree; orphan route generates one FINDING-NAV-ORPHAN-ROUTE-* per\n  route. Update description and \"Method — N checks\" wording.\n- tobe-testing-challenger.md: add Check 9 (shell coverage) — smoke\n  spec MUST exist, cover ≥ 80% of protected routes, assert placeholder\n  strings are gone, run against a real backend.\n\nFrontend test writer:\n- frontend-test-writer.md: declare `smoke.spec.ts` as a MANDATORY spec\n  independent of user flows. It iterates app.routes.ts, asserts no CLI\n  placeholder, asserts feature h1/h2 is visible, asserts a nav link\n  exists for each route, asserts no console/network errors.\n\nRefactoring supervisor (orchestrator):\n- refactoring-supervisor.md: add the `Phase 4 Step 6 — UI smoke gate`\n  section. Before PO sign-off the supervisor MUST bring backend +\n  frontend up, run smoke.spec.ts, capture screenshots of /home + 3\n  bounded-context samples, and ask the user a *visual* confirmation\n  question — sign-off cannot proceed until the user confirms layout is\n  coherent. Adds the matching decision-rule row to the table.\n\nTop-level:\n- INFOSYNC-REFACTORING-AGENT-GAP-REPORT.md: new file documenting the\n  8 gap classes (G1-G8), root-cause analysis of why each automated\n  check missed them, the exact file→change mapping, and the strategic\n  recommendation to add a `ui-smoke-validator` agent in a future wave.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(refactoring): per-iteration BootSmokeTest gate + body-length enforcement\n\nAdds the per-iteration \"app starts\" gate and the body-length wall.\n\n## Per-iteration BootSmokeTest gate\n\nAnchored to the InfoSync 2026-05 startup regression — `mvn test`\nreported 177/177 pass against the test profile while\n`java -jar target/*.jar` (default profile) crashed because a\n@Service constructor depended on a JPA repo bean the default profile\nexcluded.\n\nPatches that close the gap:\n- `backend-scaffolder.md` + `error-and-security.md`: scaffold MUST\n  emit `BootSmokeTest.java` (`@SpringBootTest`, NO `@ActiveProfiles`).\n  Step 11 self-check: `mvn -q -DskipTests package` + `mvn -Dtest=BootSmokeTest`\n  + `! grep @CrossOrigin`.\n- `phase4-challenger.md` + `checklist-templates.md`: Check 11 verifies\n  the file exists, has no @ActiveProfiles, and `mvn -Dtest=BootSmokeTest`\n  passes. FINDING-BOOT-SMOKE-MISSING / FINDING-BOOT-SMOKE-FAILS taxonomy.\n- `tobe-testing-challenger.md` + `check-detail.md`: Check 10 enforces\n  the same at Phase 5 — `BootSmokeTest` is required as a separate\n  gate from the test-profile suites.\n- `refactoring-supervisor.md` + `decision-rules.md` + `ui-smoke-gate.md`:\n  the Step 2 incremental loop''s sub-step 2.6.1 is the per-iteration\n  BootSmokeTest run — the supervisor refuses to advance to the next\n  feature until the default-profile context still loads.\n\n## Body-length enforcement (warn ≥ 10k, ERROR ≥ 12k)\n\n`validate_catalog.py`:\n- Soft target stays at 10 000 chars (warning).\n- New HARD wall at 12 000 chars (error blocks the PR).\n- `HARD_CEILING_ALLOWLIST` grandfathers the 4 pre-existing supervisors\n  over 12k. Goal: drain the list; adding a new entry needs a PR\n  rationale.\n- `CLAUDE.md` policy text updated.\n\n## Extraction: refactoring-supervisor (30k → 9672)\n\nReduced by 21k via extraction to:\n- `docs/refactoring-workflow/decision-rules.md` (full situation→\n  decision table including new per-iteration BootSmokeTest gate)\n- `docs/refactoring-workflow/deliberative-integration.md` (activation,\n  dispatch, policy, hard rules)\n- `docs/refactoring-workflow/ui-smoke-gate.md` (Phase 4 Step 6 UI\n  smoke procedure + pre-sign-off visual confirmation)\n\nAll 5 originally-oversize agents in this branch now under 10k:\n\n  refactoring-supervisor.md      9 672\n  backend-scaffolder.md          9 655\n  frontend-scaffolder.md         9 914\n  phase4-challenger.md           9 862\n  tobe-testing-challenger.md     9 453\n\nValidator now reports `Status: WARNINGS — no blocking errors`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7695a511a222890d2579d0b359b487e8c64c9cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/7695a511a222890d2579d0b359b487e8c64c9cea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/9d33068aa8c600df01d42bfd2312d1b5e157bddb","verification":{"payload":"tree 7695a511a222890d2579d0b359b487e8c64c9cea\nparent a5c0d1233ff1da47d1a5f56ae8b6bad38ecf7817\nauthor Luke The Rose <luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com> 1779423591 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779423591 +0200\n\nfix(refactor): per-iteration BootSmokeTest gate + body-length enforcement (warn ≥10k / error ≥12k) (#42)\n\n* docs(refactoring): close shell+nav+405+CORS gaps surfaced by InfoSync retro\n\nAnchored to the InfoSync 2026-05 retrospective\n(INFOSYNC-REFACTORING-AGENT-GAP-REPORT.md, new top-level file): the\npipeline declared green (177/177 + 200/200 + 204/204) while the FE was\nunusable. Patches close every gap-class at the layer that should have\ncaught it.\n\nFrontend scaffolder (agents + reference docs):\n- app-shell.md: mandate full overwrite of app.component.html; provide\n  the canonical `<app-layout><router-outlet/></app-layout>` template;\n  document the placeholder-string self-check.\n- code-skeletons.md: add `core/layout` section with siden