/api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/a5c0d1233ff1da47d1a5f56ae8b6bad38ecf7817/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T08:42:40Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"Luke The Rose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T08:42:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(validator): body-length ratchet + extract refactoring-supervisor (#41)\n\nTwo changes that together eliminate the 5 body-length warnings the\nrecent PR introduced and prevent recurrence:\n\n1. **Extract `refactoring-supervisor` body 24 384 -> 9 108 chars**:\n   the Decision rules table, Deliberative decision integration prose,\n   and Constraints list move to three new docs under\n   `claude-catalog/docs/refactoring-workflow/`:\n   - `decision-rules.md`           — authoritative decision table\n   - `deliberation-integration.md` — debate-routing activation paths\n   - `constraints.md`              — workflow-level invariants\n   The supervisor body keeps the role, escalation triggers, headline\n   rules, and reference-doc table (the kind of content consulted on\n   every step). Marketplace mirror bumped 3.2.1 -> 3.2.2.\n\n2. **Body-length ratchet in `validate_catalog.py`** with a per-file\n   legacy baseline at `.github/scripts/legacy-body-baseline.json`.\n   The 10 000-char ceiling is now a HARD ERROR for:\n     - any agent NOT on the baseline that exceeds 10 000 chars\n     - any legacy agent that grows past its per-file baseline\n   Legacy agents within their baseline still emit a warning so they\n   stay visible. Smoke-tested: growing baseline-testing-supervisor\n   by 200 chars produces exit code 1 with a \"ratchet rule forbids\n   body growth on legacy files\" error. When a legacy file is\n   extracted below 10 000 chars, REMOVE its entry so a future\n   regrowth is caught immediately.\n\n   CLAUDE.md updated to document the ratchet rule.\n\nValidator: catalog WARNINGS (18 legacy offenders within their\nbaselines — same set as before this PR, no regressions), marketplace\nPASS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5484aa940301137a80780458ea18a0fb1f378121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/5484aa940301137a80780458ea18a0fb1f378121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/a5c0d1233ff1da47d1a5f56ae8b6bad38ecf7817","verification":{"payload":"tree 5484aa940301137a80780458ea18a0fb1f378121\nparent 9e73bec18c218db95b220dd2e3f30a835c6afe79\nauthor Luke The Rose <luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com> 1779180160 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779180160 +0200\n\nfeat(validator): body-length ratchet + extract refactoring-supervisor (#41)\n\nTwo changes that together eliminate the 5 body-length warnings the\nrecent PR introduced and prevent recurrence:\n\n1. **Extract `refactoring-supervisor` body 24 384 -> 9 108 chars**:\n   the Decision rules table, Deliberative decision integration prose,\n   and Constraints list move to three new docs under\n   `claude-catalog/docs/refactoring-workflow/`:\n   - `decision-rules.md`           — authoritative decision table\n   - `deliberation-integration.md` — debate-routing activation paths\n   - `constraints.md`              — workflow-level invariants\n   The supervisor body keeps the role, escalation triggers, headline\n   rules, and reference-doc table (the kind of content consulted on\n   every step). Marketplace mirror bumped 3.2.1 -> 3.2.2.\n\n2. **Body-length ratchet in `validate_catalog.py`** with a per-file\n   legacy baseline at `.github/scripts/legacy-body-baseline.json`.\n   The 10 000-char ceiling is now a HARD ERROR for:\n     - any agent NOT on the baseline that exceeds 10 000 chars\n     - any legacy agent that grows past its per-file baseline\n   Legacy agents within their baseline still emit a warning so they\n   stay visible. Smoke-tested: growing baseline-testing-supervisor\n   by 200 chars produces exit code 1 with a \"ratchet rule forbids\n   body growth on legacy files\" error. When a legacy file is\n   extracted below 10 000 chars, REMOVE its entry so a future\n   regrowth is caught immediately.\n\n   CLAUDE.md updated to document the ratchet rule.\n\nValidator: catalog WARNINGS (18 legacy offenders within their\nbaselines — same set as before this PR, no regressions), marketplace\nPASS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDCKACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoQwQABGfrygP6H04TGJh1joelQ7H\nyWII+CTeZdn0mapmMLtcVafJPrp3TyMC86aBfofIkQ09fYsCofE0EpUVdbpjD9Io\nA2gcBOUTSwSN51PwiSCBtQ3NvFR+X5juRC09gDz+RBBRkmKtnzzAHFYyJhzgOXpV\nNE3zFGhIBLDnzz7pVyzo3Gd0InOK9qNfexBMioaJQjz+9whsd+kxtPFZAtFrnimF\nhVlyyyfrJLSi7okpM73F/GFNn7g1aMeYl6+jYVZJJDKEAbxWgKDl2T1kCrSZo4If\nEydx6gnqvsLxx+W+gasGpe/io/zZeGOjSxsrqoX6g82NtZI6ZxyWJ7DsRdxmvjSr\nU/2+vEMby1JOeKQoKRG4gPB1TBRzg06zlNu8a3SDUbedrMxp6uPWOYs8ngFUzQg5\nLTOGzMza76MxuJqzcU6M4gH4D03mRsI0zGTftDOlUYqOv1ojZSPYotCu6JdP+k1A\n6ILUgo/vZH2niJR3tRd4KXzSuF4TXVwXw7eHEQCoZJnnFPQNerBTNr4dEbC28RB5\nGhju5bOkBANsChkRFmSfX6nhtrLF7cSPiKNinsZm5TAKkN5ta9ApOt82JDkV17