2T12:37:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(orchestration): evidence-first gates, refactoring-supervisor v3.1.0, evals (#37)\n\n* docs: Phase 1 + Phase 2 normalized JSONL output schemas\n\nRewrites normalized-output-schema.md for Phase 1 (functional analysis)\nand Phase 2 (technical analysis) with authoritative JSONL schemas\nincluding source_agent fields, status rules, evidence constraints,\nraw/ file list, CSV/audit JSON schemas, and confidence/inference-level\nreference table. Evidence-backed: every record must cite evidence_ids.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase0): bronze/gold KB layout for Phase 0 structural sub-agents\n\n- codebase-mapper@2.0.0: primary outputs to bronze/ with file-inventory.jsonl,\n  large-files.jsonl, large-file-chunks.jsonl, parse-errors.jsonl; evidence\n  record emission to evidence-ledger.jsonl; large-file policy integration;\n  output-templates.md updated with bronze/ JSONL record templates\n- dependency-analyzer@2.0.0: primary outputs in bronze/ (import-graph.json,\n  dependency-locks.json); evidence record emission for each dependency\n- synthesizer@2.0.0: primary outputs in gold/; Gold synthesis rule enforced —\n  no new claims beyond bronze/silver; unresolved-gaps.md aggregates silver gaps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* release: indexing-supervisor@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''indexing-supervisor'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: module-documenter@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''module-documenter'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: business-logic-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''business-logic-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: data-flow-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''data-flow-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: streamlit-analyzer@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''streamlit-analyzer'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: actor-feature-mapper@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''actor-feature-mapper'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: ui-surface-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''ui-surface-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: io-catalog-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''io-catalog-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: user-flow-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''user-flow-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: implicit-logic-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''implicit-logic-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: code-quality-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''code-quality-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: state-runtime-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''state-runtime-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: dependency-security-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''dependency-security-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: data-access-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''data-access-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: integration-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''integration-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: performance-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''performance-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: resilience-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''resilience-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: security-analyst@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''security-analyst'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: risk-synthesizer@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''risk-synthesizer'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* feat(phase2): evidence-grounded W1 analysts + risk-synthesizer normalized JSONL\n\n- All 8 Phase 2 W1 analysts: grounding policy + raw JSONL findings before markdown\n- Every finding requires evidence_ids; high/critical require verified status\n- risk-synthesizer: merges raw JSONL into normalized/technical-findings.jsonl + risk-register.jsonl + risk-evidence-matrix.csv; Gold synthesis rule enforced (no new findings)\n- CHANGELOG updated under [Unreleased] ### Changed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* release: refactoring-supervisor@3.1.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''refactoring-supervisor'' version 3.1.0 to beta tier.\n\n* feat(orchestration): evidence-first gates + evals in refactoring-supervisor\n\n- refactoring-supervisor: pre-phase-advancement gate reads auditor/validator\n  verdicts (gold/indexing-audit.json, normalized/functional-traceability-audit.json,\n  normalized/technical-evidence-audit.json) before advancing phases\n- Phase 0 section: bronze/stack.json canonical path, legacy 02-structure/ note,\n  evidence-ledger.jsonl and graph/ context graph awareness\n- Phase 1/2 sections: normalized/ JSONL artifact layer documented\n- Phase 4 constraint: must consume normalized JSONL artifacts, not markdown alone\n- CHANGELOG [Unreleased]: comprehensive evidence-first pipeline entries\n- New evals/indexing-pipeline-eval.md: 10 eval scenarios covering hallucination,\n  omission, large-file, purity, and graph-orphan traps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase0-2): context graph builder + KB validators\n\n- build_context_graph.py: builds nodes.jsonl/edges.jsonl from bronze/silver KB with 9 node types and 7 edge types; emits graph-quality-report.md with PASS/PASS_WITH_GAPS/FAIL verdict\n- retrieve_context_bundle.py: BFS context bundle retrieval (--hops) for Phase 1/2 agents; resolves evidence_ids from ledger\n- validate_indexing_kb.py: Phase 0 quality validator (exit 0/1/2); checks manifest, stack.json, file-inventory, evidence-ledger deduplication, large-file status, business-rules coverage, AS-IS purity\n- validate_functional_analysis.py: Phase 1 quality validator; checks confirmed UCs have evidence_ids, functional-gaps present, no TO-BE tokens, traceability audit verdict\n- validate_technical_analysis.py: Phase 2 quality validator; checks findings have evidence_ids, high/critical have validation.status, no prescriptive language, evidence audit verdict\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase0): Bronze KB builder scripts (8 deterministic Python scripts)\n\nAdd 8 stdlib-only scripts to claude-catalog/scripts/indexing/ that produce\nthe bronze/ KB artifacts: file inventory, symbol index, import graph,\nconfig/env index, I/O boundaries, test inventory, large-file chunking,\nand manifest. All scripts handle parse errors gracefully (logged to\nparse-errors.jsonl) and never crash the whole run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase0): grounding docs + silver KB output schemas for Phase 0 agents\n\n- Add grounding-policy.md: no-evidence-no-claim contract with confidence/\n  inference levels and gap creation rules (Unit 1)\n- Add evidence-ledger-schema.md: full EV-NNNNNN record schema and append-only\n  emission rules for all Phase 0 sub-agents (Unit 1)\n- Add large-file-policy.md: large/huge/giant thresholds, outline→chunk→evidence\n  strategy, AST-first chunking for Python, symbol classification taxonomy (Unit 1)\n- Update codebase-mapper.md, dependency-analyzer.md, synthesizer.md: bronze/gold\n  output paths, evidence emission, Gold synthesis rule (Unit 5 residual)\n- Update business-logic-analyst/output-schemas.md,\n  data-flow-analyst/output-schemas.md: evidence_ids added to all record templates\n  (Unit 6 residual)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add operational guide for Claude Registry infrastructure\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"600e856e63dbb7aa62359a407a38e212e59f8dc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/600e856e63dbb7aa62359a407a38e212e59f8dc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/co