pervisor@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''indexing-supervisor'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* docs(analysis): add normalized JSONL output schemas for Phase 1 and Phase 2\n\nIntroduces two new reference docs defining the machine-readable JSONL\nartifact schemas produced alongside existing markdown reports in the\nApplication Replatforming pipeline:\n\n- docs/functional-analysis/normalized-output-schema.md — schemas for\n  use-case-candidates, feature-candidates, actor-candidates,\n  business-rules, functional-gaps, uc-evidence-matrix, and\n  functional-traceability-audit; AS-IS purity rules and quality\n  summary metrics.\n- docs/technical-analysis/normalized-output-schema.md — schemas for\n  technical-findings, risk-register, technical-gaps,\n  risk-evidence-matrix, and technical-evidence-audit; evidence and\n  purity enforcement rules.\n\nUpdates output-layout.md in both phases to add normalized/, raw/, and\nfinal/ subdirectories and the functional-traceability-report.md /\ntechnical-evidence-report.md _meta entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* release: technical-evidence-auditor@1.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''technical-evidence-auditor'' version 1.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: functional-traceability-auditor@1.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''functional-traceability-auditor'' version 1.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: indexing-auditor@1.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''indexing-auditor'' version 1.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: functional-analysis-challenger@1.2.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''functional-analysis-challenger'' version 1.2.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: technical-analysis-challenger@1.2.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''technical-analysis-challenger'' version 1.2.0 to beta tier.\n\n* feat(phase1): add functional-traceability-auditor + evidence quality check in challenger\n\n- Creates functional-traceability-auditor (sonnet, cyan): always-ON Wave 3b auditor\n  for Phase 1 that validates evidence traceability, negative space coverage, and\n  AS-IS purity across three audit passes; produces normalized audit JSON + human\n  report with PASS/PASS_WITH_GAPS/FAIL verdict\n- Enhances functional-analysis-challenger with Check 7: evidence quality audit —\n  scans use-case-candidates.jsonl for confirmed UCs without evidence_ids and verifies\n  large file chunk IDs appear in Phase 1 claim evidence\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* release: functional-analysis-supervisor@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''functional-analysis-supervisor'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: technical-analysis-supervisor@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''technical-analysis-supervisor'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* feat(phase2): evidence grounding + technical-evidence-auditor in Phase 2 supervisor\n\n- stack.json canonical path: 02-structure/ -> bronze/\n- Adds evidence-ledger.jsonl and bronze/silver/ as primary evidence sources\n- Adds technical-evidence-auditor (always-ON Wave 3b) to phase plan and supervisor\n- Updates output-layout.md: expands normalized/ and raw/ JSONL artifact listings\n- Updates dispatch-prompt-template.md: injects grounding policy into all W1 sub-agent prompts\n- Gap closure loop added before HITL checkpoint\n- New HITL gate format surfaces evidence auditor verdict + gap counts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase1): evidence grounding + functional-traceability-auditor in Phase 1 supervisor\n\n- stack.json canonical path updated from 02-structure/ to bronze/\n- evidence-ledger.jsonl and bronze/silver/ tiers added as primary evidence sources\n- functional-traceability-auditor registered as always-ON Wave 3b (not opt-in)\n- grounding policy injection block added to dispatch-prompt-template.md\n- traceability-auditor FAIL verdict added to decision rules table\n- normalized-output-schema.md added to reference docs table\n- output-layout.md: Normalized JSONL artifacts section with key schemas\n- phase-plan.md: Wave 3b, gap closure loop, updated HITL format\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(phase2): add technical-evidence-auditor + normalized output audit in challenger\n\n- Creates technical-evidence-auditor (sonnet, yellow): always-ON Wave 3b auditor\n- 13 evidence quality checks across completeness, purity, separation of concerns, large file coverage\n- Produces normalized/technical-evidence-audit.json + _meta/technical-evidence-report.md\n- Enhances technical-analysis-challenger with Check 7: normalized output audit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: Phase 1 + Phase 2 normalized JSONL output schemas\n\nRewrites normalized-output-schema.md for Phase 1 (functional analysis)\nand Phase 2 (technical analysis) with authoritative JSONL schemas\nincluding source_agent fields, status rules, evidence constraints,\nraw/ file list, CSV/audit JSON schemas, and confidence/inference-level\nreference table. Evidence-backed: every record must cite evidence_ids.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* release: codebase-mapper@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''codebase-mapper'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: dependency-analyzer@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''dependency-analyzer'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n* release: synthesizer@2.0.0 → beta\n\nPublished capability ''synthesizer'' version 2.0.0 to beta tier.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f579e28476976157bac7bafe84a0c66bec698d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/6f579e28476976157bac7bafe84a0c66bec698d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/b64a892dd5cb5fe4b5417c3b578bf4f880c0d04d","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f579e28476976157bac7bafe84a0c66bec698d0\nparent e073bc4a420e270f69fe441676a9a6e2bc972c97\nauthor Luke The Rose <luca.la