ps://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/596365d97fb3bb6f6777b685caa1978ff62832bf","sha":"596365d97fb3bb6f6777b685caa1978ff62832bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/596365d97fb3bb6f6777b685caa1978ff62832bf"}],"sha":"55d93cf77d5efd6e4364c29875bd52e57a05b6d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/55d93cf77d5efd6e4364c29875bd52e57a05b6d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/596365d97fb3bb6f6777b685caa1978ff62832bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:04:21Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"Luke The Rose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T07:04:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"iter-6: CLAUDE.md quick-reference table + extract refactoring-tobe-supervisor (-56%) (#28)\n\n* docs(claude.md): add Capability quick reference table for audit↔remediation loop\n\nCloses the auditor''s iter-5 quick win #5: a single table at the top of\nCLAUDE.md mapping every action a contributor takes (audit, extract,\nvalidate, scaffold, publish, review) to the capability or doc that\nperforms it. Lifts CLAUDE.md from 97/100 to ~98-99/100 on the\n\"Actionability\" axis.\n\nThe auditor''s quick win #1 (sed-sweep rubric pointer on 75 descriptions)\nwas a no-op in practice — the pointer is already on 75/76 descriptions\nsince iter-3 (the auditor''s count was incorrect).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(refactoring-tobe-supervisor): extract phase narrative; body 38k → 17k (-56%)\n\nValidates the supervisor-extraction recipe (added in iter-5) end-to-end\non the largest non-deferred supervisor in the registry.\n\nExtracted 5 reference docs under claude-catalog/docs/refactoring-tobe/:\n- output-layout.md (4.4 KB) — directory tree + frontmatter contract\n- iteration-and-scope-modes.md (3.7 KB) — Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 mode flags\n- phase-plan.md (10.2 KB) — Phase 0 + W1–W6 + Export Wave\n- dispatch-prompt-template.md (4.3 KB) — worker prompt boilerplate\n- final-recap-template.md (2.4 KB) — closing-report schema\n\nThe supervisor body retains only decision logic (escalation triggers,\ndecision rules, inverse drift check, manifest update, hard constraints)\nplus a `## Reference docs` anchor table that lists every extracted file\nwith one line on when to read it. Phase narrative is now read on\ndemand, not loaded on every supervision step.\n\nBody still over the 10 000-char rubric ceiling (16 890) but down by\nhalf — further trimming would extract decision logic, which the recipe\nexplicitly forbids.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a263c7f2d1cfd1383ff4aa53e57c09659dd053c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/a263c7f2d1cfd1383ff4aa53e57c09659dd053c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukethero