a541526942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T03:59:36Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T03:59:36Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat(refactoring-supervisor): rename to Application Replatforming + 7-step incremental Phase 4\n\nBump 2.2.0 → 3.0.0. Capability rebranded \"Application Refactoring\" →\n\"Application Replatforming\"; technical agent ID `refactoring-supervisor`\npreserved for backward compatibility. Phase 4 (the rewriting phase)\nfully redesigned as a progressive, incremental, test-driven, continuously\nvalidated 7-step loop with hard build+start+test gates between every\nstep: Bootstrap, Minimal Skeleton, Incremental Feature Loop, Mandatory\nValidation Loop (sub-loop on any failure), Progressive System\nConstruction, Hardening, Final Validation. Replaces both the previous\nbig-bang Phase 4 (TO-BE Refactoring with `scaffold-todo`) and the\nprevious separate Phase 5 (TO-BE Testing & Equivalence Verification) —\nfinal validation is now Step 6 of Phase 4. The application is always\nin a working state throughout Phase 4. Phases 0-3 are unchanged in\nlogic, structure, and outputs (only one descriptive forward-reference\nin the Phase 3 entry was updated for internal consistency). Workflow\nmanifest schema, decision rules, constraints, and activation examples\nall updated to match the new model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9362d9c209817b31b8538270afccfb4f8b27798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/b9362d9c209817b31b8538270afccfb4f8b27798"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/8a4ae06c79f01b6f8ca5ae1f268639a541526942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_u