/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/39bdbe8a86df56acd25377bb631e15874911f80c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:55:38Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:55:38Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat(refactoring-supervisor): low-TODO Phase 4 + iterative Phase 5 loop\n\nBump 2.1.0 → 2.2.0. Phase 4 default code-scope flipped to `full` so the\nphase ends with few TODOs (soft budget ≤ 1 TODO per 10 UCs, audited in\nStep E.4 of the post-phase recap). Phase 5 turned into an iterative loop:\neach dispatch is one iteration, the workflow supervisor surfaces a\npass/fail recap with pass-rate % and trend, and the user chooses\n[iterate | accept | stop] until 100% or explicit accept. accept is\nblocked while critical or high failures remain. Workflow manifest gains\ntodo_count fields for Phase 4 and iterations[] / trend for Phase 5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8acb839ef1a63593979a577bcbfc50d3e0a026f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/8acb839ef1a63593979a577bcbfc50d3e0a026f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/39bdbe8a86df56acd25377bb631e15874911f80c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com