subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/ee8b7b21e5252cae2b544495e897b1f4a2af2f18","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGVlOGI3YjIxZTUyNTJjYWUyYjU0NDQ5NWU4OTdiMWY0YTJhZjJmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/a1ce2f52bf379a69fbe5b12ddb8fb020ab760e2e","sha":"a1ce2f52bf379a69fbe5b12ddb8fb020ab760e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/a1ce2f52bf379a69fbe5b12ddb8fb020ab760e2e"}],"sha":"ee8b7b21e5252cae2b544495e897b1f4a2af2f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/ee8b7b21e5252cae2b544495e897b1f4a2af2f18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/a1ce2f52bf379a69fbe5b12ddb8fb020ab760e2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:46:26Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T08:46:26Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"chore(agents): drop Flyway, Liquibase is the only migration tool\n\nPolicy change: every TO-BE generator across the registry now produces\nLiquibase YAML changelogs only. Flyway is forbidden in generated output\neven when the AS-IS legacy project uses it — when migrating from a\nFlyway-based codebase, the agent runs `liquibase generateChangeLog`\nagainst a copy of the existing DB and retires the Flyway scripts.\n\nAnalyzer agents (data-access-analyst, integration-test-writer) keep\nFlyway in the schema-migration detection list since the AS-IS may use\nit; both files now carry an explicit note that detection is\ninformational and Phase 4 always rebuilds with Liquibase.\n\nAffects 13 capabilities (catalog + marketplace mirrors):\n\n  Agents (generators):\n  - data-mapper                    0.1.0 -> 0.2.0  (full Section 6\n    rewrite to Liquibase YAML changelogs with master aggregator,\n    rollback blocks, contexts; output paths db/changelog/<NN>__*.yaml)\n  - backend-scaffolder             0.1.0 -> 0.2.0  (Maven deps + Spring\n    config: org.flywaydb -> org.liquibase, spring.flyway ->\n    spring.liquibase / db.changelog-master.yaml)\n  - decomposition-architect        0.1.0 -> 0.2.0  (ADR-002 mandates\n    Liquibase YAML; tech table updated)\n  - logic-translator               0.1.0 -> 0.2.0  (forbidden-write\n    list: db/migration/ -> db/changelog/)\n  - refactoring-tobe-supervisor    0.2.1 -> 0.3.0  (pipeline diagram +\n    output tree + reporting block)\n  - refactoring-supervisor         2.0.0 -> 2.1.0  (Wave 3 BE step 2\n    diagram updated)\n  - developer-java                 2.1.0 -> 2.2.0  (''never do'' rule\n    strengthened; postgresql-expert reference line)\n  - developer-kotlin               0.1.0 -> 0.2.0  (project scaffold:\n    db/migration -> db/changelog)\n\n  Agents (analyzers — detection clarified):\n  - data-access-analyst            0.1.1 -> 0.2.0\n  - integration-test-writer        0.1.0 -> 0.2.0\n\n  Skills:\n  - postgresql-expert              1.1.0 -> 1.2.0  (frontmatter +\n    Reference Stack: Liquibase is ''the only supported tool'', Flyway\n    loophole removed)\n  - java-spring-standards          1.1.0 -> 1.2.0  (''the only supported\n    migration tool. Flyway is forbidden.'')\n  - backend-orchestrator           1.1.0 -> 1.2.0  (capability table +\n    decision matrix + output strategy)\n\nTemplates / examples / evals: ADR template, developer-java-example,\ndeveloper-java-eval switched to Liquibase YAML changelogs. Wiki\n(Architecture.md, Capability-catalog.md) and root README data-mapper\nblurb updated.\n\nHistorical CHANGELOG entries that mention Flyway as a past state are\nleft as-is — they are factual records of completed transitions, not\ncurrent policy.\n\nValidated:\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_catalog.py     -> all checks passed\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_marketplace.py -> all checks passed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08b818a60cf64fa75b3c64e7cb3e00583c9ef224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/08b818a60cf64fa75b3c64e7cb3e00583c9ef224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/a1ce2f52bf379a69fbe5b12ddb8fb020ab760e2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luket