:"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGQwMjUzNmE2MjdmZWU4NDE1MDhlYzE5NmJmYWQ3ZGI2NzQ1Y2U5ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/69687e86d2d1635955fb1760eefa8faa2cac0a5f","sha":"69687e86d2d1635955fb1760eefa8faa2cac0a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/69687e86d2d1635955fb1760eefa8faa2cac0a5f"}],"sha":"d02536a627fee841508ec196bfad7db6745ce9ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/d02536a627fee841508ec196bfad7db6745ce9ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/84651485e1dc7208f04ca2f0eea1ba9dc1850b5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T17:23:50Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"Luke The Rose"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T17:23:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(marketplace): group agents and skills into thematic subfolders (#24)\n\nCatalog and marketplace previously had a flat layout in several places —\n60+ agent files in claude-marketplace/beta/, 38 skill files in\nclaude-marketplace/skills/, and 13 root-level catalog agents — making it\nhard for both Claude and humans to scan. This commit reorganizes\neverything into thematic subfolders that mirror each other.\n\n- Catalog: 13 root agents grouped under agents/{orchestration,\n  architecture,analysis,api,quality,documentation}/. Single root skill\n  accenture-branding moved to skills/branding/.\n\n- Marketplace: every published .md file moved to <tier>/<topic>/<name>.md\n  (mirrors the catalog). Skills nest by framework where relevant\n  (skills/frontend/{angular,react,qwik,vue,vanilla}/). 114 catalog.json\n  entries had their `file` field rewritten to the new path.\n\n- validate_marketplace.py: accepts both flat and nested file paths under\n  every tier; orphan-file scan switched from glob to rglob.\n\n- publish.sh: gains --topic flag. Auto-resolves topic from --topic →\n  existing catalog entry → catalog source path. Removes stale copies of\n  the same capability under the same tier so re-grouping never leaves\n  orphan files behind.\n\n- setup-capabilities.sh: now reads the `file` field from catalog.json\n  directly. The field is the single source of truth — no more path\n  inference from <tier>/<name>.md.\n\n- Project CLAUDE.md, claude-marketplace/README.md,\n  claude-marketplace/docs/how-to-consume.md,\n  claude-catalog/release-process.md, claude-catalog/docs/quick-start.md,\n  wiki/Contributing.md, wiki/What-is-Claude-Registry.md updated with the\n  new path conventions. The \"marketplace stays FLAT\" rule has been\n  removed; replaced with a \"Marketplace topics\" section enumerating the\n  topic vocabulary and the rule for spawning a new topic folder.\n\nNo behaviour change for capability consumers: every agent/skill ID is\nidentical; only the on-disk path changed. setup-capabilities.sh\ncontinues to install agents flat under ~/.claude/agents/ exactly as\nbefore — Claude Code does not care where the source lived in the\nregistry.\n\nValidated:\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_catalog.py    → all checks passed\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_marketplace.py → all checks passed\n- bash setup-capabilities.sh <tmpdir> all         → 114 files installed,\n  114 Agent rules added to settings.json (smoke test)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfae8bab98b67bbc7d553e16a028c9c29c11aaea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/bfae8bab98b67bbc7d553e16a028c9c29c11aaea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/84651485e1dc7208f04ca2f0eea1ba9dc1850b5c","verification":{"payload":"tree bfae8bab98b67bbc7d553e16a028c9c29c11aaea\nparent 0ee09fc8ecc532ee068b9323ed1cf281765e6120\nauthor Luke The Rose <luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com> 1777483430 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777483430 +0200\n\nrefactor(marketplace): group agents and skills into thematic subfolders (#24)\n\nCatalog and marketplace previously had a flat layout in several places —\n60+ agent files in claude-marketplace/beta/, 38 skill files in\nclaude-marketplace/skills/, and 13 root-level catalog agents — making it\nhard for both Claude and humans to scan. This commit reorganizes\neverything into thematic subfolders that mirror each other.\n\n- Catalog: 13 root agents grouped under agents/{orchestration,\n  architecture,analysis,api,quality,documentation}/. Single root skill\n  accenture-branding moved to skills/branding/.\n\n- Marketplace: every published .md file moved to <tier>/<topic>/<name>.md\n  (mirrors the catalog). Skills nest by framework where relevant\n  (skills/frontend/{angular,react,qwik,vue,vanilla}/). 114 catalog.json\n  entries had their `file` field rewritten to the new path.\n\n- validate_marketplace.py: accepts both flat and nested file paths under\n  every tier; orphan-file scan switched from glob to rglob.\n\n- publish.sh: gains --topic flag. Auto-resolves topic from --topic →\n  existing catalog entry → catalog source path. Removes stale copies of\n  the same capability under the same tier so re-grouping never leaves\n  orphan files behind.\n\n- setup-capabilities.sh: now reads the `file` field from catalog.json\n  directly. The field is the single source of truth — no more path\n  inference from <tier>/<name>.md.\n\n- Project CLAUDE.md, claude-marketplace/README.md,\n  claude-marketplace/docs/how-to-consume.md,\n  claude-catalog/release-process.md, claude-catalog/docs/quick-start.md,\n  wiki/Contributing.md, wiki/What-is-Claude-Registry.md updated with the\n  new path conventions. The \"marketplace stays FLAT\" rule has been\n  removed; replaced with a \"Marketplace topics\" section enumerating the\n  topic vocabulary and the rule for spawning a new topic folder.\n\nNo behaviour change for capability consumers: every agent/skill ID is\nidentical; only the on-disk path changed. setup-capabilities.sh\ncontinues to install agents flat under ~/.claude/agents/ exactly as\nbefore — Claude Code does not care where the source lived in the\nregistry.\n\nValidated:\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_catalog.py    → all checks passed\n- python3 .github/scripts/validate_marketplace.py → all checks passed\n- bash setup-capabilities.sh <tmpdir> all         → 114 files installed,\n  114 Agent rules added to settings.json (smoke test)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8j6mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzVYQADFqPc1VJr9q+M0CpysKO+q5\nIvWz8Bf8RDdAx9AQ5pyYw8bumqFJ9NiL5iQOb1Q6NpdK1E4cWe7gjFTDLRadi5sj\ngvZJmSXOTbnxKr5+7o6QA0gHRp7Kl1fSijVQdZh1cneJNPqkNhXfItVl1jdqNtqi\noJVM12sS3+wl4Lz2WaATAwonto9cenE7khhxbfVI3zM78aCoJbS/rsElj16osex7\n8QE+1Y8cGTwd1ydvANLVK74FSfQftAWPevPbGPMuNUs5zK6rGse+Ky2GrBCw2TQa\n/FiP9FIwKoS0PpnyHC3CfPNd765V8YKE+cF8R3z42PwPeI8ZEk23qWlMEFCYsANx\n3fdl6P7OtPIHfdFO4Gy8zr5MSzsv5xhNMWOgYJIipDOlQKI3VgRqAEftxHqVx/wP\nRnG