(Java/Spring + Angular) (#19)\n\nDriven by recurring defects observed in generated code. Six capabilities\nbumped, four skills + two agents updated, with catalog.json + marketplace\nmirrored and CHANGELOG entries added.\n\nBackend (Java/Spring) rules now non-negotiable:\n- DTO+Mapper layer mandatory; no Map.of, no entities reaching controllers\n- One annotation per line; never inline-stacked\n- Liquibase preferred over Flyway; H2 in-memory local profile + seed data mandatory\n- POM hierarchically indented (multi-line)\n- Migration-mode: best-guess + explicit TODO; preserve every source table\n\nFrontend (Angular) rules now strict:\n- Smart/Dumb separation enforced; HttpClient forbidden in components\n- Modernised to Angular 18+ (standalone, signals, inject(), @if/@for)\n- Style-guide rules pulled from https://angular.dev/style-guide\n- TODOs not conservative — best-guess implementation + explicit-assumption TODO\n\nCapabilities bumped:\n- developer-java 2.0.0 -> 2.1.0\n- java-spring-standards 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- spring-architecture 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- postgresql-expert 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- angular-expert 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- developer-frontend 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d6c8da2aebb4d971c85fb102c94ab3108aa11e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/7d6c8da2aebb4d971c85fb102c94ab3108aa11e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/4641340f9ea7c41e7a0ed6ad95da827a229f5fb0","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d6c8da2aebb4d971c85fb102c94ab3108aa11e3\nparent dc054337800544a0f2b0e929401b4c47f5f23e43\nauthor Luke The Rose <luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com> 1777462368 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777462368 +0200\n\nfeat: harden code-generation conventions (Java/Spring + Angular) (#19)\n\nDriven by recurring defects observed in generated code. Six capabilities\nbumped, four skills + two agents updated, with catalog.json + marketplace\nmirrored and CHANGELOG entries added.\n\nBackend (Java/Spring) rules now non-negotiable:\n- DTO+Mapper layer mandatory; no Map.of, no entities reaching controllers\n- One annotation per line; never inline-stacked\n- Liquibase preferred over Flyway; H2 in-memory local profile + seed data mandatory\n- POM hierarchically indented (multi-line)\n- Migration-mode: best-guess + explicit TODO; preserve every source table\n\nFrontend (Angular) rules now strict:\n- Smart/Dumb separation enforced; HttpClient forbidden in components\n- Modernised to Angular 18+ (standalone, signals, inject(), @if/@for)\n- Style-guide rules pulled from https://angular.dev/style-guide\n- TODOs not conservative — best-guess implementation + explicit-assumption TODO\n\nCapabilities bumped:\n- developer-java 2.0.0 -> 2.1.0\n- java-spring-standards 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- spring-architecture 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- postgresql-expert 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- angular-expert 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0\n- developer-frontend 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp8exgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOycQAKNL5Qi4lrIc5Ri284/YoJhp\nbweNwcmRF1jpmhc7C/NGJl7pyInQq5WlPMufbvrn3AkY48DR0Ots+YzdVNhk4DHi\nC2Hox38URcgANqzGwVafn9i+lzpsSg7V1pO4pFWR0cABH72r2kV+ZPXe90dC3VUG\nd8y/gRcLxgp6ZrZg5hz7haphHHDI2SFiEd6yZY//dXde3E/6PQ421L4Jfg6y71Tc\nfnHbz/IFZTluh1DWHHotjnkP7Fzjx3p8zeKFrECk6p84/xBIQYkAXsYCUBNImIkA\nRI512lvDuqk054oFRwuB3XsDQNTM3E03OO7jJlwAohdXqC5TrtyoRbThIXUxMHoN\nzAzOnpnfgD8Bwd0r/2wUpHbBDVJ1jXO72zkQB+KvLKnekatMHic5BFE4WhTRpF2N\nZ8Rdq+4D3l3I2882Uwt4urC+o6aa9OR3gWvqJimCJSKQ520UnMIwDWf/Y1btMfIU\nHVMoZ860wYFOrjYz+R8xGPUrhB9+a2aa3ALgcrJ93cQMElJxSNvb3UnRP8qUWuse\nQm1BTHntLzPh/dlsSKpJCYVYGdF71X49cg3pnFGFCgaC9AOc7qf5RVzuuFVocC3i\nWkEYM6xyX07oqRlX1Wtw2c9zdZWcXpP8iaSIZ41RpS1UwEA2ZxDL7nIbwA3pj9ee\nHLhiKXVhc/CfN1c0OyJF\n=aQIF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-29T11:32:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https:/