Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/76a4b6a8f593f4e585149a168e02377db62ea660","sha":"76a4b6a8f593f4e585149a168e02377db62ea660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/76a4b6a8f593f4e585149a168e02377db62ea660"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596","sha":"ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596"}],"sha":"ae0bed3d65528551e7b44452718626aeda7f5b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/ae0bed3d65528551e7b44452718626aeda7f5b67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T17:24:21Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T17:24:21Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add Phase 5 (TO-BE testing & equivalence verification) — workflow now full-cycle\n\nAdds the final phase of the refactoring workflow: TO-BE testing and\nequivalence verification. Validates the TO-BE codebase against the\nAS-IS baseline (Phase 3) and produces the deliverable equivalence\nreport signed by the Product Owner.\n\nNew folder: claude-catalog/agents/tobe-testing/ (1 supervisor + 8 workers)\n\ntobe-testing-supervisor (opus, 0.1.0):\n- 5-wave pipeline: test authoring (W1, parallel) → perf comparison\n  (W2) → execution (W3) → equivalence synthesis (W4) → challenger\n  (W5, always ON)\n- adaptive execute policy: on | backend-only | frontend-only | off\n- failure policy: critical/high escalate; medium/low → TBUG xfail\n- HITL checkpoint after Wave 1\n- resume modes (skip / re-run / revise)\n- AS-IS and TO-BE source code remain read-only\n\n8 sonnet workers:\n- equivalence-test-writer: per-UC fan-out, pytest harness comparing\n  TO-BE output vs Phase 3 AS-IS snapshots\n- backend-test-writer: JUnit 5 + Mockito + Testcontainers + Spring\n  Cloud Contract per OpenAPI operationId\n- frontend-test-writer: Jest + Angular Testing Library + Playwright\n  E2E from Phase 1 user-flows\n- security-test-writer: OWASP Top 10 + Phase 2 SEC-NN regression\n  matrix + optional ZAP baseline\n- performance-comparator: Gatling/k6 load tests; p95 ≤ +10% gate\n  vs Phase 3 baseline\n- tobe-test-runner: executes suites, captures coverage/contract/perf,\n  applies failure policy, only worker that may add @Disabled/xfail\n- equivalence-synthesizer: produces 01-equivalence-report.md\n  (DELIVERABLE — PO sign-off) with per-UC verdict + accepted-diffs\n  register + quality gate\n- tobe-testing-challenger: 8 adversarial checks (UC coverage,\n  OpenAPI↔TO-BE drift, AS-IS/TO-BE source modifications forbidden,\n  mocks-when-shouldn''t, equivalence integrity, PO sign-off, perf\n  gate compliance)\n\nrefactoring-supervisor 1.2.0 -> 2.0.0 (MAJOR milestone):\n- Phase 5 added to phase registry, schematic, bootstrap detection\n  table, workflow manifest schema (po_signoff state)\n- workflow now covers full AS-IS→TO-BE→validation journey\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9cbb0ae6ef865910af5aa9de7e6249fcccf165f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/f9cbb0ae6ef865910af5aa9de7e6249fcccf165f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/ec045585804595e006e92ede08f721d0b389a596","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGVjMDQ1NTg1ODA0NTk1ZTAwNmU5MmVkZTA4ZjcyMWQwYjM4OWE1OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/76a4b6a8f593f4e585149a168e02377db62ea660","sha":"76a4b6a8f593f4e585149a168e02377