","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/bd698b1fd29c6dc80193d5c4a220f24e0360b384/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T16:23:13Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T16:23:13Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add explicit skip/re-run/revise prompt to all phase supervisors\n\nExtends the existing pattern from Phases 1 and 2 (functional and\ntechnical analysis) to the remaining three phase supervisors. Every\nphase supervisor now classifies on-disk state in three modes\n(`fresh`, `resume-incomplete`, `complete-eligible`) and asks the user\nexplicitly before doing anything when prior outputs are detected.\n\nindexing-supervisor 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0:\n- bootstrap detects existing .indexing-kb/\n- prompts skip / re-run / revise (default: skip)\n- inconsistent state (manifest=partial/failed/missing) classified\n  separately with re-run recommendation\n- manifest tracks resume_mode field\n\nbaseline-testing-supervisor 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0:\n- bootstrap detects existing tests/baseline/ + docs/analysis/03-baseline/\n- prompts skip / re-run / revise; default skip because the oracle\n  (snapshots + benchmarks) is precious — re-running resets the\n  equivalence reference for Phase 5\n- per-artifact overwrite prompts only fire when the user chose\n  re-run or resume-incomplete\n- manifest tracks resume_mode field\n\nrefactoring-tobe-supervisor 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0:\n- bootstrap detects existing .refactoring-kb/ + docs/refactoring/ +\n  backend/ + frontend/\n- prompts skip / re-run / revise; default skip because re-running\n  overwrites generated code that may have been hand-edited\n- inconsistent state classified separately with re-run recommendation\n- manifest tracks resume_mode field\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14b5dcaa712a39c78adc5b274d8da0eace10eb6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/14b5dcaa712a39c78adc5b274d8da0eace10eb6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/bd698b1fd29c6dc80193d5c4a220f24e0360b384","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/bd698b1fd29c6dc80193d5c4a220f24e0360b384","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKGJkNjk4YjFmZDI5YzZkYzgwMTkzZDVjNGEyMjBmMjRlMDM2MGIzODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/f3d1db098931b0c52ea7a320568cf70bdfc87e06","sha":"f3d1db098931b0c52ea7a320568cf70bdfc87e06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/f3d1db098931b0