erose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/989b1d8e5e5b17f0484f3cbe425130fb34975f59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:21:51Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T15:21:51Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add Phase 1 PDF/PPTX exports and per-phase resume prompt\n\nfunctional-analysis-supervisor 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0:\n- adds Export Wave (always ON) after Wave 3 synthesis\n- dispatches document-creator + presentation-creator in parallel\n- produces _exports/01-functional-report.pdf (Accenture-branded\n  business-stakeholder reference) and 01-functional-deck.pptx\n  (executive deck for steering committee)\n- explicit overwrite confirmation when exports already exist\n- mirrors the export contract already in place for Phase 2\n\nrefactoring-supervisor 1.0.0 -> 1.1.0:\n- bootstrap now presents a per-phase detection table\n- asks user explicitly skip/re-run/revise for every detected phase\n- inconsistent state (manifest=partial/failed/missing) classified\n  separately and recommended for re-run, never auto-resumed\n- adds --no-resume-prompt opt-in for fresh-run workflows\n- updates Phase 1 schematic to include the new export wave\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6382e3cbee2475f9637a29b8594c0d43e083832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/a6382e3cbee2475f9637a29b8594c0d43e083832"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/989b1d8e5e5b17f0484f3cbe425130fb34975f59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/989b1d8e5e5b17f0484f3cbe425130fb34975f59","node_id":"C_kwDOSGvX_NoAKDk4OWIxZDhlNWU1YjE3ZjA0ODRmM2NiZTQyNTEzMGZiMzQ5NzVmNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/8391875c294dc60fd5d791a56e3b4661b39a6f8e","sha":"8391875c294dc60fd5d791a56e3b4661b39a6f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/8391875c294dc60fd5d791a56e3b4661b39a6f8e"}],"sha":"989b1d8e5e5b17f0484f3cbe425130fb34975f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/989b1d8e5e5b17f0484f3cbe425130fb34975f59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/8391875c294dc60fd5d791a56e3b4661b39a6f8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T14:47:42Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T14:47:42Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add refactoring-tobe pipeline (10 agents) for Phase 4\n\nPhase 4 TO-BE Refactoring pipeline. FIRST phase of the workflow with\ntarget technologies (Spring Boot 3 + Angular). Reads .indexing-kb/ +\nPhase 1/2/3 outputs and produces:\n- bounded-context decomposition + ADR-001/002 (W1)\n- OpenAPI 3.1 contract + ADR-003 (W2)\n- Spring Boot 3 backend scaffold + JPA layer + per-UC logic translation,\n  in parallel with Angular workspace (W3 BE+FE tracks)\n- production hardening + ADR-004/005 (W4)\n- migration roadmap (strangler fig) (W5)\n- adversarial review + AS-IS↔TO-BE traceability matrix (W6 always ON)\n\nComponents:\n- refactoring-tobe-supervisor (opus, entrypoint): 6 waves with strict\n  dependency chain (W1→W2→W3→W4→W5→W6); 3 HITL checkpoints (post-W1,\n  post-W2, post-W3); adaptive verification (mvn compile + ng build);\n  configurable iteration model (one-shot default | per-BC milestone)\n  and code scope (scaffold-todo default | full | structural);\n  per-step execution timings; inverse drift rule\n- W1: decomposition-architect — DDD bounded contexts + AS-IS↔TO-BE\n  module map + ADR-001/002\n- W2: api-contract-designer — OpenAPI 3.1 with x-uc-ref on every\n  operation + Postman TO-BE + ADR-003 (auth)\n- W3 BE: backend-scaffolder (controllers from OpenAPI, DTOs, services\n  with TODOs, RFC 7807 error handler) -> data-mapper (JPA entities +\n  Flyway + repositories) -> logic-translator (fan-out per UC; replaces\n  scaffolder''s UnsupportedOperationException stubs; never touches\n  AS-IS source)\n- W3 FE: frontend-scaffolder — Angular 17+ workspace, OpenAPI typed\n  client, Streamlit translations (session_state→signals etc.)\n- W4: hardening-architect — JSON logging + correlation-id, Micrometer\n  + Prometheus, OpenTelemetry, Spring Security 6 baseline, frontend\n  CSP, ADR-004/005\n- W5: migration-roadmap-builder — strangler fig with per-BC\n  milestones, rollback plans, go-live criteria, AS-IS bug carry-over\n- W6 (always ON): phase4-challenger — AS-IS↔TO-BE traceability matrix\n  + 8 adversarial checks (coverage gaps, OpenAPI↔code drift, ADR\n  completeness, AS-IS bug carry-over consistency, perf hypothesis,\n  security regression, equivalence, AS-IS-only leak in TO-BE)\n\nrefactoring-supervisor bumped to 1.0.0 (MAJOR milestone — workflow now\ncovers full AS-IS→TO-BE journey across Phases 0–4):\n- registers Phase 4 in the phase registry\n- adds the Phase 4 schematic\n- updates bootstrap detection (.refactoring-kb/, backend/, frontend/)\n- inverse drift rule documented from Phase 4 onward (target tech\n  allowed; AS-IS-only leaks forbidden without ADR)\n\nConstraints: AS-IS source code is READ-ONLY (challenger runs git\nstatus to verify); Phase 0–3 outputs read-only; OpenAPI is the single\ncontract for both BE and FE; every TO-BE artifact must declare\nrelated_ucs and related_bcs in frontmatter for traceability; never\nauto-retry on critical/high failures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c2f444e467cb21b11f267ac617f702d38f4137b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/4c2f444e467cb21b11f267ac617f702d38f4137b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/8391875c294dc60fd5d791a56e3b4661b39a6f8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose/claude-registry/commit/8391875c29