DOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/32f908e44924b91d0deba69b076ff36ab5524225/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T13:35:12Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T13:35:12Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add baseline-testing pipeline (8 agents) for Phase 3\n\nPhase 3 AS-IS Baseline Testing pipeline. Reads .indexing-kb/ + Phase 1\n+ Phase 2 and produces the regression baseline at tests/baseline/\n(pytest, fixtures, snapshots, benchmarks, optional Postman collection\nif services are exposed) plus the report at docs/analysis/03-baseline/.\nThe baseline serves as the AS-IS oracle for Phase 5 equivalence.\n\nComponents:\n- baseline-testing-supervisor (opus, entrypoint): adaptive execution\n  policy (auto-detects pytest readiness; falls back to write-only);\n  4 waves with fan-out per UC; per-step timing recap; conditional\n  Postman generation; failure policy on red tests (critical/high\n  escalate, medium/low get xfail with AS-IS bug record); never\n  modifies AS-IS source code\n- W0 (sequential): fixture-builder — conftest with seed/time/network\n  determinism + minimal/realistic/edge fixtures\n- W1 (mode-dependent): usecase-test-writer (fan-out per UC),\n  integration-test-writer (DB/FS/outbound mocked),\n  benchmark-writer (pytest-benchmark + memory),\n  service-collection-builder (conditional Postman 2.1)\n- W2 (sequential): baseline-runner — executes pytest, captures\n  snapshots/benchmark JSON/coverage; only worker permitted to add\n  xfail/skip markers\n- W3 (always ON): baseline-challenger — 7 adversarial checks\n  including AS-IS source modification detection (forbidden) and\n  Postman integrity\n\nrefactoring-supervisor bumped to 0.3.0:\n- registers Phase 3 in the phase registry\n- adds the Phase 3 schematic\n- updates bootstrap detection\n- ADDS MANDATORY EXECUTION-TIMING BLOCK in post-phase recap\n  (per-step durations from phase manifest + cumulative workflow time\n   across all phases)\n\nStrictly AS-IS — never references target technologies. Tests target\nPython + pytest only. AS-IS source code is read-only — bugs surfaced\nby baseline tests are documented in _meta/as-is-bugs-found.md and\ntests are marked xfail/skip per failure policy; never patched.\nStreamlit-aware (AppTest, session_state isolation, st.cache).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdb6862db72ec3083b2c1780796733276a893522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/fdb6862db72ec3083b2c1780796733276a893522"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/32f908e44924b91d0deba69b076ff36ab5524225","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users