ubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/commits/c64ecfdc9343c294120173a18e27c6fa30e73a82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T12:48:38Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T12:48:38Z","email":"luca.la.rosa.dev@gmail.com","name":"luke"},"message":"feat: add technical-analysis pipeline (11 agents) for Phase 2\n\nPhase 2 AS-IS Technical Analysis pipeline. Reads .indexing-kb/ (Phase 0)\nand optionally docs/analysis/01-functional/ (Phase 1) and produces a\ncomplete technical understanding at docs/analysis/02-technical/, plus\nAccenture-branded PDF and PPTX exports.\n\nComponents:\n- technical-analysis-supervisor (opus, entrypoint): adaptive dispatch\n  mode (parallel | batched | sequential) based on KB size; 3 waves +\n  parallel export wave; strict HITL with explicit overwrite\n  confirmation for existing exports\n- W1 (8 sonnet workers, parallel by default): code-quality,\n  state-runtime, dependency-security, data-access, integration,\n  performance, resilience, security\n- W2 (sequential): risk-synthesizer consolidates findings into risk\n  register MD/JSON/CSV, severity matrix, remediation backlog\n- W3 (always ON): technical-analysis-challenger performs adversarial\n  review (orphan IDs, contradictions, AS-IS violations, Streamlit\n  risks)\n- Export wave (parallel): document-creator (PDF) +\n  presentation-creator (PPTX)\n\nStrictly AS-IS — never references target technologies. Streamlit-aware.\nStable IDs: RISK-CQ, ST, VULN, DEP, RISK-DA, INT, PERF, RISK-RES, SEC,\nCHL.\n\nrefactoring-supervisor bumped to 0.2.0: registers Phase 2 in the phase\nregistry, adds the Phase 2 schematic, updates bootstrap detection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53629a557ef04de48e204d3d2d2b2fa48513dc90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/trees/53629a557ef04de48e204d3d2d2b2fa48513dc90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luketherose/claude-registry/git/commits/c64ecfdc9343c294120173a18e27c6fa30e73a82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186711793?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/luketherose","id":186711793,"login":"luketherose","node_id":"U_kgDOCyD-8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luketherose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.